<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" ?>
<tt xml:lang="en" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" ttp:profile="http://www.w3.org/TR/profile/sdp-us" >
<head>
<styling>
<style xml:id="s1" tts:textAlign="center" tts:extent="90% 90%" tts:origin="5% 5%" tts:displayAlign="after"/>
<style xml:id="s2" tts:fontSize=".72c" tts:backgroundColor="black" tts:color="white"/>
</styling>
<layout>
<region xml:id="r1" style="s1"/>
</layout>
</head>
<body region="r1">
<div>
<p begin="00:00:04.200" end="00:00:07.000" style="s2">Break the frame.</p>
<p begin="00:00:09.300" end="00:00:12.600" style="s2">Please.</p>
<p begin="00:00:10.600" end="00:00:14.410" style="s2">He sealed me in here. Break it before he</p>
<p begin="00:00:12.600" end="00:00:16.430" style="s2">comes back.</p>
<p begin="00:00:14.410" end="00:00:16.430" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:00:17.800" end="00:00:21.300" style="s2">Three weeks late.</p>
<p begin="00:00:19.600" end="00:00:22.800" style="s2">If I don&#39;t get paid today, Grandma, this</p>
<p begin="00:00:21.300" end="00:00:24.100" style="s2">is another treatment.</p>
<p begin="00:00:22.800" end="00:00:26.000" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nia.</p>
<p begin="00:00:24.100" end="00:00:29.800" style="s2">Why are your hands standing still?</p>
<p begin="00:00:26.000" end="00:00:29.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Because you still owe me $4,500.</p>
<p begin="00:00:29.900" end="00:00:33.100" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;ve discussed this.</p>
<p begin="00:00:31.200" end="00:00:34.500" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No. You talked.</p>
<p begin="00:00:33.100" end="00:00:35.900" style="s2">I waited.</p>
<p begin="00:00:34.500" end="00:00:38.600" style="s2">Yesterday&#39;s estate sale brought this</p>
<p begin="00:00:35.900" end="00:00:42.100" style="s2">warehouse $18,000 in commission. So</p>
<p begin="00:00:38.600" end="00:00:42.100" style="s2">don&#39;t tell me the company has no money.</p>
<p begin="00:00:43.200" end="00:00:47.500" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Watch your tone.</p>
<p begin="00:00:45.100" end="00:00:49.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then pay me.</p>
<p begin="00:00:47.500" end="00:00:49.800" style="s2">Wait.</p>
<p begin="00:00:53.600" end="00:00:56.300" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Do you have any idea what you just</p>
<p begin="00:00:55.000" end="00:00:58.400" style="s2">broke?</p>
<p begin="00:00:56.300" end="00:01:02.500" style="s2">A 17th century Venetian ceremonial</p>
<p begin="00:00:58.400" end="00:01:04.900" style="s2">mirror appraised at $280,000.</p>
<p begin="00:01:02.500" end="00:01:07.100" style="s2">You&#39;re paying every cent</p>
<p begin="00:01:04.900" end="00:01:08.300" style="s2">or I call the police.</p>
<p begin="00:01:07.100" end="00:01:10.740" style="s2">Let&#39;s see how well a theft and</p>
<p begin="00:01:08.300" end="00:01:12.760" style="s2">destruction charge looks on your record.</p>
<p begin="00:01:10.740" end="00:01:12.760" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:01:17.500" end="00:01:21.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Finally.</p>
<p begin="00:01:19.100" end="00:01:23.900" style="s2">That cheap resin copying was suffocating</p>
<p begin="00:01:21.600" end="00:01:23.900" style="s2">me.</p>
<p begin="00:01:26.600" end="00:01:30.800" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Sterling silver, please.</p>
<p begin="00:01:29.000" end="00:01:33.100" style="s2">I&#39;m nickel plated brass from 6 months</p>
<p begin="00:01:30.800" end="00:01:33.100" style="s2">ago.</p>
<p begin="00:01:35.100" end="00:01:38.500" style="s2">Zoom in.</p>
<p begin="00:01:36.700" end="00:01:40.500" style="s2">You&#39;ll see the inkjet dots.</p>
<p begin="00:01:38.500" end="00:01:43.400" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He soaked me in acid for 48 hours to</p>
<p begin="00:01:40.500" end="00:01:43.400" style="s2">fake this patina.</p>
<p begin="00:01:45.000" end="00:01:50.600" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Stop acting crazy.</p>
<p begin="00:01:47.300" end="00:01:50.600" style="s2">You owe me $280,000.</p>
<p begin="00:01:50.700" end="00:01:53.200" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let go.</p>
<p begin="00:01:54.400" end="00:01:58.800" style="s2">17th century, your colonial silver is</p>
<p begin="00:01:56.900" end="00:02:00.292" style="s2">plated brass. And that oil painting has</p>
<p begin="00:01:58.800" end="00:02:01.492" style="s2">printer bots in the shadows. How many</p>
<p begin="00:02:00.292" end="00:02:02.992" style="s2">fake estates have you sold through this</p>
<p begin="00:02:01.492" end="00:02:03.692" style="s2">place?</p>
<p begin="00:02:02.992" end="00:02:04.292" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You don&#39;t know what you&#39;re talking</p>
<p begin="00:02:03.692" end="00:02:05.792" style="s2">about.</p>
<p begin="00:02:04.292" end="00:02:07.692" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Call the police. Then invite an</p>
<p begin="00:02:05.792" end="00:02:09.192" style="s2">insurance investigator, too. We can all</p>
<p begin="00:02:07.692" end="00:02:13.192" style="s2">find out whether your inventory is worth</p>
<p begin="00:02:09.192" end="00:02:13.192" style="s2">millions or a prison sentence.</p>
<p begin="00:02:13.992" end="00:02:16.692" style="s2">Keep the paycheck.</p>
<p begin="00:02:19.392" end="00:02:23.292" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She walked away from $280,000 without</p>
<p begin="00:02:21.792" end="00:02:24.692" style="s2">blinking.</p>
<p begin="00:02:23.292" end="00:02:27.492" style="s2">Find out who she is.</p>
<p begin="00:02:24.692" end="00:02:27.492" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes, Mr. Cross.</p>
<p begin="00:02:27.692" end="00:02:33.192" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If this is real,</p>
<p begin="00:02:29.492" end="00:02:35.292" style="s2">then I&#39;m done being powerless. Please.</p>
<p begin="00:02:33.192" end="00:02:37.792" style="s2">Don&#39;t let them melt me down.</p>
<p begin="00:02:35.292" end="00:02:37.792" style="s2">Please.</p>
<p begin="00:02:41.892" end="00:02:45.292" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Please, get me out before that idiot</p>
<p begin="00:02:43.492" end="00:02:47.792" style="s2">melts me down.</p>
<p begin="00:02:45.292" end="00:02:49.192" style="s2">This ugly shell is camouflaged.</p>
<p begin="00:02:47.792" end="00:02:50.792" style="s2">Inside me is a royal celestial</p>
<p begin="00:02:49.192" end="00:02:52.692" style="s2">chronometer, hand-built for a crown</p>
<p begin="00:02:50.792" end="00:02:55.692" style="s2">navigator in 1786. Last auction</p>
<p begin="00:02:52.692" end="00:02:57.792" style="s2">estimate, 4.8 million.</p>
<p begin="00:02:55.692" end="00:02:58.992" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How much for this junk?</p>
<p begin="00:02:57.792" end="00:03:00.092" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Depends on which junk.</p>
<p begin="00:02:58.992" end="00:03:02.092" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This one?</p>
<p begin="00:03:00.092" end="00:03:03.192" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That isn&#39;t scrap. Old naval compass,</p>
<p begin="00:03:02.092" end="00:03:04.292" style="s2">early 19th century.</p>
<p begin="00:03:03.192" end="00:03:05.192" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Liar.</p>
<p begin="00:03:04.292" end="00:03:06.592" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You asked price.</p>
<p begin="00:03:05.192" end="00:03:07.892" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And now I&#39;m laughing at it.</p>
<p begin="00:03:06.592" end="00:03:08.792" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 25.</p>
<p begin="00:03:07.892" end="00:03:10.092" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good luck.</p>
<p begin="00:03:08.792" end="00:03:11.792" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hey, where are you going?</p>
<p begin="00:03:10.092" end="00:03:13.692" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If I turn around first, I lose.</p>
<p begin="00:03:11.792" end="00:03:15.392" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wait. 15,000.</p>
<p begin="00:03:13.692" end="00:03:16.092" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No, no, no. Don&#39;t let her go.</p>
<p begin="00:03:15.392" end="00:03:17.792" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Cash?</p>
<p begin="00:03:16.092" end="00:03:19.992" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Right now.</p>
<p begin="00:03:17.792" end="00:03:22.492" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 5,000, final.</p>
<p begin="00:03:19.992" end="00:03:23.392" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Finally, someone competent.</p>
<p begin="00:03:22.492" end="00:03:24.892" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How do I open you?</p>
<p begin="00:03:23.392" end="00:03:26.192" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Do not smash me. The inner mechanism is</p>
<p begin="00:03:24.892" end="00:03:27.292" style="s2">shock sensitive. Pry beneath the false</p>
<p begin="00:03:26.192" end="00:03:28.492" style="s2">brass ring slowly.</p>
<p begin="00:03:27.292" end="00:03:29.492" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That sounds reassuring.</p>
<p begin="00:03:28.492" end="00:03:30.392" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Restoring a watch?</p>
<p begin="00:03:29.492" end="00:03:31.092" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Something older.</p>
<p begin="00:03:30.392" end="00:03:32.292" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How much older?</p>
<p begin="00:03:31.092" end="00:03:35.692" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If I&#39;m lucky,</p>
<p begin="00:03:32.292" end="00:03:35.692" style="s2">about $4.8 million older.</p>
<p begin="00:03:36.492" end="00:03:40.292" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Isn&#39;t that from Harvey&#39;s scrap box?</p>
<p begin="00:03:38.092" end="00:03:42.592" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She paid 5,000 for that?</p>
<p begin="00:03:40.292" end="00:03:45.092" style="s2">&gt;&gt; There.</p>
<p begin="00:03:42.592" end="00:03:45.092" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Stop.</p>
<p begin="00:03:45.492" end="00:03:48.892" style="s2">I said stop.</p>
<p begin="00:03:46.692" end="00:03:51.392" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s Milham &amp; Reed. The Reed Appraisal</p>
<p begin="00:03:48.892" end="00:03:51.392" style="s2">Institute?</p>
<p begin="00:03:54.492" end="00:03:57.592" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Put the tool down.</p>
<p begin="00:03:55.992" end="00:03:59.092" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why?</p>
<p begin="00:03:57.592" end="00:04:00.492" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Because whatever you think is inside</p>
<p begin="00:03:59.092" end="00:04:02.094" style="s2">that shell,</p>
<p begin="00:04:00.492" end="00:04:06.394" style="s2">you&#39;re about to destroy it.</p>
<p begin="00:04:02.094" end="00:04:06.394" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh, this should be entertaining.</p>
<p begin="00:04:06.594" end="00:04:09.394" style="s2">Then keep watching.</p>
<p begin="00:04:10.894" end="00:04:16.294" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Put the tool down.</p>
<p begin="00:04:13.594" end="00:04:16.294" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Move your cane.</p>
<p begin="00:04:16.694" end="00:04:20.394" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Young lady, I am trying to stop you from</p>
<p begin="00:04:18.494" end="00:04:24.994" style="s2">making an expensive mistake.</p>
<p begin="00:04:20.394" end="00:04:26.894" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Expensive? He has no idea.</p>
<p begin="00:04:24.994" end="00:04:29.694" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Machine cut screws, artificial</p>
<p begin="00:04:26.894" end="00:04:31.594" style="s2">oxidation, cheap cast brass.</p>
<p begin="00:04:29.694" end="00:04:33.494" style="s2">This is a decorative reproduction made</p>
<p begin="00:04:31.594" end="00:04:33.894" style="s2">sometime in the last 30 years.</p>
<p begin="00:04:33.494" end="00:04:35.194" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I knew it.</p>
<p begin="00:04:33.894" end="00:04:37.894" style="s2">&gt;&gt; $5,000 for that?</p>
<p begin="00:04:35.194" end="00:04:40.294" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 30 years? I crossed the Atlantic before</p>
<p begin="00:04:37.894" end="00:04:41.894" style="s2">his great grandma was born.</p>
<p begin="00:04:40.294" end="00:04:44.494" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You write about one thing.</p>
<p begin="00:04:41.894" end="00:04:45.794" style="s2">This shell is modern.</p>
<p begin="00:04:44.494" end="00:04:47.194" style="s2">But you never asked why someone would</p>
<p begin="00:04:45.794" end="00:04:49.594" style="s2">build a fake shell around something</p>
<p begin="00:04:47.194" end="00:04:49.594" style="s2">else.</p>
<p begin="00:04:49.694" end="00:04:53.394" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Something else?</p>
<p begin="00:04:51.694" end="00:04:57.494" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Exactly.</p>
<p begin="00:04:53.394" end="00:04:57.494" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Enough. You paid $5,000.</p>
<p begin="00:04:58.028" end="00:05:02.094" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:04:59.694" end="00:05:03.994" style="s2">I&#39;ll give you $6,500. You recover your</p>
<p begin="00:05:02.094" end="00:05:04.794" style="s2">loss and make 1,500. Walk away while you</p>
<p begin="00:05:03.994" end="00:05:05.694" style="s2">still can.</p>
<p begin="00:05:04.794" end="00:05:08.094" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Take it.</p>
<p begin="00:05:05.694" end="00:05:10.094" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Reed is saving you from yourself.</p>
<p begin="00:05:08.094" end="00:05:11.994" style="s2">&gt;&gt; $6,500?</p>
<p begin="00:05:10.094" end="00:05:13.694" style="s2">Girl, sell it. You already robbed me at</p>
<p begin="00:05:11.994" end="00:05:15.694" style="s2">5,000.</p>
<p begin="00:05:13.694" end="00:05:16.694" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="00:05:15.694" end="00:05:18.694" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Excuse me?</p>
<p begin="00:05:16.694" end="00:05:20.794" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I said no.</p>
<p begin="00:05:18.694" end="00:05:22.694" style="s2">I didn&#39;t spend $5,000 so a stranger</p>
<p begin="00:05:20.794" end="00:05:24.394" style="s2">could congratulate himself for rescuing</p>
<p begin="00:05:22.694" end="00:05:26.394" style="s2">me.</p>
<p begin="00:05:24.394" end="00:05:28.294" style="s2">Keep your charity.</p>
<p begin="00:05:26.394" end="00:05:30.794" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Charity?</p>
<p begin="00:05:28.294" end="00:05:33.294" style="s2">Do you even know who you&#39;re speaking to?</p>
<p begin="00:05:30.794" end="00:05:35.194" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She really doesn&#39;t know Malcolm Reed?</p>
<p begin="00:05:33.294" end="00:05:37.994" style="s2">He&#39;s authenticated museum collections</p>
<p begin="00:05:35.194" end="00:05:40.194" style="s2">for 30 years.</p>
<p begin="00:05:37.994" end="00:05:42.394" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A man standing between me and something</p>
<p begin="00:05:40.194" end="00:05:43.894" style="s2">I legally bought</p>
<p begin="00:05:42.394" end="00:05:46.494" style="s2">then 30 years should have taught him to</p>
<p begin="00:05:43.894" end="00:05:46.494" style="s2">look twice.</p>
<p begin="00:05:49.494" end="00:05:54.594" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fine. If there is a genuine 18th century</p>
<p begin="00:05:51.494" end="00:05:56.194" style="s2">royal mechanism inside this object,</p>
<p begin="00:05:54.594" end="00:05:58.894" style="s2">I will publicly resign from the Reed</p>
<p begin="00:05:56.194" end="00:06:00.594" style="s2">Appraisal Institute.</p>
<p begin="00:05:58.894" end="00:06:03.894" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Deal.</p>
<p begin="00:06:00.594" end="00:06:03.894" style="s2">3 mm deeper.</p>
<p begin="00:06:07.459" end="00:06:09.479" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [groaning]</p>
<p begin="00:06:15.995" end="00:06:18.195" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wait.</p>
<p begin="00:06:18.595" end="00:06:23.495" style="s2">That enamel pattern.</p>
<p begin="00:06:20.895" end="00:06:25.895" style="s2">Where did you get this?</p>
<p begin="00:06:23.495" end="00:06:28.795" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You wanted to watch?</p>
<p begin="00:06:25.895" end="00:06:28.795" style="s2">Then keep watching.</p>
<p begin="00:06:32.995" end="00:06:36.195" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t move.</p>
<p begin="00:06:34.695" end="00:06:39.095" style="s2">What the hell is that?</p>
<p begin="00:06:36.195" end="00:06:41.795" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Royal celestial chronometer no. 7</p>
<p begin="00:06:39.095" end="00:06:42.895" style="s2">commissioned in 1786 for Admiral Edmund</p>
<p begin="00:06:41.795" end="00:06:44.595" style="s2">Vale.</p>
<p begin="00:06:42.895" end="00:06:46.759" style="s2">Six were lost at sea.</p>
<p begin="00:06:44.595" end="00:06:48.779" style="s2">I am the last one.</p>
<p begin="00:06:46.759" end="00:06:48.779" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:06:49.095" end="00:06:53.695" style="s2">&gt;&gt; May I?</p>
<p begin="00:06:51.295" end="00:06:53.695" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Carefully.</p>
<p begin="00:06:55.895" end="00:07:01.495" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hand fired cobalt enamel.</p>
<p begin="00:06:58.195" end="00:07:03.695" style="s2">18th century micro gear work.</p>
<p begin="00:07:01.495" end="00:07:04.495" style="s2">The Vale crown mark.</p>
<p begin="00:07:03.695" end="00:07:06.195" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Reed?</p>
<p begin="00:07:04.495" end="00:07:07.295" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is it real?</p>
<p begin="00:07:06.195" end="00:07:08.895" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s real.</p>
<p begin="00:07:07.295" end="00:07:11.195" style="s2">Not only real,</p>
<p begin="00:07:08.895" end="00:07:13.195" style="s2">museum grade.</p>
<p begin="00:07:11.195" end="00:07:15.995" style="s2">The last confirmed private estimate for</p>
<p begin="00:07:13.195" end="00:07:19.195" style="s2">a comparable royal celestial chronometer</p>
<p begin="00:07:15.995" end="00:07:20.495" style="s2">was $4.8 million.</p>
<p begin="00:07:19.195" end="00:07:22.395" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You paid 5,000.</p>
<p begin="00:07:20.495" end="00:07:24.095" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 5,000 into almost 5 million?</p>
<p begin="00:07:22.395" end="00:07:24.695" style="s2">&gt;&gt; NO, THAT&#39;S MINE. I DIDN&#39;T KNOW WHAT WAS</p>
<p begin="00:07:24.095" end="00:07:25.695" style="s2">INSIDE.</p>
<p begin="00:07:24.695" end="00:07:26.895" style="s2">&gt;&gt; THAT SOUNDS LIKE YOUR PROBLEM.</p>
<p begin="00:07:25.695" end="00:07:29.095" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;M CANCELING THE SALE.</p>
<p begin="00:07:26.895" end="00:07:31.495" style="s2">&gt;&gt; DON&#39;T. You name the price, I paid cash,</p>
<p begin="00:07:29.095" end="00:07:32.695" style="s2">you handed it to me.</p>
<p begin="00:07:31.495" end="00:07:33.595" style="s2">The deal ended the moment the money</p>
<p begin="00:07:32.695" end="00:07:34.695" style="s2">changed hand.</p>
<p begin="00:07:33.595" end="00:07:35.595" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You tricked me.</p>
<p begin="00:07:34.695" end="00:07:37.295" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="00:07:35.595" end="00:07:38.895" style="s2">You underestimated what you owned.</p>
<p begin="00:07:37.295" end="00:07:39.995" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Reed, tell her.</p>
<p begin="00:07:38.895" end="00:07:41.995" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She&#39;s right.</p>
<p begin="00:07:39.995" end="00:07:43.395" style="s2">A completed cash sale is final. You</p>
<p begin="00:07:41.995" end="00:07:44.795" style="s2">don&#39;t get to reclaim an object simply</p>
<p begin="00:07:43.395" end="00:07:45.695" style="s2">because you discovered its real value</p>
<p begin="00:07:44.795" end="00:07:47.695" style="s2">too late.</p>
<p begin="00:07:45.695" end="00:07:49.095" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Everyone here heard my wager. I judged</p>
<p begin="00:07:47.695" end="00:07:50.695" style="s2">the shell, she questioned what was</p>
<p begin="00:07:49.095" end="00:07:53.895" style="s2">hidden beneath it. I was wrong,</p>
<p begin="00:07:50.695" end="00:07:55.295" style="s2">completely wrong. Miss Carter,</p>
<p begin="00:07:53.895" end="00:07:56.695" style="s2">today your judgment was better than</p>
<p begin="00:07:55.295" end="00:07:57.595" style="s2">mine. I will resign.</p>
<p begin="00:07:56.695" end="00:07:59.295" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="00:07:57.595" end="00:08:01.595" style="s2">Being wrong once doesn&#39;t erase 30 years</p>
<p begin="00:07:59.295" end="00:08:02.795" style="s2">of experience. But maybe next time,</p>
<p begin="00:08:01.595" end="00:08:03.995" style="s2">listen before you decide you already</p>
<p begin="00:08:02.795" end="00:08:05.095" style="s2">know everything.</p>
<p begin="00:08:03.995" end="00:08:06.895" style="s2">&gt;&gt; There&#39;s a private collection auction</p>
<p begin="00:08:05.095" end="00:08:08.597" style="s2">tonight, invitation only. Collectors,</p>
<p begin="00:08:06.895" end="00:08:09.697" style="s2">museum trustees, family offices, and</p>
<p begin="00:08:08.597" end="00:08:12.697" style="s2">people who spend millions without</p>
<p begin="00:08:09.697" end="00:08:15.297" style="s2">blinking. You belong in that room.</p>
<p begin="00:08:12.697" end="00:08:18.197" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Welcome, Miss Carter.</p>
<p begin="00:08:15.297" end="00:08:19.797" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s her. Mia Carter, 27, restoration</p>
<p begin="00:08:18.197" end="00:08:22.197" style="s2">worker until this morning. And this</p>
<p begin="00:08:19.797" end="00:08:23.497" style="s2">afternoon, she turned $5,000 into nearly</p>
<p begin="00:08:22.197" end="00:08:25.897" style="s2">$5 million.</p>
<p begin="00:08:23.497" end="00:08:27.797" style="s2">So she wasn&#39;t lucky once.</p>
<p begin="00:08:25.897" end="00:08:29.097" style="s2">Let see what she notices next.</p>
<p begin="00:08:27.797" end="00:08:31.097" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Finally,</p>
<p begin="00:08:29.097" end="00:08:32.497" style="s2">someone who can hear me. The black layer</p>
<p begin="00:08:31.097" end="00:08:35.097" style="s2">is protecting the masterpiece</p>
<p begin="00:08:32.497" end="00:08:35.097" style="s2">underneath.</p>
<p begin="00:08:39.197" end="00:08:43.597" style="s2">Finally,</p>
<p begin="00:08:40.397" end="00:08:43.597" style="s2">someone who can hear me.</p>
<p begin="00:08:44.297" end="00:08:48.597" style="s2">Don&#39;t scrape the black layer and don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:08:46.397" end="00:08:49.297" style="s2">let those idiots restore me.</p>
<p begin="00:08:48.597" end="00:08:51.497" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why?</p>
<p begin="00:08:49.297" end="00:08:53.597" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Because the fire didn&#39;t destroy me. It</p>
<p begin="00:08:51.497" end="00:08:55.297" style="s2">hid me.</p>
<p begin="00:08:53.597" end="00:08:57.097" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Excuse me. Are you part of the</p>
<p begin="00:08:55.297" end="00:08:58.297" style="s2">restoration staff?</p>
<p begin="00:08:57.097" end="00:09:01.297" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="00:08:58.297" end="00:09:02.997" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh, my mistake.</p>
<p begin="00:09:01.297" end="00:09:04.197" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then who invited you?</p>
<p begin="00:09:02.997" end="00:09:05.297" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is that important?</p>
<p begin="00:09:04.197" end="00:09:07.397" style="s2">&gt;&gt; In this room?</p>
<p begin="00:09:05.297" end="00:09:09.597" style="s2">Very. Museum trustees,</p>
<p begin="00:09:07.397" end="00:09:10.697" style="s2">billion-dollar collectors, old families.</p>
<p begin="00:09:09.597" end="00:09:11.697" style="s2">People don&#39;t just wander in off the</p>
<p begin="00:09:10.697" end="00:09:13.197" style="s2">street.</p>
<p begin="00:09:11.697" end="00:09:15.997" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Adrian,</p>
<p begin="00:09:13.197" end="00:09:15.997" style="s2">don&#39;t embarrass her.</p>
<p begin="00:09:16.297" end="00:09:19.997" style="s2">If you came here hoping to find work,</p>
<p begin="00:09:18.497" end="00:09:21.397" style="s2">I could ask the manager.</p>
<p begin="00:09:19.997" end="00:09:22.597" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s generous.</p>
<p begin="00:09:21.397" end="00:09:23.897" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I try.</p>
<p begin="00:09:22.597" end="00:09:25.397" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then help yourself.</p>
<p begin="00:09:23.897" end="00:09:27.197" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That 18th-century French silver ewer you</p>
<p begin="00:09:25.397" end="00:09:28.497" style="s2">were admiring 5 minutes ago? Wrong lid.</p>
<p begin="00:09:27.197" end="00:09:29.797" style="s2">Late 19th-century replacement and the</p>
<p begin="00:09:28.497" end="00:09:30.397" style="s2">handle was resoldered twice.</p>
<p begin="00:09:29.797" end="00:09:31.297" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re making that up.</p>
<p begin="00:09:30.397" end="00:09:33.397" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ask the catalog team.</p>
<p begin="00:09:31.297" end="00:09:34.897" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is she right? The lid is indeed a later</p>
<p begin="00:09:33.397" end="00:09:37.797" style="s2">replacement and the handle underwent two</p>
<p begin="00:09:34.897" end="00:09:37.797" style="s2">documented repairs.</p>
<p begin="00:09:39.797" end="00:09:42.597" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Cross.</p>
<p begin="00:09:42.697" end="00:09:46.097" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Miss Carter.</p>
<p begin="00:09:44.897" end="00:09:48.797" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Do I know you?</p>
<p begin="00:09:46.097" end="00:09:50.097" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You asked who invited her. I did.</p>
<p begin="00:09:48.797" end="00:09:51.597" style="s2">You.</p>
<p begin="00:09:50.097" end="00:09:54.897" style="s2">This is my auction</p>
<p begin="00:09:51.597" end="00:09:54.897" style="s2">and Miss Carter is my guest.</p>
<p begin="00:09:55.497" end="00:09:59.597" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I can finish my own conversations.</p>
<p begin="00:09:57.897" end="00:10:01.497" style="s2">You wanted to know why I&#39;m here?</p>
<p begin="00:09:59.597" end="00:10:05.097" style="s2">Because I was invited for what I know,</p>
<p begin="00:10:01.497" end="00:10:05.097" style="s2">not for the last name I was born with.</p>
<p begin="00:10:06.997" end="00:10:11.298" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Interesting. Very.</p>
<p begin="00:10:09.997" end="00:10:13.698" style="s2">Forget her.</p>
<p begin="00:10:11.298" end="00:10:15.898" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Listen carefully. Tomorrow they&#39;ll strip</p>
<p begin="00:10:13.698" end="00:10:18.398" style="s2">away the burnt surface. Isn&#39;t that what</p>
<p begin="00:10:15.898" end="00:10:19.898" style="s2">restoration is supposed to do? No, the</p>
<p begin="00:10:18.398" end="00:10:23.098" style="s2">black layer is protecting the</p>
<p begin="00:10:19.898" end="00:10:23.098" style="s2">masterpiece underneath.</p>
<p begin="00:10:24.798" end="00:10:28.498" style="s2">Buy me before they destroy me.</p>
<p begin="00:10:29.898" end="00:10:32.598" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Next lot.</p>
<p begin="00:10:37.498" end="00:10:40.298" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Trust me.</p>
<p begin="00:10:42.398" end="00:10:46.998" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lot 17.</p>
<p begin="00:10:44.198" end="00:10:48.898" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Do not let them take me away.</p>
<p begin="00:10:46.998" end="00:10:50.898" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A fire damaged European devotional</p>
<p begin="00:10:48.898" end="00:10:52.498" style="s2">folding scribe. Dating is believed to be</p>
<p begin="00:10:50.898" end="00:10:53.898" style="s2">late Renaissance period, although</p>
<p begin="00:10:52.498" end="00:10:57.398" style="s2">extensive damage prevents full</p>
<p begin="00:10:53.898" end="00:10:58.398" style="s2">authentication. Starting bid, $1,000.</p>
<p begin="00:10:57.398" end="00:11:00.998" style="s2">1,000?</p>
<p begin="00:10:58.398" end="00:11:03.198" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nia, raise your hand.</p>
<p begin="00:11:00.998" end="00:11:03.998" style="s2">10,000.</p>
<p begin="00:11:03.198" end="00:11:06.298" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So?</p>
<p begin="00:11:03.998" end="00:11:07.398" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She wants it, then let&#39;s see how badly.</p>
<p begin="00:11:06.298" end="00:11:09.298" style="s2">50,000.</p>
<p begin="00:11:07.398" end="00:11:10.998" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 50,000 from bidder 17.</p>
<p begin="00:11:09.298" end="00:11:12.898" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 100,000.</p>
<p begin="00:11:10.998" end="00:11:15.298" style="s2">200,000.</p>
<p begin="00:11:12.898" end="00:11:17.598" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Celeste, you don&#39;t even want that thing.</p>
<p begin="00:11:15.298" end="00:11:17.598" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know.</p>
<p begin="00:11:18.198" end="00:11:21.398" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t chase her.</p>
<p begin="00:11:19.698" end="00:11:23.498" style="s2">If she&#39;s bidding emotionally, let her</p>
<p begin="00:11:21.398" end="00:11:25.598" style="s2">have it.</p>
<p begin="00:11:23.498" end="00:11:27.498" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Trust me.</p>
<p begin="00:11:25.598" end="00:11:28.598" style="s2">500,000.</p>
<p begin="00:11:27.498" end="00:11:29.998" style="s2">1 million. [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:11:28.598" end="00:11:31.498" style="s2">&gt;&gt; For burnt wood?</p>
<p begin="00:11:29.998" end="00:11:33.498" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m curious</p>
<p begin="00:11:31.498" end="00:11:36.598" style="s2">how much Miss Carter is willing to waste</p>
<p begin="00:11:33.498" end="00:11:36.598" style="s2">proving she belongs here.</p>
<p begin="00:11:39.198" end="00:11:42.998" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Should we stop the bidding?</p>
<p begin="00:11:41.798" end="00:11:46.098" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="00:11:42.998" end="00:11:47.698" style="s2">She knows exactly what Celeste is doing.</p>
<p begin="00:11:46.098" end="00:11:49.398" style="s2">I want to see what she chooses.</p>
<p begin="00:11:47.698" end="00:11:52.498" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The painting beneath me has not seen</p>
<p begin="00:11:49.398" end="00:11:54.798" style="s2">light in 400 years.</p>
<p begin="00:11:52.498" end="00:11:55.898" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 3 million.</p>
<p begin="00:11:54.798" end="00:11:58.698" style="s2">It&#39;s yours.</p>
<p begin="00:11:55.898" end="00:12:00.598" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 3 million once. 3 million twice. 3</p>
<p begin="00:11:58.698" end="00:12:01.998" style="s2">million sold.</p>
<p begin="00:12:00.598" end="00:12:03.898" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 3 million for firewood?</p>
<p begin="00:12:01.998" end="00:12:06.298" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You just destroyed</p>
<p begin="00:12:03.898" end="00:12:07.898" style="s2">Congratulations. You just paid $3</p>
<p begin="00:12:06.298" end="00:12:10.298" style="s2">million for something the restoration</p>
<p begin="00:12:07.898" end="00:12:11.799" style="s2">department may throw away tomorrow.</p>
<p begin="00:12:10.298" end="00:12:13.799" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I hope Malcolm&#39;s invitation was worth</p>
<p begin="00:12:11.799" end="00:12:15.599" style="s2">it.</p>
<p begin="00:12:13.799" end="00:12:16.899" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What&#39;s funny?</p>
<p begin="00:12:15.599" end="00:12:18.699" style="s2">Nothing.</p>
<p begin="00:12:16.899" end="00:12:20.299" style="s2">just hope you stay for the reveal.</p>
<p begin="00:12:18.699" end="00:12:21.399" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We can remove the burnt layer here if</p>
<p begin="00:12:20.299" end="00:12:24.999" style="s2">you want.</p>
<p begin="00:12:21.399" end="00:12:27.299" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nobody touches it. Distilled water.</p>
<p begin="00:12:24.999" end="00:12:28.899" style="s2">What are you planning to do?</p>
<p begin="00:12:27.299" end="00:12:31.499" style="s2">You all think I paid $3 million for</p>
<p begin="00:12:28.899" end="00:12:32.899" style="s2">burnt trash? So watch carefully.</p>
<p begin="00:12:31.499" end="00:12:35.699" style="s2">I&#39;m about to show you what $3 million</p>
<p begin="00:12:32.899" end="00:12:35.699" style="s2">actually bought.</p>
<p begin="00:12:37.699" end="00:12:41.199" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No less than $40 million.</p>
<p begin="00:12:41.899" end="00:12:44.599" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Go ahead.</p>
<p begin="00:12:43.099" end="00:12:46.299" style="s2">&gt;&gt; At least give us a good show before you</p>
<p begin="00:12:44.599" end="00:12:48.799" style="s2">ruin it completely.</p>
<p begin="00:12:46.299" end="00:12:48.799" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Slowly.</p>
<p begin="00:12:50.099" end="00:12:53.699" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Miss Carter, stop. Water could destroy</p>
<p begin="00:12:52.099" end="00:12:55.399" style="s2">whatever pigment remains.</p>
<p begin="00:12:53.699" end="00:12:58.299" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Watch the surface.</p>
<p begin="00:12:55.399" end="00:12:58.299" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nia, are you certain?</p>
<p begin="00:12:58.899" end="00:13:01.199" style="s2">Wait.</p>
<p begin="00:13:01.699" end="00:13:05.899" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh my god.</p>
<p begin="00:13:04.199" end="00:13:08.199" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This isn&#39;t char.</p>
<p begin="00:13:05.899" end="00:13:09.699" style="s2">Protective resin mixed with scud.</p>
<p begin="00:13:08.199" end="00:13:10.499" style="s2">Someone deliberately coated the entire</p>
<p begin="00:13:09.699" end="00:13:13.499" style="s2">surface.</p>
<p begin="00:13:10.499" end="00:13:13.499" style="s2">&gt;&gt; To hide what was underneath.</p>
<p begin="00:13:21.899" end="00:13:26.899" style="s2">400 years.</p>
<p begin="00:13:23.599" end="00:13:26.899" style="s2">I can finally breathe again.</p>
<p begin="00:13:27.499" end="00:13:30.399" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Light.</p>
<p begin="00:13:28.699" end="00:13:31.999" style="s2">Matteo Bellori, what would something</p>
<p begin="00:13:30.399" end="00:13:34.899" style="s2">like this be worth</p>
<p begin="00:13:31.999" end="00:13:37.799" style="s2">if the remaining panels are intact?</p>
<p begin="00:13:34.899" end="00:13:39.099" style="s2">No less than $40 million.</p>
<p begin="00:13:37.799" end="00:13:41.499" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 40 million?</p>
<p begin="00:13:39.099" end="00:13:43.599" style="s2">She paid three.</p>
<p begin="00:13:41.499" end="00:13:44.999" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No. This is ridiculous. Anyone could</p>
<p begin="00:13:43.599" end="00:13:45.599" style="s2">paint over an old screen and fake a</p>
<p begin="00:13:44.999" end="00:13:46.899" style="s2">signature.</p>
<p begin="00:13:45.599" end="00:13:49.299" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Miss Whitmer,</p>
<p begin="00:13:46.899" end="00:13:51.199" style="s2">gold leaf oxidation, pigment aging, and</p>
<p begin="00:13:49.299" end="00:13:53.599" style="s2">craquelure cannot be manufactured</p>
<p begin="00:13:51.199" end="00:13:55.399" style="s2">overnight.</p>
<p begin="00:13:53.599" end="00:13:56.699" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You were right about one thing.</p>
<p begin="00:13:55.399" end="00:13:57.999" style="s2">I really did come here to broaden my</p>
<p begin="00:13:56.699" end="00:13:59.699" style="s2">horizons,</p>
<p begin="00:13:57.999" end="00:14:01.099" style="s2">mostly by watching people underestimate</p>
<p begin="00:13:59.699" end="00:14:02.799" style="s2">what&#39;s right in front of them.</p>
<p begin="00:14:01.099" end="00:14:04.799" style="s2">&gt;&gt; First the chronometer, now a lost</p>
<p begin="00:14:02.799" end="00:14:08.899" style="s2">Bellori. That&#39;s twice in one day.</p>
<p begin="00:14:04.799" end="00:14:08.899" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No. Twice means it&#39;s not luck anymore.</p>
<p begin="00:14:10.499" end="00:14:13.099" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Grandfather?</p>
<p begin="00:14:13.999" end="00:14:16.299" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="00:14:16.701" end="00:14:20.001" style="s2">That face.</p>
<p begin="00:14:18.101" end="00:14:21.701" style="s2">It can&#39;t be.</p>
<p begin="00:14:20.001" end="00:14:23.401" style="s2">That face.</p>
<p begin="00:14:21.701" end="00:14:26.001" style="s2">It can&#39;t be.</p>
<p begin="00:14:23.401" end="00:14:28.001" style="s2">&gt;&gt; At last, you finally found your way</p>
<p begin="00:14:26.001" end="00:14:29.201" style="s2">back.</p>
<p begin="00:14:28.001" end="00:14:30.501" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That face.</p>
<p begin="00:14:29.201" end="00:14:32.201" style="s2">It can&#39;t be.</p>
<p begin="00:14:30.501" end="00:14:34.801" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Grandfather, why did you come all the</p>
<p begin="00:14:32.201" end="00:14:35.745" style="s2">way here? The doctor told you to rest.</p>
<p begin="00:14:34.801" end="00:14:37.765" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Move.</p>
<p begin="00:14:35.745" end="00:14:37.765" style="s2">[panting]</p>
<p begin="00:14:38.401" end="00:14:40.301" style="s2">What is your name?</p>
<p begin="00:14:39.501" end="00:14:42.401" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mia Carter.</p>
<p begin="00:14:40.301" end="00:14:44.201" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Carter. May I look at you?</p>
<p begin="00:14:42.401" end="00:14:46.501" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re already looking?</p>
<p begin="00:14:44.201" end="00:14:49.501" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You look exactly like my wife</p>
<p begin="00:14:46.501" end="00:14:49.501" style="s2">when she was your age.</p>
<p begin="00:14:50.501" end="00:14:53.501" style="s2">Eleanor,</p>
<p begin="00:14:52.001" end="00:14:56.101" style="s2">my wife.</p>
<p begin="00:14:53.501" end="00:14:57.101" style="s2">&gt;&gt; At last, you finally found your way</p>
<p begin="00:14:56.101" end="00:14:59.401" style="s2">back.</p>
<p begin="00:14:57.101" end="00:15:02.301" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You can talk, too.</p>
<p begin="00:14:59.401" end="00:15:04.601" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Listen carefully, child. You are not Mia</p>
<p begin="00:15:02.301" end="00:15:08.001" style="s2">Carter by birth. You were born into the</p>
<p begin="00:15:04.601" end="00:15:10.101" style="s2">Whitmore bloodline 22 years ago. You</p>
<p begin="00:15:08.001" end="00:15:11.301" style="s2">disappeared. You are the child they</p>
<p begin="00:15:10.101" end="00:15:12.201" style="s2">never found.</p>
<p begin="00:15:11.301" end="00:15:14.001" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="00:15:12.201" end="00:15:16.701" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You were taken from this family when you</p>
<p begin="00:15:14.001" end="00:15:16.701" style="s2">were five.</p>
<p begin="00:15:18.301" end="00:15:22.801" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Augustus searched for you for 22 years.</p>
<p begin="00:15:21.701" end="00:15:25.001" style="s2">He never stopped.</p>
<p begin="00:15:22.801" end="00:15:26.201" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Grandfather, this is absurd. Plenty of</p>
<p begin="00:15:25.001" end="00:15:28.101" style="s2">people resemble each other.</p>
<p begin="00:15:26.201" end="00:15:30.601" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Celeste is right. A face proves nothing.</p>
<p begin="00:15:28.101" end="00:15:30.601" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Enough.</p>
<p begin="00:15:31.401" end="00:15:34.901" style="s2">Mr. Whitmore,</p>
<p begin="00:15:33.001" end="00:15:37.401" style="s2">if you believe she is family,</p>
<p begin="00:15:34.901" end="00:15:40.701" style="s2">prove it.</p>
<p begin="00:15:37.401" end="00:15:41.801" style="s2">&gt;&gt; DNA test tonight. My blood,</p>
<p begin="00:15:40.701" end="00:15:43.701" style="s2">her blood,</p>
<p begin="00:15:41.801" end="00:15:45.001" style="s2">independent laboratory, no family</p>
<p begin="00:15:43.701" end="00:15:47.701" style="s2">pressure,</p>
<p begin="00:15:45.001" end="00:15:47.701" style="s2">no secrets.</p>
<p begin="00:15:48.101" end="00:15:52.301" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He is telling the truth.</p>
<p begin="00:15:50.101" end="00:15:54.101" style="s2">You are his granddaughter</p>
<p begin="00:15:52.301" end="00:15:56.601" style="s2">and the true lost daughter of this</p>
<p begin="00:15:54.101" end="00:15:56.601" style="s2">family.</p>
<p begin="00:15:57.601" end="00:16:02.001" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re [snorts] saying</p>
<p begin="00:15:59.101" end="00:16:02.001" style="s2">I&#39;m a Whitmore?</p>
<p begin="00:16:03.201" end="00:16:08.001" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your kinship analysis is complete. The</p>
<p begin="00:16:05.301" end="00:16:09.901" style="s2">tested samples show a 99.99%</p>
<p begin="00:16:08.001" end="00:16:12.001" style="s2">biological</p>
<p begin="00:16:09.901" end="00:16:14.401" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Come home with me.</p>
<p begin="00:16:12.001" end="00:16:15.801" style="s2">If you really are my granddaughter,</p>
<p begin="00:16:14.401" end="00:16:17.901" style="s2">you should not spend another night away</p>
<p begin="00:16:15.801" end="00:16:17.902" style="s2">from your family.</p>
<p begin="00:16:17.901" end="00:16:19.402" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You</p>
<p begin="00:16:17.902" end="00:16:21.402" style="s2">&gt;&gt; said if.</p>
<p begin="00:16:19.402" end="00:16:23.102" style="s2">So prove it first. Grandfather is</p>
<p begin="00:16:21.402" end="00:16:26.502" style="s2">already emotional enough.</p>
<p begin="00:16:23.102" end="00:16:26.502" style="s2">Do you really need to make this so cold?</p>
<p begin="00:16:27.702" end="00:16:32.502" style="s2">I met him 10 minutes ago.</p>
<p begin="00:16:29.902" end="00:16:33.802" style="s2">And I met you 5 minutes before that.</p>
<p begin="00:16:32.502" end="00:16:35.702" style="s2">You&#39;re asking me to call strangers</p>
<p begin="00:16:33.802" end="00:16:36.902" style="s2">family because a face looks familiar? I</p>
<p begin="00:16:35.702" end="00:16:38.202" style="s2">don&#39;t work that way.</p>
<p begin="00:16:36.902" end="00:16:40.302" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Do you understand how many people would</p>
<p begin="00:16:38.202" end="00:16:43.002" style="s2">give anything to be a Whitman?</p>
<p begin="00:16:40.302" end="00:16:44.502" style="s2">This is a family matter cross.</p>
<p begin="00:16:43.002" end="00:16:45.602" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then let her decide whether it is her</p>
<p begin="00:16:44.502" end="00:16:46.902" style="s2">family matter.</p>
<p begin="00:16:45.602" end="00:16:48.902" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She is right.</p>
<p begin="00:16:46.902" end="00:16:51.502" style="s2">No assumptions, no pressure, only</p>
<p begin="00:16:48.902" end="00:16:51.502" style="s2">evidence.</p>
<p begin="00:16:52.502" end="00:16:55.502" style="s2">Ms. Carter?</p>
<p begin="00:16:53.602" end="00:16:58.502" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Independent lab.</p>
<p begin="00:16:55.502" end="00:16:58.502" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Whichever one you choose.</p>
<p begin="00:16:59.502" end="00:17:02.902" style="s2">You okay?</p>
<p begin="00:17:00.602" end="00:17:04.802" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Of course.</p>
<p begin="00:17:02.902" end="00:17:06.402" style="s2">&gt;&gt; At least let me arrange a hotel.</p>
<p begin="00:17:04.802" end="00:17:07.702" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I have somewhere to go and someone</p>
<p begin="00:17:06.402" end="00:17:11.402" style="s2">waiting for me.</p>
<p begin="00:17:07.702" end="00:17:13.302" style="s2">When the result comes back, call me.</p>
<p begin="00:17:11.402" end="00:17:15.902" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re late. Long day?</p>
<p begin="00:17:13.302" end="00:17:17.702" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Did you eat?</p>
<p begin="00:17:15.902" end="00:17:20.102" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Someone told me tonight</p>
<p begin="00:17:17.702" end="00:17:22.702" style="s2">that I may have another family.</p>
<p begin="00:17:20.102" end="00:17:24.402" style="s2">A very rich one, apparently.</p>
<p begin="00:17:22.702" end="00:17:27.602" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And what did you tell them?</p>
<p begin="00:17:24.402" end="00:17:27.602" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That I already have a family.</p>
<p begin="00:17:28.502" end="00:17:34.502" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If they are your blood,</p>
<p begin="00:17:30.702" end="00:17:34.502" style="s2">you deserve to know where you came from.</p>
<p begin="00:17:35.602" end="00:17:41.702" style="s2">But knowing where you came from</p>
<p begin="00:17:38.102" end="00:17:41.702" style="s2">doesn&#39;t decide where you belong.</p>
<p begin="00:17:48.202" end="00:17:51.202" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This is Mia Carter?</p>
<p begin="00:17:49.302" end="00:17:53.202" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ms. Carter, your kinship analysis is</p>
<p begin="00:17:51.202" end="00:17:54.902" style="s2">complete. The tested samples show a</p>
<p begin="00:17:53.202" end="00:17:56.902" style="s2">99.99%</p>
<p begin="00:17:54.902" end="00:17:58.802" style="s2">biologically family match. Augustus</p>
<p begin="00:17:56.902" end="00:18:00.402" style="s2">Whitwheel is biologically related to you</p>
<p begin="00:17:58.802" end="00:18:02.102" style="s2">as your grandfather.</p>
<p begin="00:18:00.402" end="00:18:04.402" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Because this house has been waiting for</p>
<p begin="00:18:02.102" end="00:18:06.502" style="s2">its real daughter.</p>
<p begin="00:18:04.402" end="00:18:09.002" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Augustus Whitman is biologically related</p>
<p begin="00:18:06.502" end="00:18:10.402" style="s2">to you as your grandfather.</p>
<p begin="00:18:09.002" end="00:18:12.702" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re certain?</p>
<p begin="00:18:10.402" end="00:18:14.502" style="s2">&gt;&gt; There is no reasonable doubt.</p>
<p begin="00:18:12.702" end="00:18:16.102" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s true.</p>
<p begin="00:18:14.502" end="00:18:18.602" style="s2">22 years.</p>
<p begin="00:18:16.102" end="00:18:20.603" style="s2">They were looking for me for 22 years.</p>
<p begin="00:18:18.602" end="00:18:23.803" style="s2">And I was less than an away.</p>
<p begin="00:18:20.603" end="00:18:23.803" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then go ask them why.</p>
<p begin="00:18:26.703" end="00:18:28.903" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nina.</p>
<p begin="00:18:29.203" end="00:18:31.603" style="s2">May I?</p>
<p begin="00:18:34.167" end="00:18:36.187" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:18:37.203" end="00:18:43.003" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She&#39;s really ours?</p>
<p begin="00:18:39.503" end="00:18:43.003" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The DNA is conclusive.</p>
<p begin="00:18:44.003" end="00:18:47.003" style="s2">You have your mother&#39;s eyes.</p>
<p begin="00:18:51.603" end="00:18:54.403" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So</p>
<p begin="00:18:52.703" end="00:18:56.303" style="s2">it&#39;s confirmed.</p>
<p begin="00:18:54.403" end="00:18:58.403" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Call the family attorney</p>
<p begin="00:18:56.303" end="00:19:00.203" style="s2">and contact the press office. Tonight we</p>
<p begin="00:18:58.403" end="00:19:00.703" style="s2">announce that my granddaughter has come</p>
<p begin="00:19:00.203" end="00:19:02.703" style="s2">home.</p>
<p begin="00:19:00.703" end="00:19:03.503" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad, wait. An announcement tonight is</p>
<p begin="00:19:02.703" end="00:19:05.403" style="s2">too fast.</p>
<p begin="00:19:03.503" end="00:19:06.603" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Too fast? The board has not been</p>
<p begin="00:19:05.403" end="00:19:09.903" style="s2">prepared.</p>
<p begin="00:19:06.603" end="00:19:11.703" style="s2">Investors will ask questions.</p>
<p begin="00:19:09.903" end="00:19:13.303" style="s2">A previously unknown biological daughter</p>
<p begin="00:19:11.703" end="00:19:14.903" style="s2">suddenly appearing</p>
<p begin="00:19:13.303" end="00:19:16.303" style="s2">could destabilize the family trust.</p>
<p begin="00:19:14.903" end="00:19:17.503" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And Celeste,</p>
<p begin="00:19:16.303" end="00:19:19.903" style="s2">she has been our daughter for more than</p>
<p begin="00:19:17.503" end="00:19:21.303" style="s2">20 years. The media cannot suddenly make</p>
<p begin="00:19:19.903" end="00:19:23.203" style="s2">her look like an imposter.</p>
<p begin="00:19:21.303" end="00:19:23.903" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, I&#39;m fine. Nina should have what</p>
<p begin="00:19:23.203" end="00:19:25.103" style="s2">belongs to her.</p>
<p begin="00:19:23.903" end="00:19:25.503" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This is not about taking anything away</p>
<p begin="00:19:25.103" end="00:19:27.203" style="s2">from you.</p>
<p begin="00:19:25.503" end="00:19:28.903" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The child we lost has come home and</p>
<p begin="00:19:27.203" end="00:19:30.103" style="s2">you&#39;re discussing stock prices?</p>
<p begin="00:19:28.903" end="00:19:31.003" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I am protecting the family.</p>
<p begin="00:19:30.103" end="00:19:32.103" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="00:19:31.003" end="00:19:33.603" style="s2">You&#39;re protecting the version of the</p>
<p begin="00:19:32.103" end="00:19:34.503" style="s2">family that existed before I walked</p>
<p begin="00:19:33.603" end="00:19:36.803" style="s2">through that door.</p>
<p begin="00:19:34.503" end="00:19:39.003" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nina, please understand.</p>
<p begin="00:19:36.803" end="00:19:39.903" style="s2">Come home first. Let us get to know each</p>
<p begin="00:19:39.003" end="00:19:41.603" style="s2">other.</p>
<p begin="00:19:39.903" end="00:19:43.503" style="s2">And for now,</p>
<p begin="00:19:41.603" end="00:19:45.103" style="s2">we keep your identity private.</p>
<p begin="00:19:43.503" end="00:19:46.903" style="s2">&gt;&gt; For how long?</p>
<p begin="00:19:45.103" end="00:19:49.303" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Until the timing is right.</p>
<p begin="00:19:46.903" end="00:19:49.303" style="s2">&gt;&gt; For who?</p>
<p begin="00:19:54.203" end="00:19:58.103" style="s2">22 years?</p>
<p begin="00:19:56.103" end="00:19:59.803" style="s2">Why did you have to come back now?</p>
<p begin="00:19:58.103" end="00:20:01.603" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Because this house has been waiting for</p>
<p begin="00:19:59.803" end="00:20:04.703" style="s2">its real daughter.</p>
<p begin="00:20:01.603" end="00:20:08.303" style="s2">&gt;&gt; For 22 years that daughter was me.</p>
<p begin="00:20:04.703" end="00:20:08.303" style="s2">I don&#39;t care what the DNA says.</p>
<p begin="00:20:09.903" end="00:20:13.003" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s everything?</p>
<p begin="00:20:10.803" end="00:20:14.703" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It was enough before yesterday.</p>
<p begin="00:20:13.003" end="00:20:15.503" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If you want, you can restore the</p>
<p begin="00:20:14.703" end="00:20:17.303" style="s2">Whitmore name.</p>
<p begin="00:20:15.503" end="00:20:18.703" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Not yet, but that is your real family</p>
<p begin="00:20:17.303" end="00:20:19.403" style="s2">name. Carter is the name of the woman</p>
<p begin="00:20:18.703" end="00:20:21.903" style="s2">who raised me.</p>
<p begin="00:20:19.403" end="00:20:24.605" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then Carter it is.</p>
<p begin="00:20:21.903" end="00:20:24.605" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll show her the room.</p>
<p begin="00:20:27.805" end="00:20:31.605" style="s2">You should know something.</p>
<p begin="00:20:29.705" end="00:20:32.705" style="s2">This family already has a daughter. I</p>
<p begin="00:20:31.605" end="00:20:35.705" style="s2">noticed.</p>
<p begin="00:20:32.705" end="00:20:38.005" style="s2">For 22 years, that daughter was me.</p>
<p begin="00:20:35.705" end="00:20:40.405" style="s2">I don&#39;t care what the DNA says.</p>
<p begin="00:20:38.005" end="00:20:42.605" style="s2">I was here when grandfather got sick. I</p>
<p begin="00:20:40.405" end="00:20:44.805" style="s2">was here for birthdays. I was here for</p>
<p begin="00:20:42.605" end="00:20:47.505" style="s2">every family crisis.</p>
<p begin="00:20:44.805" end="00:20:49.405" style="s2">You don&#39;t get to walk in after 22 years</p>
<p begin="00:20:47.505" end="00:20:50.505" style="s2">and take everything because of blood.</p>
<p begin="00:20:49.405" end="00:20:51.505" style="s2">Good.</p>
<p begin="00:20:50.505" end="00:20:53.005" style="s2">Because I didn&#39;t come here to take</p>
<p begin="00:20:51.505" end="00:20:54.705" style="s2">anything from you. But if something</p>
<p begin="00:20:53.005" end="00:20:56.205" style="s2">actually belongs to me, I won&#39;t give it</p>
<p begin="00:20:54.705" end="00:20:59.805" style="s2">up just to make you comfortable either.</p>
<p begin="00:20:56.205" end="00:21:01.305" style="s2">Then we understand each other perfectly.</p>
<p begin="00:20:59.805" end="00:21:03.705" style="s2">Mom had these prepared for you. I</p>
<p begin="00:21:01.305" end="00:21:05.105" style="s2">already have clothes. Those? One last</p>
<p begin="00:21:03.705" end="00:21:06.705" style="s2">piece of advice. Don&#39;t confuse</p>
<p begin="00:21:05.105" end="00:21:09.405" style="s2">grandfather&#39;s guilt with love. People</p>
<p begin="00:21:06.705" end="00:21:09.405" style="s2">get over guilt.</p>
<p begin="00:21:09.805" end="00:21:13.105" style="s2">Hey, over here.</p>
<p begin="00:21:14.705" end="00:21:18.105" style="s2">Finally.</p>
<p begin="00:21:15.905" end="00:21:19.905" style="s2">You know me? Of course I do. This room</p>
<p begin="00:21:18.105" end="00:21:22.505" style="s2">used to be yours. Your grandmother kept</p>
<p begin="00:21:19.905" end="00:21:24.305" style="s2">me here for 22 years. But listen,</p>
<p begin="00:21:22.505" end="00:21:26.205" style="s2">someone was in here before you arrived.</p>
<p begin="00:21:24.305" end="00:21:27.905" style="s2">Who? The blonde girl. She searched the</p>
<p begin="00:21:26.205" end="00:21:29.705" style="s2">drawers, opened the closet, and hid</p>
<p begin="00:21:27.905" end="00:21:31.305" style="s2">something under your pillow.</p>
<p begin="00:21:29.705" end="00:21:32.205" style="s2">Finally.</p>
<p begin="00:21:31.305" end="00:21:33.805" style="s2">Who brought you?</p>
<p begin="00:21:32.205" end="00:21:37.205" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You stole it.</p>
<p begin="00:21:33.805" end="00:21:37.205" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mia, why?</p>
<p begin="00:21:38.005" end="00:21:42.605" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That wasn&#39;t there this morning.</p>
<p begin="00:21:40.105" end="00:21:44.205" style="s2">Did she touch it? With gloves.</p>
<p begin="00:21:42.605" end="00:21:46.105" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mrs. Whitewood, the Emerald Legacy</p>
<p begin="00:21:44.205" end="00:21:50.205" style="s2">necklace is missing.</p>
<p begin="00:21:46.105" end="00:21:52.205" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Of course. She&#39;s setting you up. I know.</p>
<p begin="00:21:50.205" end="00:21:53.205" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That necklace belonged to Eleanor.</p>
<p begin="00:21:52.205" end="00:21:55.305" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who had access?</p>
<p begin="00:21:53.205" end="00:21:56.705" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Family members, myself,</p>
<p begin="00:21:55.305" end="00:21:57.905" style="s2">and Miss Carter was given temporary</p>
<p begin="00:21:56.705" end="00:21:58.705" style="s2">access yesterday.</p>
<p begin="00:21:57.905" end="00:22:00.505" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mia?</p>
<p begin="00:21:58.705" end="00:22:02.105" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t jump to conclusions.</p>
<p begin="00:22:00.505" end="00:22:03.205" style="s2">Mia just came home.</p>
<p begin="00:22:02.105" end="00:22:04.805" style="s2">She probably doesn&#39;t even know what the</p>
<p begin="00:22:03.205" end="00:22:06.705" style="s2">necklace is worth.</p>
<p begin="00:22:04.805" end="00:22:08.005" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That makes it worse.</p>
<p begin="00:22:06.705" end="00:22:09.205" style="s2">Someone desperate for money might take</p>
<p begin="00:22:08.005" end="00:22:12.005" style="s2">something without understanding how</p>
<p begin="00:22:09.205" end="00:22:13.105" style="s2">traceable it is.</p>
<p begin="00:22:12.005" end="00:22:15.505" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Miss Carter?</p>
<p begin="00:22:13.105" end="00:22:17.705" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Come in.</p>
<p begin="00:22:15.505" end="00:22:18.605" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A family heirloom is missing. The</p>
<p begin="00:22:17.705" end="00:22:19.905" style="s2">Emerald necklace?</p>
<p begin="00:22:18.605" end="00:22:21.605" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How do you know it&#39;s missing?</p>
<p begin="00:22:19.905" end="00:22:23.505" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I heard the staff outside.</p>
<p begin="00:22:21.605" end="00:22:24.805" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Convenient. Mia, we need to search the</p>
<p begin="00:22:23.505" end="00:22:27.005" style="s2">room.</p>
<p begin="00:22:24.805" end="00:22:27.306" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Go ahead.</p>
<p begin="00:22:27.005" end="00:22:28.006" style="s2">You haven&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:22:27.306" end="00:22:28.306" style="s2">&gt;&gt; checked there.</p>
<p begin="00:22:28.006" end="00:22:31.306" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nia.</p>
<p begin="00:22:28.306" end="00:22:33.506" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If we&#39;re searching, search properly.</p>
<p begin="00:22:31.306" end="00:22:33.506" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Madam.</p>
<p begin="00:22:33.806" end="00:22:36.306" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My God.</p>
<p begin="00:22:34.706" end="00:22:38.306" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You stole it.</p>
<p begin="00:22:36.306" end="00:22:39.606" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nia, why?</p>
<p begin="00:22:38.306" end="00:22:41.506" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You were welcomed into this house</p>
<p begin="00:22:39.606" end="00:22:43.706" style="s2">yesterday, and today you steal</p>
<p begin="00:22:41.506" end="00:22:45.306" style="s2">grandmother&#39;s necklace?</p>
<p begin="00:22:43.706" end="00:22:46.906" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If you needed money,</p>
<p begin="00:22:45.306" end="00:22:50.506" style="s2">you could have asked.</p>
<p begin="00:22:46.906" end="00:22:50.506" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You think I stole this because I&#39;m poor?</p>
<p begin="00:22:51.206" end="00:22:55.406" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We found it under Nia&#39;s pillow.</p>
<p begin="00:22:52.906" end="00:22:57.206" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What is going on?</p>
<p begin="00:22:55.406" end="00:22:58.706" style="s2">Did you take it?</p>
<p begin="00:22:57.206" end="00:23:00.506" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="00:22:58.706" end="00:23:02.506" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then I believe you. Finding something in</p>
<p begin="00:23:00.506" end="00:23:04.906" style="s2">a room proves location. It does not</p>
<p begin="00:23:02.506" end="00:23:06.506" style="s2">prove who put it there.</p>
<p begin="00:23:04.906" end="00:23:07.706" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Finally.</p>
<p begin="00:23:06.506" end="00:23:11.006" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who brought you?</p>
<p begin="00:23:07.706" end="00:23:13.706" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I did not walk here by myself. Perfume,</p>
<p begin="00:23:11.006" end="00:23:15.106" style="s2">white jasmine.</p>
<p begin="00:23:13.706" end="00:23:16.606" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Interesting.</p>
<p begin="00:23:15.106" end="00:23:17.506" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You finally asked.</p>
<p begin="00:23:16.606" end="00:23:18.906" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What did you see?</p>
<p begin="00:23:17.506" end="00:23:21.706" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Not her face.</p>
<p begin="00:23:18.906" end="00:23:21.706" style="s2">The reflection.</p>
<p begin="00:23:22.306" end="00:23:26.706" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That scent.</p>
<p begin="00:23:25.006" end="00:23:27.906" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why are you staring at her?</p>
<p begin="00:23:26.706" end="00:23:29.906" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Thinking.</p>
<p begin="00:23:27.906" end="00:23:31.406" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Did you notice something?</p>
<p begin="00:23:29.906" end="00:23:33.206" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Not enough.</p>
<p begin="00:23:31.406" end="00:23:35.406" style="s2">A perfume can be copied, a necklace can</p>
<p begin="00:23:33.206" end="00:23:38.706" style="s2">be planted, a room can be entered. I</p>
<p begin="00:23:35.406" end="00:23:38.706" style="s2">want the access log for this door.</p>
<p begin="00:23:40.706" end="00:23:44.106" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You were in her room?</p>
<p begin="00:23:42.306" end="00:23:46.306" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Of course. I was helping prepare it for</p>
<p begin="00:23:44.106" end="00:23:47.706" style="s2">her. She came alone. I checked the</p>
<p begin="00:23:46.306" end="00:23:49.106" style="s2">closet, made sure the room was ready.</p>
<p begin="00:23:47.706" end="00:23:50.006" style="s2">She was trying to help.</p>
<p begin="00:23:49.106" end="00:23:50.606" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then there should be nothing to worry</p>
<p begin="00:23:50.006" end="00:23:53.006" style="s2">about.</p>
<p begin="00:23:50.606" end="00:23:54.506" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Exactly.</p>
<p begin="00:23:53.006" end="00:23:56.606" style="s2">You finally asked.</p>
<p begin="00:23:54.506" end="00:23:58.106" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What did you see?</p>
<p begin="00:23:56.606" end="00:24:00.806" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Not her face.</p>
<p begin="00:23:58.106" end="00:24:00.806" style="s2">The reflection.</p>
<p begin="00:24:03.506" end="00:24:06.806" style="s2">She carried something green in. She did</p>
<p begin="00:24:05.506" end="00:24:07.906" style="s2">not carry it out.</p>
<p begin="00:24:06.806" end="00:24:09.006" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Where was the necklace kept?</p>
<p begin="00:24:07.906" end="00:24:10.306" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The East Collection Vault.</p>
<p begin="00:24:09.006" end="00:24:10.806" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I go into the collection room all the</p>
<p begin="00:24:10.306" end="00:24:11.906" style="s2">time.</p>
<p begin="00:24:10.806" end="00:24:14.306" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That proves nothing.</p>
<p begin="00:24:11.906" end="00:24:16.706" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re right. 10:56 Celeste entered the</p>
<p begin="00:24:14.306" end="00:24:17.906" style="s2">collection vault. 11:48 she entered my</p>
<p begin="00:24:16.706" end="00:24:19.206" style="s2">room alone.</p>
<p begin="00:24:17.906" end="00:24:21.806" style="s2">The necklace disappeared between those</p>
<p begin="00:24:19.206" end="00:24:23.706" style="s2">two times. And an old silver frame saw</p>
<p begin="00:24:21.806" end="00:24:24.906" style="s2">someone carry a green velvet box into my</p>
<p begin="00:24:23.706" end="00:24:26.306" style="s2">room.</p>
<p begin="00:24:24.906" end="00:24:28.506" style="s2">The hallway reflection confirms the</p>
<p begin="00:24:26.306" end="00:24:30.207" style="s2">movement.</p>
<p begin="00:24:28.506" end="00:24:31.707" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So that&#39;s it?</p>
<p begin="00:24:30.207" end="00:24:33.408" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;ve been here one day and now you&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:24:31.707" end="00:24:35.307" style="s2">accusing me of theft, mom?</p>
<p begin="00:24:33.408" end="00:24:37.307" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nia, this is going too far.</p>
<p begin="00:24:35.307" end="00:24:38.707" style="s2">&gt;&gt; There&#39;s still no direct proof.</p>
<p begin="00:24:37.307" end="00:24:39.107" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then we find it.</p>
<p begin="00:24:38.707" end="00:24:42.507" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad?</p>
<p begin="00:24:39.107" end="00:24:42.507" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No one is burying this.</p>
<p begin="00:24:42.607" end="00:24:46.307" style="s2">Restore the deleted hallway footage.</p>
<p begin="00:24:49.307" end="00:24:51.307" style="s2">There&#39;s a gap.</p>
<p begin="00:24:50.307" end="00:24:52.607" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How long?</p>
<p begin="00:24:51.307" end="00:24:53.908" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 11 minutes.</p>
<p begin="00:24:52.607" end="00:24:56.507" style="s2">But the cloud backup may still be</p>
<p begin="00:24:53.908" end="00:24:56.507" style="s2">recoverable.</p>
<p begin="00:24:57.908" end="00:25:00.807" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You should hope it isn&#39;t.</p>
<p begin="00:25:06.408" end="00:25:08.807" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Got it.</p>
<p begin="00:25:15.032" end="00:25:17.052" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:25:17.707" end="00:25:20.207" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Play it again.</p>
<p begin="00:25:19.007" end="00:25:21.607" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That doesn&#39;t prove it was me.</p>
<p begin="00:25:20.207" end="00:25:23.107" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Exactly. You can&#39;t even see your face.</p>
<p begin="00:25:21.607" end="00:25:24.707" style="s2">&gt;&gt; There are maids with blonde hair, guests</p>
<p begin="00:25:23.107" end="00:25:26.507" style="s2">who wear similar clothes.</p>
<p begin="00:25:24.707" end="00:25:28.707" style="s2">And they all have your access card. Same</p>
<p begin="00:25:26.507" end="00:25:30.507" style="s2">time, same door, same access, and a</p>
<p begin="00:25:28.707" end="00:25:32.507" style="s2">jewelry box goes in but never comes back</p>
<p begin="00:25:30.507" end="00:25:34.507" style="s2">out.</p>
<p begin="00:25:32.507" end="00:25:36.307" style="s2">I did go into Nia&#39;s room, but I never</p>
<p begin="00:25:34.507" end="00:25:38.408" style="s2">planted that necklace. I swear.</p>
<p begin="00:25:36.307" end="00:25:40.207" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Celeste, tell us what happened.</p>
<p begin="00:25:38.408" end="00:25:41.607" style="s2">&gt;&gt; There is still no direct footage of</p>
<p begin="00:25:40.207" end="00:25:42.007" style="s2">Celeste placing the necklace under the</p>
<p begin="00:25:41.607" end="00:25:43.007" style="s2">pillow.</p>
<p begin="00:25:42.007" end="00:25:44.607" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Are you serious?</p>
<p begin="00:25:43.007" end="00:25:48.507" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m being rational. The necklace has</p>
<p begin="00:25:44.607" end="00:25:48.507" style="s2">been recovered. No real damage was done.</p>
<p begin="00:25:48.607" end="00:25:52.507" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No damage?</p>
<p begin="00:25:50.207" end="00:25:54.107" style="s2">Your son called me a thief.</p>
<p begin="00:25:52.507" end="00:25:55.707" style="s2">Your wife assumed I stole because I</p>
<p begin="00:25:54.107" end="00:25:58.408" style="s2">needed money.</p>
<p begin="00:25:55.707" end="00:26:01.007" style="s2">Everyone searched my room.</p>
<p begin="00:25:58.408" end="00:26:02.507" style="s2">Tell me which part of that was nothing.</p>
<p begin="00:26:01.007" end="00:26:04.307" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nia,</p>
<p begin="00:26:02.507" end="00:26:06.408" style="s2">we are trying to rebuild this family. If</p>
<p begin="00:26:04.307" end="00:26:09.607" style="s2">Celeste made some foolish mistake, can</p>
<p begin="00:26:06.408" end="00:26:09.607" style="s2">we deal with it privately?</p>
<p begin="00:26:09.707" end="00:26:13.807" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let me understand.</p>
<p begin="00:26:11.408" end="00:26:15.707" style="s2">I was framed, my room was searched, I</p>
<p begin="00:26:13.807" end="00:26:16.908" style="s2">was called a thief, and somehow I&#39;m the</p>
<p begin="00:26:15.707" end="00:26:17.607" style="s2">one being asked to make peace?</p>
<p begin="00:26:16.908" end="00:26:18.707" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s not what I meant.</p>
<p begin="00:26:17.607" end="00:26:19.507" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It is exactly what you meant.</p>
<p begin="00:26:18.707" end="00:26:21.307" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Enough!</p>
<p begin="00:26:19.507" end="00:26:22.707" style="s2">She was lost for 22 years. She returns</p>
<p begin="00:26:21.307" end="00:26:24.107" style="s2">home and within two days she is framed</p>
<p begin="00:26:22.707" end="00:26:25.507" style="s2">for theft and your solution is to tell</p>
<p begin="00:26:24.107" end="00:26:26.707" style="s2">her to be understanding?</p>
<p begin="00:26:25.507" end="00:26:28.307" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I heard you had an unpleasant first</p>
<p begin="00:26:26.707" end="00:26:29.507" style="s2">night at the Whitmore house. If you ever</p>
<p begin="00:26:28.307" end="00:26:32.908" style="s2">decide you want to build something that</p>
<p begin="00:26:29.507" end="00:26:33.109" style="s2">belongs to you, call me.</p>
<p begin="00:26:32.908" end="00:26:33.909" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That</p>
<p begin="00:26:33.109" end="00:26:36.909" style="s2">&gt;&gt; crest.</p>
<p begin="00:26:33.909" end="00:26:36.909" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Order of Saint Aurelius.</p>
<p begin="00:26:37.509" end="00:26:40.109" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Cross is expecting you.</p>
<p begin="00:26:38.809" end="00:26:40.709" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good, because I&#39;m not here asking for a</p>
<p begin="00:26:40.109" end="00:26:42.309" style="s2">favor.</p>
<p begin="00:26:40.709" end="00:26:43.709" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Special collections consultant. You</p>
<p begin="00:26:42.309" end="00:26:45.509" style="s2">evaluate acquisitions before Cross</p>
<p begin="00:26:43.709" end="00:26:47.009" style="s2">Capital buys. No fixed hours, full</p>
<p begin="00:26:45.509" end="00:26:47.609" style="s2">access to our private archives.</p>
<p begin="00:26:47.009" end="00:26:49.409" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Salary?</p>
<p begin="00:26:47.609" end="00:26:50.109" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 200,000 a year.</p>
<p begin="00:26:49.409" end="00:26:51.709" style="s2">Too low?</p>
<p begin="00:26:50.109" end="00:26:52.809" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wrong structure. I don&#39;t want a salary.</p>
<p begin="00:26:51.709" end="00:26:54.509" style="s2">You can keep paying whether I&#39;m right or</p>
<p begin="00:26:52.809" end="00:26:55.409" style="s2">wrong. You want my judgment? Pay for my</p>
<p begin="00:26:54.509" end="00:26:56.309" style="s2">judgment.</p>
<p begin="00:26:55.409" end="00:26:57.009" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What do you propose?</p>
<p begin="00:26:56.309" end="00:26:58.709" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Test me.</p>
<p begin="00:26:57.009" end="00:26:59.009" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You already found two major pieces in 24</p>
<p begin="00:26:58.709" end="00:27:00.509" style="s2">hours.</p>
<p begin="00:26:59.009" end="00:27:01.609" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And people can still call that luck.</p>
<p begin="00:27:00.509" end="00:27:03.109" style="s2">Give me something I&#39;ve never seen. No</p>
<p begin="00:27:01.609" end="00:27:04.309" style="s2">background, no seller history. If I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="00:27:03.109" end="00:27:06.009" style="s2">wrong, I leave. If I&#39;m right, we</p>
<p begin="00:27:04.309" end="00:27:08.209" style="s2">negotiate my real rate.</p>
<p begin="00:27:06.009" end="00:27:10.109" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Deal. Private European collection. All</p>
<p begin="00:27:08.209" end="00:27:11.409" style="s2">three are cataloged as late 16th century</p>
<p begin="00:27:10.109" end="00:27:12.509" style="s2">devotional pendants.</p>
<p begin="00:27:11.409" end="00:27:13.709" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And you believe that?</p>
<p begin="00:27:12.509" end="00:27:14.909" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Our team does.</p>
<p begin="00:27:13.709" end="00:27:16.409" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then one of us is about to have a bad</p>
<p begin="00:27:14.909" end="00:27:18.709" style="s2">morning.</p>
<p begin="00:27:16.409" end="00:27:20.209" style="s2">Modern casting, uniform micro bubbles,</p>
<p begin="00:27:18.709" end="00:27:22.709" style="s2">artificial wear that stops inside the</p>
<p begin="00:27:20.209" end="00:27:25.209" style="s2">recesses, maybe 30 years old. Not my</p>
<p begin="00:27:22.709" end="00:27:26.009" style="s2">chain. Pendant is period, the chain</p>
<p begin="00:27:25.209" end="00:27:26.709" style="s2">isn&#39;t.</p>
<p begin="00:27:26.009" end="00:27:28.509" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why?</p>
<p begin="00:27:26.709" end="00:27:30.709" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Laser soldering and the gold purity</p>
<p begin="00:27:28.509" end="00:27:32.309" style="s2">doesn&#39;t match.</p>
<p begin="00:27:30.709" end="00:27:33.309" style="s2">I crossed the sea inside a dead man&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:27:32.309" end="00:27:34.309" style="s2">coat.</p>
<p begin="00:27:33.309" end="00:27:37.209" style="s2">Light.</p>
<p begin="00:27:34.309" end="00:27:38.309" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That one has the weakest market appeal.</p>
<p begin="00:27:37.209" end="00:27:40.109" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That crest.</p>
<p begin="00:27:38.309" end="00:27:41.709" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Order of Saint Aurelius. Only 12</p>
<p begin="00:27:40.109" end="00:27:44.109" style="s2">documented pendants were commissioned.</p>
<p begin="00:27:41.709" end="00:27:44.809" style="s2">11 are in museum collections.</p>
<p begin="00:27:44.109" end="00:27:47.009" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She&#39;s right.</p>
<p begin="00:27:44.809" end="00:27:47.809" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This is number 12.</p>
<p begin="00:27:47.009" end="00:27:49.709" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your rate?</p>
<p begin="00:27:47.809" end="00:27:52.609" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No annual salary, retainer plus success</p>
<p begin="00:27:49.709" end="00:27:54.309" style="s2">fee. 100,000 monthly retainer and 3% of</p>
<p begin="00:27:52.609" end="00:27:55.409" style="s2">any value I recover or protect above</p>
<p begin="00:27:54.309" end="00:27:56.709" style="s2">your internal estimate.</p>
<p begin="00:27:55.409" end="00:27:58.109" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 3% is expensive.</p>
<p begin="00:27:56.709" end="00:27:59.209" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So is being wrong.</p>
<p begin="00:27:58.109" end="00:28:01.509" style="s2">You almost bought a modern fake at</p>
<p begin="00:27:59.209" end="00:28:03.209" style="s2">Renaissance prices and almost unvalued a</p>
<p begin="00:28:01.509" end="00:28:04.709" style="s2">museum grade relic. You&#39;re not paying me</p>
<p begin="00:28:03.209" end="00:28:06.309" style="s2">for the hours, you&#39;re paying me for the</p>
<p begin="00:28:04.709" end="00:28:07.509" style="s2">mistake you don&#39;t make.</p>
<p begin="00:28:06.309" end="00:28:08.609" style="s2">My conclusion, stay independent.</p>
<p begin="00:28:07.509" end="00:28:09.409" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Agreed. Welcome to Cross.</p>
<p begin="00:28:08.609" end="00:28:10.709" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t make me regret it.</p>
<p begin="00:28:09.409" end="00:28:11.309" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mia, I&#39;m back now.</p>
<p begin="00:28:10.709" end="00:28:12.409" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What happened?</p>
<p begin="00:28:11.309" end="00:28:14.309" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your grandfather collapsed. The doctors</p>
<p begin="00:28:12.409" end="00:28:16.509" style="s2">don&#39;t know what&#39;s wrong. Getting worse.</p>
<p begin="00:28:14.309" end="00:28:18.709" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Seven days. The old man has seven days</p>
<p begin="00:28:16.509" end="00:28:18.709" style="s2">left.</p>
<p begin="00:28:25.609" end="00:28:29.309" style="s2">&gt;&gt; His blood pressure keeps dropping. What</p>
<p begin="00:28:27.209" end="00:28:31.909" style="s2">did the doctors find? Nothing.</p>
<p begin="00:28:29.309" end="00:28:32.509" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No stroke, no heart attack, no internal</p>
<p begin="00:28:31.909" end="00:28:33.110" style="s2">bleeding.</p>
<p begin="00:28:32.509" end="00:28:34.210" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then why can&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:28:33.110" end="00:28:36.710" style="s2">&gt;&gt; conscious?</p>
<p begin="00:28:34.210" end="00:28:36.710" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t know.</p>
<p begin="00:28:41.510" end="00:28:45.710" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Six days,</p>
<p begin="00:28:43.110" end="00:28:48.410" style="s2">23 hours.</p>
<p begin="00:28:45.710" end="00:28:49.110" style="s2">He gave me decades. Now I&#39;m taking them</p>
<p begin="00:28:48.410" end="00:28:50.610" style="s2">back.</p>
<p begin="00:28:49.110" end="00:28:51.510" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Stop the clock.</p>
<p begin="00:28:50.610" end="00:28:53.610" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What?</p>
<p begin="00:28:51.510" end="00:28:55.310" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That clock. Stop it now.</p>
<p begin="00:28:53.610" end="00:28:56.310" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m not talking about the antique. I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="00:28:55.310" end="00:28:58.110" style="s2">talking about him.</p>
<p begin="00:28:56.310" end="00:28:59.710" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What does the clock have to do with Dad?</p>
<p begin="00:28:58.110" end="00:29:01.010" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How long has it been in this room?</p>
<p begin="00:28:59.710" end="00:29:02.310" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Since before I was born.</p>
<p begin="00:29:01.010" end="00:29:02.810" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mr. Whitlock inherited it from his</p>
<p begin="00:29:02.310" end="00:29:04.410" style="s2">father.</p>
<p begin="00:29:02.810" end="00:29:05.710" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And when did he start getting weaker?</p>
<p begin="00:29:04.410" end="00:29:07.710" style="s2">&gt;&gt; About 6 weeks ago.</p>
<p begin="00:29:05.710" end="00:29:08.710" style="s2">&gt;&gt; When was the clock last repaired?</p>
<p begin="00:29:07.710" end="00:29:11.010" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 6 weeks ago.</p>
<p begin="00:29:08.710" end="00:29:12.810" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That proves nothing. Grandfather is 74.</p>
<p begin="00:29:11.010" end="00:29:14.810" style="s2">People get sick. Then explain why every</p>
<p begin="00:29:12.810" end="00:29:17.310" style="s2">time that pendulum moves, his heart rate</p>
<p begin="00:29:14.810" end="00:29:17.310" style="s2">drops.</p>
<p begin="00:29:20.410" end="00:29:23.610" style="s2">&gt;&gt; His pressure is stabilizing.</p>
<p begin="00:29:26.210" end="00:29:31.710" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You can stop my hands,</p>
<p begin="00:29:28.610" end="00:29:34.910" style="s2">but you cannot stop the debt.</p>
<p begin="00:29:31.710" end="00:29:34.910" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What the hell is that thing?</p>
<p begin="00:29:40.910" end="00:29:43.910" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This clock has been feeding on this</p>
<p begin="00:29:42.110" end="00:29:45.510" style="s2">family for generations.</p>
<p begin="00:29:43.910" end="00:29:48.210" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Can you stop it?</p>
<p begin="00:29:45.510" end="00:29:49.710" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 7 days was generous.</p>
<p begin="00:29:48.210" end="00:29:51.910" style="s2">Move me,</p>
<p begin="00:29:49.710" end="00:29:53.110" style="s2">and he dies faster.</p>
<p begin="00:29:51.910" end="00:29:54.510" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nobody touches that clock.</p>
<p begin="00:29:53.110" end="00:29:56.810" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You just said it&#39;s killing him.</p>
<p begin="00:29:54.510" end="00:29:58.010" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It is. But he&#39;s moving blindly to finish</p>
<p begin="00:29:56.810" end="00:30:00.610" style="s2">the job.</p>
<p begin="00:29:58.010" end="00:30:03.010" style="s2">&gt;&gt; When the seventh mark turns black, his</p>
<p begin="00:30:00.610" end="00:30:05.410" style="s2">time is mine.</p>
<p begin="00:30:03.010" end="00:30:07.510" style="s2">6 days and getting shorter.</p>
<p begin="00:30:05.410" end="00:30:08.310" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Move him out of this room.</p>
<p begin="00:30:07.510" end="00:30:09.510" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He&#39;s unstable.</p>
<p begin="00:30:08.310" end="00:30:10.710" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then stabilize him somewhere else.</p>
<p begin="00:30:09.510" end="00:30:12.110" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You think leaving the room will help?</p>
<p begin="00:30:10.710" end="00:30:13.410" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We know the clock is affecting him.</p>
<p begin="00:30:12.110" end="00:30:15.210" style="s2">Distance is the safest thing we can test</p>
<p begin="00:30:13.410" end="00:30:18.410" style="s2">without touching it. We&#39;re out of time.</p>
<p begin="00:30:15.210" end="00:30:18.410" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad, we&#39;re right here.</p>
<p begin="00:30:19.510" end="00:30:23.310" style="s2">&gt;&gt; His heart rate is improving.</p>
<p begin="00:30:21.810" end="00:30:25.610" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Run.</p>
<p begin="00:30:23.310" end="00:30:29.510" style="s2">Take him anywhere you like.</p>
<p begin="00:30:25.610" end="00:30:30.610" style="s2">He still belongs to me.</p>
<p begin="00:30:29.510" end="00:30:34.010" style="s2">&gt;&gt; DAD,</p>
<p begin="00:30:30.610" end="00:30:35.310" style="s2">MOVE BACK. WE&#39;RE LOSING HIM.</p>
<p begin="00:30:34.010" end="00:30:37.110" style="s2">&gt;&gt; STABILIZING AGAIN?</p>
<p begin="00:30:35.310" end="00:30:37.312" style="s2">&gt;&gt; THEY WON&#39;T let him leave.</p>
<p begin="00:30:37.110" end="00:30:38.012" style="s2">Then we</p>
<p begin="00:30:37.312" end="00:30:39.212" style="s2">&gt;&gt; move the clock.</p>
<p begin="00:30:38.012" end="00:30:40.212" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No, you heard what it said yourself.</p>
<p begin="00:30:39.212" end="00:30:41.412" style="s2">Moving it could make him worse. That</p>
<p begin="00:30:40.212" end="00:30:41.812" style="s2">clock has been in this family for over a</p>
<p begin="00:30:41.412" end="00:30:43.012" style="s2">century.</p>
<p begin="00:30:41.812" end="00:30:43.512" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You doing nothing is already killing</p>
<p begin="00:30:43.012" end="00:30:44.712" style="s2">him.</p>
<p begin="00:30:43.512" end="00:30:45.712" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Exactly. And how many Whitmans died</p>
<p begin="00:30:44.712" end="00:30:46.612" style="s2">beside it?</p>
<p begin="00:30:45.712" end="00:30:47.212" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t touch it.</p>
<p begin="00:30:46.612" end="00:30:48.512" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Move.</p>
<p begin="00:30:47.212" end="00:30:49.612" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Grandfather treasures that clock. You</p>
<p begin="00:30:48.512" end="00:30:50.412" style="s2">don&#39;t get to destroy family history</p>
<p begin="00:30:49.612" end="00:30:51.512" style="s2">because of some theory.</p>
<p begin="00:30:50.412" end="00:30:53.612" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It isn&#39;t a theory anymore. You all</p>
<p begin="00:30:51.512" end="00:30:55.212" style="s2">watched it happen. Nia, please. You came</p>
<p begin="00:30:53.612" end="00:30:56.312" style="s2">into this family less than a week ago.</p>
<p begin="00:30:55.212" end="00:30:57.512" style="s2">Since then there&#39;s been theft,</p>
<p begin="00:30:56.312" end="00:30:59.012" style="s2">accusations, and now this.</p>
<p begin="00:30:57.512" end="00:31:01.112" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Celeste.</p>
<p begin="00:30:59.012" end="00:31:02.212" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m just scared. Say it.</p>
<p begin="00:31:01.112" end="00:31:02.712" style="s2">You think this started because I came</p>
<p begin="00:31:02.212" end="00:31:03.612" style="s2">back?</p>
<p begin="00:31:02.712" end="00:31:04.512" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I didn&#39;t say that.</p>
<p begin="00:31:03.612" end="00:31:06.112" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This isn&#39;t about you.</p>
<p begin="00:31:04.512" end="00:31:09.312" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You didn&#39;t have to. Then stop making it</p>
<p begin="00:31:06.112" end="00:31:09.312" style="s2">about me and let me save him.</p>
<p begin="00:31:09.512" end="00:31:10.812" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nia.</p>
<p begin="00:31:09.912" end="00:31:12.212" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m here.</p>
<p begin="00:31:10.812" end="00:31:13.912" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My father</p>
<p begin="00:31:12.212" end="00:31:14.812" style="s2">said never let anyone open the back</p>
<p begin="00:31:13.912" end="00:31:15.912" style="s2">panel.</p>
<p begin="00:31:14.812" end="00:31:18.012" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What&#39;s inside?</p>
<p begin="00:31:15.912" end="00:31:21.012" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t know.</p>
<p begin="00:31:18.012" end="00:31:21.012" style="s2">Old fool.</p>
<p begin="00:31:23.112" end="00:31:26.912" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad.</p>
<p begin="00:31:24.612" end="00:31:30.012" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You wanted proof.</p>
<p begin="00:31:26.912" end="00:31:30.012" style="s2">Now you have it.</p>
<p begin="00:31:32.312" end="00:31:37.612" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Get out of my way</p>
<p begin="00:31:34.412" end="00:31:37.612" style="s2">because I&#39;m done asking.</p>
<p begin="00:31:38.312" end="00:31:40.012" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No pulse.</p>
<p begin="00:31:39.212" end="00:31:42.012" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad.</p>
<p begin="00:31:40.012" end="00:31:42.712" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Too late. Everything</p>
<p begin="00:31:42.012" end="00:31:44.712" style="s2">belongs to me.</p>
<p begin="00:31:42.712" end="00:31:46.712" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m not blaming anyone, but since Nia</p>
<p begin="00:31:44.712" end="00:31:47.812" style="s2">came back, everything has been falling</p>
<p begin="00:31:46.712" end="00:31:49.312" style="s2">apart.</p>
<p begin="00:31:47.812" end="00:31:50.712" style="s2">Say it clearly.</p>
<p begin="00:31:49.312" end="00:31:51.512" style="s2">You think I brought this here?</p>
<p begin="00:31:50.712" end="00:31:52.912" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nia.</p>
<p begin="00:31:51.512" end="00:31:53.412" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I said I&#39;m scared.</p>
<p begin="00:31:52.912" end="00:31:54.112" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Convenient.</p>
<p begin="00:31:53.412" end="00:31:55.712" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This is not the time.</p>
<p begin="00:31:54.112" end="00:31:57.912" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then stop letting her make it the time.</p>
<p begin="00:31:55.712" end="00:31:59.812" style="s2">&gt;&gt; See? They&#39;ll keep him alive just long</p>
<p begin="00:31:57.912" end="00:32:02.112" style="s2">enough for me to finish, and they still</p>
<p begin="00:31:59.812" end="00:32:04.812" style="s2">won&#39;t let you touch me. They trust dead</p>
<p begin="00:32:02.112" end="00:32:05.912" style="s2">wood more than they trust you.</p>
<p begin="00:32:04.812" end="00:32:07.512" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He said there&#39;s a back panel.</p>
<p begin="00:32:05.912" end="00:32:08.512" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And he also said no one should open it.</p>
<p begin="00:32:07.512" end="00:32:10.312" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He was repeating something his father</p>
<p begin="00:32:08.512" end="00:32:11.212" style="s2">told him, not saying he understood why.</p>
<p begin="00:32:10.312" end="00:32:12.812" style="s2">Where is the clock key?</p>
<p begin="00:32:11.212" end="00:32:14.112" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No. Grandfather nearly died. You are not</p>
<p begin="00:32:12.812" end="00:32:14.412" style="s2">experiment on the one thing he treasured</p>
<p begin="00:32:14.112" end="00:32:15.612" style="s2">most.</p>
<p begin="00:32:14.412" end="00:32:16.112" style="s2">&gt;&gt; thing is what nearly killed him.</p>
<p begin="00:32:15.612" end="00:32:17.212" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You don&#39;t know that.</p>
<p begin="00:32:16.112" end="00:32:18.312" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I stopped the pendulum and his vitals</p>
<p begin="00:32:17.212" end="00:32:19.312" style="s2">improved. We moved him and he crashed.</p>
<p begin="00:32:18.312" end="00:32:20.412" style="s2">The mark darkened and his heart stopped.</p>
<p begin="00:32:19.312" end="00:32:22.512" style="s2">How much more proof do you need?</p>
<p begin="00:32:20.412" end="00:32:23.612" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nia, please. We almost lost him. Don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:32:22.512" end="00:32:24.812" style="s2">make this worse.</p>
<p begin="00:32:23.612" end="00:32:26.012" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You still think I&#39;m the dangerous thing</p>
<p begin="00:32:24.812" end="00:32:28.712" style="s2">in this room?</p>
<p begin="00:32:26.012" end="00:32:30.412" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They would rather let him die than let</p>
<p begin="00:32:28.712" end="00:32:31.512" style="s2">you prove them wrong.</p>
<p begin="00:32:30.412" end="00:32:33.112" style="s2">&gt;&gt; His pressure&#39;s dropping again.</p>
<p begin="00:32:31.512" end="00:32:34.112" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nia?</p>
<p begin="00:32:33.112" end="00:32:35.712" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What are you doing?</p>
<p begin="00:32:34.112" end="00:32:38.412" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You won&#39;t let me open it? Fine.</p>
<p begin="00:32:35.712" end="00:32:38.412" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Put that down.</p>
<p begin="00:32:41.513" end="00:32:44.013" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Move.</p>
<p begin="00:32:42.713" end="00:32:46.913" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re not smashing 100-year-old</p>
<p begin="00:32:44.013" end="00:32:46.913" style="s2">Whitnall&#39;s heirloom.</p>
<p begin="00:32:47.213" end="00:32:51.613" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then get out of my way</p>
<p begin="00:32:49.413" end="00:32:54.847" style="s2">because I&#39;m done asking.</p>
<p begin="00:32:51.613" end="00:32:56.867" style="s2">&gt;&gt; There. Your own family chose me.</p>
<p begin="00:32:54.847" end="00:32:56.867" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:32:59.113" end="00:33:03.813" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I said stop. You&#39;re out of control.</p>
<p begin="00:33:02.313" end="00:33:04.713" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He almost died twice.</p>
<p begin="00:33:03.813" end="00:33:06.913" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That doesn&#39;t give you the right to</p>
<p begin="00:33:04.713" end="00:33:08.413" style="s2">destroy his property.</p>
<p begin="00:33:06.913" end="00:33:09.913" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Property?</p>
<p begin="00:33:08.413" end="00:33:10.913" style="s2">You&#39;re protecting furniture while he&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:33:09.913" end="00:33:12.613" style="s2">dying?</p>
<p begin="00:33:10.913" end="00:33:14.013" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It is not furniture.</p>
<p begin="00:33:12.613" end="00:33:16.413" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Neither is he.</p>
<p begin="00:33:14.013" end="00:33:17.913" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Keep arguing. I like watching families</p>
<p begin="00:33:16.413" end="00:33:18.613" style="s2">waste time.</p>
<p begin="00:33:17.913" end="00:33:20.313" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let go.</p>
<p begin="00:33:18.613" end="00:33:22.813" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No. Enough.</p>
<p begin="00:33:20.313" end="00:33:23.213" style="s2">Put the poker down. Call security.</p>
<p begin="00:33:22.813" end="00:33:24.713" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Graham.</p>
<p begin="00:33:23.213" end="00:33:25.913" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She&#39;s swinging an iron bar next to a</p>
<p begin="00:33:24.713" end="00:33:28.813" style="s2">critically ill man.</p>
<p begin="00:33:25.913" end="00:33:31.913" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Maybe we should all calm down.</p>
<p begin="00:33:28.813" end="00:33:33.813" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Calm down? You framed me. You searched</p>
<p begin="00:33:31.913" end="00:33:35.113" style="s2">my room. You called me a thief. And now</p>
<p begin="00:33:33.813" end="00:33:37.513" style="s2">the only person in this house who</p>
<p begin="00:33:35.113" end="00:33:38.813" style="s2">believed me is dying because all of you</p>
<p begin="00:33:37.513" end="00:33:41.413" style="s2">are more afraid of being wrong than</p>
<p begin="00:33:38.813" end="00:33:43.313" style="s2">losing him.</p>
<p begin="00:33:41.413" end="00:33:44.913" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What if you smash it and he dies?</p>
<p begin="00:33:43.313" end="00:33:46.913" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then blame me forever. But if we do</p>
<p begin="00:33:44.913" end="00:33:47.913" style="s2">nothing, you may not have a father left</p>
<p begin="00:33:46.913" end="00:33:49.413" style="s2">to protect.</p>
<p begin="00:33:47.913" end="00:33:50.113" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Take the popper and remove her from the</p>
<p begin="00:33:49.413" end="00:33:53.143" style="s2">room.</p>
<p begin="00:33:50.113" end="00:33:55.163" style="s2">&gt;&gt; There. Your own family chose me.</p>
<p begin="00:33:53.143" end="00:33:55.163" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [gasps]</p>
<p begin="00:33:55.313" end="00:33:58.413" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nia.</p>
<p begin="00:33:57.213" end="00:33:59.913" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m here.</p>
<p begin="00:33:58.413" end="00:34:02.013" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The clock.</p>
<p begin="00:33:59.913" end="00:34:04.513" style="s2">Never let it take another Whitman. Back</p>
<p begin="00:34:02.013" end="00:34:06.913" style="s2">panel, my father hid the key. Do what I</p>
<p begin="00:34:04.513" end="00:34:08.513" style="s2">was too afraid to do.</p>
<p begin="00:34:06.913" end="00:34:09.713" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Grandfather is delirious.</p>
<p begin="00:34:08.513" end="00:34:11.013" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He was clear enough to tell me where the</p>
<p begin="00:34:09.713" end="00:34:12.613" style="s2">key was.</p>
<p begin="00:34:11.013" end="00:34:15.213" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You don&#39;t know what&#39;s behind that panel.</p>
<p begin="00:34:12.613" end="00:34:17.113" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Neither do you. That&#39;s the problem.</p>
<p begin="00:34:15.213" end="00:34:18.813" style="s2">&gt;&gt; His oxygen saturation is dropping again.</p>
<p begin="00:34:17.113" end="00:34:19.713" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Almost.</p>
<p begin="00:34:18.813" end="00:34:22.513" style="s2">Last chance.</p>
<p begin="00:34:19.713" end="00:34:22.513" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re not touching it.</p>
<p begin="00:34:23.213" end="00:34:25.913" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I asked. You said no. So now I &#39;m done</p>
<p begin="00:34:25.413" end="00:34:28.213" style="s2">asking.</p>
<p begin="00:34:25.913" end="00:34:28.213" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nia.</p>
<p begin="00:34:31.113" end="00:34:35.913" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Seven lives, seven generations.</p>
<p begin="00:34:36.313" end="00:34:40.113" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Almost there.</p>
<p begin="00:34:38.513" end="00:34:41.313" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We&#39;re losing him again.</p>
<p begin="00:34:40.113" end="00:34:42.213" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Move.</p>
<p begin="00:34:41.313" end="00:34:42.514" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="00:34:42.213" end="00:34:43.314" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He gave</p>
<p begin="00:34:42.514" end="00:34:44.414" style="s2">&gt;&gt; me the key.</p>
<p begin="00:34:43.314" end="00:34:45.714" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He&#39;s barely conscious.</p>
<p begin="00:34:44.414" end="00:34:47.214" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And you&#39;re using that as an excuse to</p>
<p begin="00:34:45.714" end="00:34:48.614" style="s2">ignore his last clear decision?</p>
<p begin="00:34:47.214" end="00:34:49.214" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You are not destroying this family&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:34:48.614" end="00:34:52.814" style="s2">history.</p>
<p begin="00:34:49.214" end="00:34:52.814" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m trying to keep this family alive.</p>
<p begin="00:35:01.919" end="00:35:04.314" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:35:03.314" end="00:35:07.114" style="s2">Stop.</p>
<p begin="00:35:04.314" end="00:35:07.114" style="s2">I warned you.</p>
<p begin="00:35:08.914" end="00:35:12.454" style="s2">Adrian.</p>
<p begin="00:35:10.434" end="00:35:12.454" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [panting and sighs]</p>
<p begin="00:35:13.614" end="00:35:16.114" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t. You have no idea what you&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:35:15.514" end="00:35:19.314" style="s2">opening.</p>
<p begin="00:35:16.114" end="00:35:19.314" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then you should have stopped talking.</p>
<p begin="00:35:25.414" end="00:35:28.114" style="s2">&gt;&gt; CLOSE IT.</p>
<p begin="00:35:29.914" end="00:35:35.914" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Seven lives, seven generations, one</p>
<p begin="00:35:33.214" end="00:35:38.514" style="s2">family beating one clock.</p>
<p begin="00:35:35.914" end="00:35:38.514" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What is that?</p>
<p begin="00:35:40.814" end="00:35:44.314" style="s2">Get it out.</p>
<p begin="00:35:42.014" end="00:35:44.314" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Do it.</p>
<p begin="00:35:45.714" end="00:35:52.114" style="s2">You thought finding me was enough?</p>
<p begin="00:35:48.514" end="00:35:53.214" style="s2">Pull me out and his heart comes with me.</p>
<p begin="00:35:52.114" end="00:35:53.714" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Heart rate 28.</p>
<p begin="00:35:53.214" end="00:35:56.614" style="s2">&gt;&gt; NIA.</p>
<p begin="00:35:53.714" end="00:35:56.614" style="s2">&gt;&gt; DO SOMETHING.</p>
<p begin="00:35:57.314" end="00:36:00.214" style="s2">&gt;&gt; IT DOESN&#39;T NEED TO BE REMOVED.</p>
<p begin="00:35:59.014" end="00:36:02.314" style="s2">It needs to be broken.</p>
<p begin="00:36:00.214" end="00:36:03.214" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If you break me, you break everything he</p>
<p begin="00:36:02.314" end="00:36:04.114" style="s2">inherited.</p>
<p begin="00:36:03.214" end="00:36:06.014" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good.</p>
<p begin="00:36:04.114" end="00:36:08.114" style="s2">Then the curse ends with him.</p>
<p begin="00:36:06.014" end="00:36:08.114" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="00:36:11.214" end="00:36:15.814" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The Whitmans will pay generation after</p>
<p begin="00:36:13.114" end="00:36:15.814" style="s2">generation.</p>
<p begin="00:36:20.314" end="00:36:22.914" style="s2">&gt;&gt; STOP.</p>
<p begin="00:36:28.414" end="00:36:32.114" style="s2">&gt;&gt; HE&#39;S CRACKING.</p>
<p begin="00:36:29.314" end="00:36:32.114" style="s2">&gt;&gt; STOP HITTING IT.</p>
<p begin="00:36:32.214" end="00:36:35.314" style="s2">&gt;&gt; LET HER FINISH.</p>
<p begin="00:36:33.514" end="00:36:38.014" style="s2">&gt;&gt; ARE YOU INSANE? We already tried</p>
<p begin="00:36:35.314" end="00:36:38.014" style="s2">everything else.</p>
<p begin="00:36:38.814" end="00:36:43.414" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The clock is innocent.</p>
<p begin="00:36:41.714" end="00:36:45.616" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re not the clock.</p>
<p begin="00:36:43.414" end="00:36:48.316" style="s2">You&#39;ve been hiding inside of him.</p>
<p begin="00:36:45.616" end="00:36:48.316" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="00:36:48.516" end="00:36:51.116" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Come on.</p>
<p begin="00:36:49.916" end="00:36:52.716" style="s2">You told me to do it. Don&#39;t make me</p>
<p begin="00:36:51.116" end="00:36:55.116" style="s2">wrong now.</p>
<p begin="00:36:52.716" end="00:36:55.116" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Clear.</p>
<p begin="00:36:56.116" end="00:36:58.416" style="s2">Wait.</p>
<p begin="00:36:56.716" end="00:37:00.016" style="s2">&gt;&gt; His rhythm is stabilizing.</p>
<p begin="00:36:58.416" end="00:37:02.716" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Blood pressure is rising. Oxygen</p>
<p begin="00:37:00.016" end="00:37:05.016" style="s2">saturation is improving.</p>
<p begin="00:37:02.716" end="00:37:05.016" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad?</p>
<p begin="00:37:05.416" end="00:37:07.916" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You did it.</p>
<p begin="00:37:06.316" end="00:37:09.416" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad, don&#39;t talk.</p>
<p begin="00:37:07.916" end="00:37:11.916" style="s2">&gt;&gt; For weeks,</p>
<p begin="00:37:09.416" end="00:37:13.516" style="s2">every time that clock struck midnight,</p>
<p begin="00:37:11.916" end="00:37:15.516" style="s2">I felt weaker.</p>
<p begin="00:37:13.516" end="00:37:18.716" style="s2">I thought I was dying.</p>
<p begin="00:37:15.516" end="00:37:20.216" style="s2">She knew better. She saved my life.</p>
<p begin="00:37:18.716" end="00:37:24.416" style="s2">So the next person who calls her a</p>
<p begin="00:37:20.216" end="00:37:24.416" style="s2">disaster answers to me.</p>
<p begin="00:37:28.016" end="00:37:32.716" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The Whitmans will pay generation after</p>
<p begin="00:37:29.916" end="00:37:32.716" style="s2">generation.</p>
<p begin="00:37:32.916" end="00:37:37.316" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Someone did this to your family?</p>
<p begin="00:37:36.116" end="00:37:39.216" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What is it?</p>
<p begin="00:37:37.316" end="00:37:41.716" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We have a bigger problem.</p>
<p begin="00:37:39.216" end="00:37:44.716" style="s2">This was hidden inside the clock.</p>
<p begin="00:37:41.716" end="00:37:47.016" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He needs rest. Everyone stays,</p>
<p begin="00:37:44.716" end="00:37:49.616" style="s2">especially family.</p>
<p begin="00:37:47.016" end="00:37:51.416" style="s2">You called security on her. You asked</p>
<p begin="00:37:49.616" end="00:37:53.116" style="s2">her to stop.</p>
<p begin="00:37:51.416" end="00:37:55.716" style="s2">And you stood between her and that</p>
<p begin="00:37:53.116" end="00:37:58.116" style="s2">clock. If she had listened to any of</p>
<p begin="00:37:55.716" end="00:37:59.816" style="s2">you, I would be dead.</p>
<p begin="00:37:58.116" end="00:38:01.616" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I was wrong</p>
<p begin="00:37:59.816" end="00:38:03.716" style="s2">about the clock</p>
<p begin="00:38:01.616" end="00:38:05.116" style="s2">and about stopping you.</p>
<p begin="00:38:03.716" end="00:38:07.516" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You were.</p>
<p begin="00:38:05.116" end="00:38:07.516" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nia.</p>
<p begin="00:38:08.116" end="00:38:12.216" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I was scared.</p>
<p begin="00:38:09.816" end="00:38:13.516" style="s2">I thought you might make things worse.</p>
<p begin="00:38:12.216" end="00:38:14.716" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You thought that because you still don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:38:13.516" end="00:38:17.716" style="s2">trust me.</p>
<p begin="00:38:14.716" end="00:38:19.116" style="s2">That&#39;s not the same thing.</p>
<p begin="00:38:17.716" end="00:38:21.216" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She&#39;s right.</p>
<p begin="00:38:19.116" end="00:38:23.016" style="s2">You keep asking her to understand us.</p>
<p begin="00:38:21.216" end="00:38:24.316" style="s2">When has anyone here tried to understand</p>
<p begin="00:38:23.016" end="00:38:25.916" style="s2">her?</p>
<p begin="00:38:24.316" end="00:38:26.816" style="s2">You saved my life without owing me</p>
<p begin="00:38:25.916" end="00:38:28.716" style="s2">anything.</p>
<p begin="00:38:26.816" end="00:38:31.216" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You believed me when no one else did.</p>
<p begin="00:38:28.716" end="00:38:31.216" style="s2">We&#39;re even.</p>
<p begin="00:38:32.116" end="00:38:35.216" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What is it?</p>
<p begin="00:38:33.316" end="00:38:37.016" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We have a bigger problem.</p>
<p begin="00:38:35.216" end="00:38:38.916" style="s2">This was hidden inside the clock. I</p>
<p begin="00:38:37.016" end="00:38:41.016" style="s2">don&#39;t know yet, but the clock wasn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="00:38:38.916" end="00:38:42.016" style="s2">born dangerous. Someone turned it into a</p>
<p begin="00:38:41.016" end="00:38:44.516" style="s2">weapon.</p>
<p begin="00:38:42.016" end="00:38:46.017" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My father died in this room.</p>
<p begin="00:38:44.516" end="00:38:47.917" style="s2">So did my grandfather. We called with</p>
<p begin="00:38:46.017" end="00:38:49.317" style="s2">coincidence, then tradition.</p>
<p begin="00:38:47.917" end="00:38:50.817" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It was neither.</p>
<p begin="00:38:49.317" end="00:38:52.717" style="s2">Someone wanted Whitmore&#39;s dying beside</p>
<p begin="00:38:50.817" end="00:38:54.517" style="s2">that clock.</p>
<p begin="00:38:52.717" end="00:38:56.417" style="s2">That clock.</p>
<p begin="00:38:54.517" end="00:38:58.617" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then enough secrets. Call the family</p>
<p begin="00:38:56.417" end="00:38:59.317" style="s2">attorney and the communications office.</p>
<p begin="00:38:58.617" end="00:39:02.417" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad, no.</p>
<p begin="00:38:59.317" end="00:39:02.417" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We delayed long enough.</p>
<p begin="00:39:02.717" end="00:39:05.717" style="s2">Tomorrow morning,</p>
<p begin="00:39:04.317" end="00:39:07.317" style="s2">the Whitmore family publicly</p>
<p begin="00:39:05.717" end="00:39:08.617" style="s2">acknowledges Nia Carter.</p>
<p begin="00:39:07.317" end="00:39:10.317" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad, maybe we should wait until</p>
<p begin="00:39:08.617" end="00:39:12.517" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Until when?</p>
<p begin="00:39:10.317" end="00:39:13.817" style="s2">Until Celeste feels better and restore</p>
<p begin="00:39:12.517" end="00:39:15.217" style="s2">her family voting rights.</p>
<p begin="00:39:13.817" end="00:39:16.417" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Voting rights?</p>
<p begin="00:39:15.217" end="00:39:17.817" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The shares held in trust for the</p>
<p begin="00:39:16.417" end="00:39:19.217" style="s2">daughter we lost, they were never</p>
<p begin="00:39:17.817" end="00:39:21.017" style="s2">Celeste&#39;s. They were hers.</p>
<p begin="00:39:19.217" end="00:39:21.517" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wait. I didn&#39;t come here for shares.</p>
<p begin="00:39:21.017" end="00:39:22.417" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know.</p>
<p begin="00:39:21.517" end="00:39:22.817" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then don&#39;t give me anything out of</p>
<p begin="00:39:22.417" end="00:39:23.917" style="s2">guilt.</p>
<p begin="00:39:22.817" end="00:39:26.217" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I am not giving you anything. I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="00:39:23.917" end="00:39:27.717" style="s2">returning what was always yours.</p>
<p begin="00:39:26.217" end="00:39:29.417" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He&#39;s giving her the voting shares. No,</p>
<p begin="00:39:27.717" end="00:39:30.817" style="s2">this changes everything. Do it before</p>
<p begin="00:39:29.417" end="00:39:33.517" style="s2">the announcement. If she wants my place,</p>
<p begin="00:39:30.817" end="00:39:33.517" style="s2">she can fight for it.</p>
<p begin="00:39:35.117" end="00:39:37.317" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Tomorrow?</p>
<p begin="00:39:36.217" end="00:39:38.917" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="00:39:37.317" end="00:39:40.417" style="s2">Tonight.</p>
<p begin="00:39:38.917" end="00:39:42.217" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is the Whit Whit family announcing a new</p>
<p begin="00:39:40.417" end="00:39:43.817" style="s2">heir? Is this connected to the woman</p>
<p begin="00:39:42.217" end="00:39:45.717" style="s2">seen with Augustus Whit Whit?</p>
<p begin="00:39:43.817" end="00:39:46.717" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The press will photograph everything.</p>
<p begin="00:39:45.717" end="00:39:47.817" style="s2">Wear this.</p>
<p begin="00:39:46.717" end="00:39:49.817" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why?</p>
<p begin="00:39:47.817" end="00:39:51.917" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Because today you represent this family.</p>
<p begin="00:39:49.817" end="00:39:54.017" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then they can see who I actually am.</p>
<p begin="00:39:51.917" end="00:39:56.117" style="s2">&gt;&gt; One final point. The public statement</p>
<p begin="00:39:54.017" end="00:39:57.517" style="s2">can identify you as Nia Whit Whit.</p>
<p begin="00:39:56.117" end="00:39:59.417" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Carter stays.</p>
<p begin="00:39:57.517" end="00:40:01.917" style="s2">Blood tells me where I came from. It</p>
<p begin="00:39:59.417" end="00:40:03.517" style="s2">doesn&#39;t erase who raised me.</p>
<p begin="00:40:01.917" end="00:40:05.917" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 22 years ago, my granddaughter</p>
<p begin="00:40:03.517" end="00:40:08.217" style="s2">disappeared. Independent DNA testing has</p>
<p begin="00:40:05.917" end="00:40:08.917" style="s2">now confirmed that Nia Carter is that</p>
<p begin="00:40:08.217" end="00:40:10.217" style="s2">child.</p>
<p begin="00:40:08.917" end="00:40:11.517" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Miss Carter, did you know you were a</p>
<p begin="00:40:10.217" end="00:40:13.217" style="s2">Whitmore? Will you change your name? Are</p>
<p begin="00:40:11.517" end="00:40:15.417" style="s2">you claiming an inheritance?</p>
<p begin="00:40:13.217" end="00:40:16.417" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I didn&#39;t know. I&#39;m not changing my name,</p>
<p begin="00:40:15.417" end="00:40:18.417" style="s2">and I didn&#39;t come here chasing an</p>
<p begin="00:40:16.417" end="00:40:20.717" style="s2">inheritance. For 22 years, I lived</p>
<p begin="00:40:18.417" end="00:40:22.617" style="s2">without this family. I worked, I</p>
<p begin="00:40:20.717" end="00:40:24.017" style="s2">struggled, I survived. So I&#39;m not</p>
<p begin="00:40:22.617" end="00:40:25.617" style="s2">standing here because the Whitmore name</p>
<p begin="00:40:24.017" end="00:40:27.117" style="s2">gave me value. I&#39;m standing here because</p>
<p begin="00:40:25.617" end="00:40:28.917" style="s2">the truth finally caught up.</p>
<p begin="00:40:27.117" end="00:40:30.317" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The family trust has also reinstated the</p>
<p begin="00:40:28.917" end="00:40:31.217" style="s2">voting rights held for the missing</p>
<p begin="00:40:30.317" end="00:40:32.317" style="s2">biological daughter.</p>
<p begin="00:40:31.217" end="00:40:35.417" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How much equity does she control?</p>
<p begin="00:40:32.317" end="00:40:38.117" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Enough that her voice will be heard.</p>
<p begin="00:40:35.417" end="00:40:38.117" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Welcome home.</p>
<p begin="00:40:39.217" end="00:40:44.117" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Enjoy today.</p>
<p begin="00:40:40.517" end="00:40:44.117" style="s2">Public attention disappears fast.</p>
<p begin="00:40:49.017" end="00:40:51.418" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s her.</p>
<p begin="00:40:54.118" end="00:40:57.118" style="s2">They want her unable to work.</p>
<p begin="00:40:57.218" end="00:40:59.918" style="s2">You handled the press well.</p>
<p begin="00:40:58.718" end="00:41:02.118" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Was that a compliment?</p>
<p begin="00:40:59.918" end="00:41:03.018" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t get used to it.</p>
<p begin="00:41:02.118" end="00:41:04.793" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What?</p>
<p begin="00:41:03.018" end="00:41:06.518" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nothing yet.</p>
<p begin="00:41:04.793" end="00:41:08.518" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:41:06.518" end="00:41:10.918" style="s2">Marcus, run the gray sedan outside the</p>
<p begin="00:41:08.518" end="00:41:10.918" style="s2">east gate.</p>
<p begin="00:41:17.518" end="00:41:22.018" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m fine. No, I didn&#39;t change my name.</p>
<p begin="00:41:24.818" end="00:41:26.918" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Tomorrow?</p>
<p begin="00:41:25.818" end="00:41:29.118" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="00:41:26.918" end="00:41:31.918" style="s2">Tonight.</p>
<p begin="00:41:29.118" end="00:41:31.918" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re not robbing me.</p>
<p begin="00:41:33.018" end="00:41:36.318" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Smart girl.</p>
<p begin="00:41:35.518" end="00:41:37.018" style="s2">Don&#39;t leave alone.</p>
<p begin="00:41:36.318" end="00:41:37.918" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why?</p>
<p begin="00:41:37.018" end="00:41:40.518" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Gray sedan followed you from the</p>
<p begin="00:41:37.918" end="00:41:40.518" style="s2">Whitmore estate.</p>
<p begin="00:41:41.918" end="00:41:45.018" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That wasn&#39;t here before.</p>
<p begin="00:41:43.218" end="00:41:45.918" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Not yours.</p>
<p begin="00:41:45.018" end="00:41:47.418" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who brought you?</p>
<p begin="00:41:45.918" end="00:41:50.518" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Black gloves.</p>
<p begin="00:41:47.418" end="00:41:52.118" style="s2">They dropped me when they came upstairs.</p>
<p begin="00:41:50.518" end="00:41:54.018" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They dropped me when they came upstairs.</p>
<p begin="00:41:52.118" end="00:41:54.518" style="s2">She cuts through here after 9:00. Hands</p>
<p begin="00:41:54.018" end="00:41:55.218" style="s2">first.</p>
<p begin="00:41:54.518" end="00:41:56.018" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Where are you?</p>
<p begin="00:41:55.218" end="00:41:56.918" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Still upstairs.</p>
<p begin="00:41:56.018" end="00:41:58.018" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Stay there, Nia.</p>
<p begin="00:41:56.918" end="00:41:58.918" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If they&#39;re watching the building, hiding</p>
<p begin="00:41:58.018" end="00:42:00.318" style="s2">only tells them I know.</p>
<p begin="00:41:58.918" end="00:42:00.918" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And walking into an ambush tells them</p>
<p begin="00:42:00.318" end="00:42:02.518" style="s2">you&#39;re reckless.</p>
<p begin="00:42:00.918" end="00:42:04.818" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m not walking into it. I&#39;m making them</p>
<p begin="00:42:02.518" end="00:42:06.318" style="s2">show themselves.</p>
<p begin="00:42:04.818" end="00:42:08.518" style="s2">They already made me one. They know my</p>
<p begin="00:42:06.318" end="00:42:09.518" style="s2">usual route, so we changed one thing.</p>
<p begin="00:42:08.518" end="00:42:10.218" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re not bait?</p>
<p begin="00:42:09.518" end="00:42:11.318" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What?</p>
<p begin="00:42:10.218" end="00:42:12.918" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let them think I didn&#39;t.</p>
<p begin="00:42:11.318" end="00:42:15.418" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Track the sedan. Stay out of sight.</p>
<p begin="00:42:12.918" end="00:42:15.418" style="s2">Understood.</p>
<p begin="00:42:16.418" end="00:42:19.418" style="s2">Gray sedan, 30 m behind you.</p>
<p begin="00:42:18.618" end="00:42:20.718" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Two men?</p>
<p begin="00:42:19.418" end="00:42:22.918" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Confirmed.</p>
<p begin="00:42:20.718" end="00:42:22.918" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good.</p>
<p begin="00:42:25.418" end="00:42:28.418" style="s2">They&#39;re waiting for you to turn.</p>
<p begin="00:42:29.018" end="00:42:32.718" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ms. Carter?</p>
<p begin="00:42:31.418" end="00:42:33.618" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Do I know you?</p>
<p begin="00:42:32.718" end="00:42:36.318" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Not yet.</p>
<p begin="00:42:33.618" end="00:42:36.318" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re not robbing me.</p>
<p begin="00:42:37.418" end="00:42:41.718" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Smart girl.</p>
<p begin="00:42:39.818" end="00:42:43.718" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Makes this easier.</p>
<p begin="00:42:41.718" end="00:42:45.018" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who paid you?</p>
<p begin="00:42:43.718" end="00:42:46.918" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Holder.</p>
<p begin="00:42:45.018" end="00:42:48.418" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They will when they&#39;re arrested.</p>
<p begin="00:42:46.918" end="00:42:49.318" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You won&#39;t be identifying antiques after</p>
<p begin="00:42:48.418" end="00:42:52.620" style="s2">tonight.</p>
<p begin="00:42:49.318" end="00:42:54.820" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nia, move. There&#39;s a third vehicle.</p>
<p begin="00:42:52.620" end="00:42:54.820" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hey, hey, hey.</p>
<p begin="00:42:58.920" end="00:43:03.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s like you took the route after all.</p>
<p begin="00:43:01.320" end="00:43:06.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fire escape.</p>
<p begin="00:43:03.120" end="00:43:06.320" style="s2">One hand should be enough.</p>
<p begin="00:43:07.520" end="00:43:10.020" style="s2">Try mine.</p>
<p begin="00:43:13.829" end="00:43:15.720" style="s2">[panting]</p>
<p begin="00:43:14.420" end="00:43:17.320" style="s2">Are you hurt?</p>
<p begin="00:43:15.720" end="00:43:19.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Not yet.</p>
<p begin="00:43:17.320" end="00:43:19.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Take him.</p>
<p begin="00:43:19.920" end="00:43:23.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t chase him. He left us something</p>
<p begin="00:43:21.520" end="00:43:23.920" style="s2">better.</p>
<p begin="00:43:25.120" end="00:43:28.020" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who hired you?</p>
<p begin="00:43:26.920" end="00:43:28.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lawyer.</p>
<p begin="00:43:28.020" end="00:43:29.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What?</p>
<p begin="00:43:28.920" end="00:43:30.620" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s the only word you&#39;re getting from</p>
<p begin="00:43:29.920" end="00:43:33.720" style="s2">me.</p>
<p begin="00:43:30.620" end="00:43:33.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fine. Police.</p>
<p begin="00:43:35.320" end="00:43:37.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Calls. Three tonight.</p>
<p begin="00:43:37.020" end="00:43:41.820" style="s2">&gt;&gt; From who?</p>
<p begin="00:43:37.720" end="00:43:41.820" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Unknown number, but the same voice.</p>
<p begin="00:43:42.520" end="00:43:44.120" style="s2">Hands first.</p>
<p begin="00:43:43.520" end="00:43:46.020" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Payment?</p>
<p begin="00:43:44.120" end="00:43:47.220" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No permanent damage if avoidable. The</p>
<p begin="00:43:46.020" end="00:43:50.020" style="s2">company will release it after</p>
<p begin="00:43:47.220" end="00:43:50.020" style="s2">confirmation.</p>
<p begin="00:43:50.420" end="00:43:52.620" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The company paid them.</p>
<p begin="00:43:51.620" end="00:43:54.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Can you identify it?</p>
<p begin="00:43:52.620" end="00:43:56.520" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Invoice. Email attachment. Get this</p>
<p begin="00:43:54.920" end="00:43:57.720" style="s2">image before anyone touches the data.</p>
<p begin="00:43:56.520" end="00:43:58.620" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ll have Cyber pull the metadata.</p>
<p begin="00:43:57.720" end="00:44:00.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And payment records.</p>
<p begin="00:43:58.620" end="00:44:01.420" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You were almost attacked 30 seconds ago.</p>
<p begin="00:44:00.320" end="00:44:02.820" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Which is why I&#39;d like to know who paid</p>
<p begin="00:44:01.420" end="00:44:03.820" style="s2">for it.</p>
<p begin="00:44:02.820" end="00:44:05.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your shoulder is bleeding.</p>
<p begin="00:44:03.820" end="00:44:06.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m fine. That barely counts.</p>
<p begin="00:44:05.720" end="00:44:08.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Get in the car.</p>
<p begin="00:44:06.920" end="00:44:09.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Was that concern or an order?</p>
<p begin="00:44:08.120" end="00:44:11.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Whichever gets you moving faster.</p>
<p begin="00:44:09.920" end="00:44:12.320" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You had armed security following me?</p>
<p begin="00:44:11.320" end="00:44:14.020" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Unarmed tonight.</p>
<p begin="00:44:12.320" end="00:44:15.020" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s not the point. Who exactly are</p>
<p begin="00:44:14.020" end="00:44:16.520" style="s2">you, Elias Cross?</p>
<p begin="00:44:15.020" end="00:44:17.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Cross Heritage Capital controls private</p>
<p begin="00:44:16.520" end="00:44:19.020" style="s2">collections, restoration financing,</p>
<p begin="00:44:17.720" end="00:44:19.420" style="s2">museum-backed acquisitions across three</p>
<p begin="00:44:19.020" end="00:44:20.720" style="s2">continents.</p>
<p begin="00:44:19.420" end="00:44:22.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know the brochure version. Tell me the</p>
<p begin="00:44:20.720" end="00:44:23.420" style="s2">part my family clearly hates.</p>
<p begin="00:44:22.120" end="00:44:25.020" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Whitmore Heritage and Cross compete for</p>
<p begin="00:44:23.420" end="00:44:26.020" style="s2">the same collections, the same donors,</p>
<p begin="00:44:25.020" end="00:44:26.920" style="s2">the same institutions.</p>
<p begin="00:44:26.020" end="00:44:29.620" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So your rivals.</p>
<p begin="00:44:26.920" end="00:44:29.620" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Their largest one.</p>
<p begin="00:44:31.320" end="00:44:35.820" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They&#39;re here.</p>
<p begin="00:44:33.520" end="00:44:36.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Police can bring Melanie in tonight.</p>
<p begin="00:44:35.820" end="00:44:38.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="00:44:36.920" end="00:44:39.720" style="s2">She&#39;s not the target.</p>
<p begin="00:44:38.120" end="00:44:41.220" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You think she&#39;s a buffer?</p>
<p begin="00:44:39.720" end="00:44:42.820" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A disposable one.</p>
<p begin="00:44:41.220" end="00:44:44.920" style="s2">If we arrest her now, whoever hired her</p>
<p begin="00:44:42.820" end="00:44:46.520" style="s2">deletes everything. Emails, payment</p>
<p begin="00:44:44.920" end="00:44:47.520" style="s2">trails, phones.</p>
<p begin="00:44:46.520" end="00:44:48.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So we wait?</p>
<p begin="00:44:47.520" end="00:44:49.920" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We lie.</p>
<p begin="00:44:48.720" end="00:44:51.620" style="s2">Let them hear the attacker&#39;s phone was</p>
<p begin="00:44:49.920" end="00:44:52.520" style="s2">wiped. No usable data, no payment trail.</p>
<p begin="00:44:51.620" end="00:44:53.720" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And see who panics.</p>
<p begin="00:44:52.520" end="00:44:54.121" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Exactly.</p>
<p begin="00:44:53.720" end="00:44:56.921" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We need</p>
<p begin="00:44:54.121" end="00:44:56.921" style="s2">&gt;&gt; controlled leak.</p>
<p begin="00:44:59.621" end="00:45:02.521" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Now nobody touches Northstar.</p>
<p begin="00:45:01.321" end="00:45:05.121" style="s2">&gt;&gt; For how long?</p>
<p begin="00:45:02.521" end="00:45:05.121" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Until they do.</p>
<p begin="00:45:19.421" end="00:45:22.721" style="s2">They found nothing.</p>
<p begin="00:45:20.721" end="00:45:23.621" style="s2">Good. Then clean everything anyway.</p>
<p begin="00:45:22.721" end="00:45:26.221" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Everything?</p>
<p begin="00:45:23.621" end="00:45:27.921" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Everything. Northstar never existed.</p>
<p begin="00:45:26.221" end="00:45:29.321" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Activity. They&#39;re wiping it.</p>
<p begin="00:45:27.921" end="00:45:30.521" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Which means the company matters.</p>
<p begin="00:45:29.321" end="00:45:32.121" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And someone heard the leak.</p>
<p begin="00:45:30.521" end="00:45:33.421" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Keep recording. Don&#39;t stop the deletion.</p>
<p begin="00:45:32.121" end="00:45:34.621" style="s2">I want them to think it worked.</p>
<p begin="00:45:33.421" end="00:45:37.021" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Northstar is draining the account.</p>
<p begin="00:45:34.621" end="00:45:38.521" style="s2">$185,000 to Harbor Consulting, $72,000</p>
<p begin="00:45:37.021" end="00:45:40.021" style="s2">Eastman 3 to personal account.</p>
<p begin="00:45:38.521" end="00:45:40.921" style="s2">&gt;&gt; There. That&#39;s her escape money.</p>
<p begin="00:45:40.021" end="00:45:41.421" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You think she&#39;s leaving?</p>
<p begin="00:45:40.921" end="00:45:42.621" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I would.</p>
<p begin="00:45:41.421" end="00:45:44.921" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Personal account belongs to Melanie</p>
<p begin="00:45:42.621" end="00:45:44.921" style="s2">Vale.</p>
<p begin="00:45:47.721" end="00:45:49.921" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Just get out.</p>
<p begin="00:45:48.721" end="00:45:51.621" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She&#39;s heading to the airport. I can have</p>
<p begin="00:45:49.921" end="00:45:52.021" style="s2">police stop her before Terminal 1.</p>
<p begin="00:45:51.621" end="00:45:53.221" style="s2">Again?</p>
<p begin="00:45:52.021" end="00:45:53.721" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If Celine thinks Melanie escaped escaped</p>
<p begin="00:45:53.221" end="00:45:54.921" style="s2">safely</p>
<p begin="00:45:53.721" end="00:45:56.021" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Or kill the connection entirely.</p>
<p begin="00:45:54.921" end="00:45:57.621" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then we give Melanie a reason to call</p>
<p begin="00:45:56.021" end="00:45:58.321" style="s2">first. Send her this.</p>
<p begin="00:45:57.621" end="00:46:00.821" style="s2">&gt;&gt; From who?</p>
<p begin="00:45:58.321" end="00:46:00.821" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Anonymous.</p>
<p begin="00:46:02.621" end="00:46:05.321" style="s2">Come on.</p>
<p begin="00:46:03.621" end="00:46:07.021" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Celeste, they flagged the money.</p>
<p begin="00:46:05.321" end="00:46:08.321" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I told you never to call this number.</p>
<p begin="00:46:07.021" end="00:46:10.121" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What am I supposed to do?</p>
<p begin="00:46:08.321" end="00:46:11.121" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Delete the phone, get on the flight, and</p>
<p begin="00:46:10.121" end="00:46:12.521" style="s2">don&#39;t come back.</p>
<p begin="00:46:11.121" end="00:46:14.121" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s her. We have her voice.</p>
<p begin="00:46:12.521" end="00:46:15.621" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We have her helping Melanie run, not</p>
<p begin="00:46:14.121" end="00:46:16.421" style="s2">ordering the attack. I need her to say</p>
<p begin="00:46:15.621" end="00:46:17.021" style="s2">what she ordered.</p>
<p begin="00:46:16.421" end="00:46:20.321" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How?</p>
<p begin="00:46:17.021" end="00:46:20.321" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Make Melanie scared enough to ask.</p>
<p begin="00:46:22.521" end="00:46:23.921" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They&#39;re here.</p>
<p begin="00:46:23.421" end="00:46:25.421" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What?</p>
<p begin="00:46:23.921" end="00:46:27.321" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You said I&#39;d be protected. You told me</p>
<p begin="00:46:25.421" end="00:46:28.421" style="s2">to hire those men.</p>
<p begin="00:46:27.321" end="00:46:29.921" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Lower your voice.</p>
<p begin="00:46:28.421" end="00:46:31.721" style="s2">&gt;&gt; YOU TOLD ME TO HURT HER HAND.</p>
<p begin="00:46:29.921" end="00:46:35.121" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I told you to scare her. You were never</p>
<p begin="00:46:31.721" end="00:46:36.721" style="s2">supposed to let anyone get caught.</p>
<p begin="00:46:35.121" end="00:46:38.621" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What if the men talk?</p>
<p begin="00:46:36.721" end="00:46:40.021" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then clean it up.</p>
<p begin="00:46:38.621" end="00:46:42.721" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You mean the payment trail?</p>
<p begin="00:46:40.021" end="00:46:42.721" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Everything.</p>
<p begin="00:46:45.621" end="00:46:49.521" style="s2">Miss Whitword, Nia Carter is here.</p>
<p begin="00:46:48.721" end="00:46:51.921" style="s2">Bad time?</p>
<p begin="00:46:49.521" end="00:46:54.921" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Never.</p>
<p begin="00:46:51.921" end="00:46:56.121" style="s2">I heard about last night. Are you hurt?</p>
<p begin="00:46:54.921" end="00:46:57.521" style="s2">Still works.</p>
<p begin="00:46:56.121" end="00:46:57.723" style="s2">Disappointed?</p>
<p begin="00:46:57.521" end="00:47:00.622" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s</p>
<p begin="00:46:57.723" end="00:47:02.122" style="s2">&gt;&gt; not funny. I wasn&#39;t joking.</p>
<p begin="00:47:00.622" end="00:47:03.122" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Did the police catch them?</p>
<p begin="00:47:02.122" end="00:47:03.823" style="s2">&gt;&gt; One.</p>
<p begin="00:47:03.122" end="00:47:05.922" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And?</p>
<p begin="00:47:03.823" end="00:47:08.023" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nothing useful. Burner phones, cash</p>
<p begin="00:47:05.922" end="00:47:09.723" style="s2">intermediaries, no direct client.</p>
<p begin="00:47:08.023" end="00:47:12.122" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m sorry.</p>
<p begin="00:47:09.723" end="00:47:12.122" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Are you?</p>
<p begin="00:47:14.023" end="00:47:19.122" style="s2">You like it?</p>
<p begin="00:47:16.122" end="00:47:19.122" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ve smelled it before.</p>
<p begin="00:47:20.723" end="00:47:23.523" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hey.</p>
<p begin="00:47:21.922" end="00:47:25.122" style="s2">She tried to break me.</p>
<p begin="00:47:23.523" end="00:47:26.223" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Something wrong?</p>
<p begin="00:47:25.122" end="00:47:29.223" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="00:47:26.223" end="00:47:29.223" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I remember her voice.</p>
<p begin="00:47:29.922" end="00:47:33.323" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What if the men talk?</p>
<p begin="00:47:31.523" end="00:47:34.823" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then clean it up.</p>
<p begin="00:47:33.323" end="00:47:36.223" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You mean the payment trail?</p>
<p begin="00:47:34.823" end="00:47:40.723" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Everything.</p>
<p begin="00:47:36.223" end="00:47:40.723" style="s2">Phones, accounts, people.</p>
<p begin="00:47:41.422" end="00:47:43.922" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why did you really come here?</p>
<p begin="00:47:42.922" end="00:47:45.323" style="s2">&gt;&gt; To see you.</p>
<p begin="00:47:43.922" end="00:47:46.922" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s all?</p>
<p begin="00:47:45.323" end="00:47:48.932" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I wanted to see how someone looks when</p>
<p begin="00:47:46.922" end="00:47:49.122" style="s2">they think they got away with something.</p>
<p begin="00:47:48.932" end="00:47:50.223" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="00:47:49.122" end="00:47:50.922" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Be careful, Nia.</p>
<p begin="00:47:50.223" end="00:47:52.823" style="s2">&gt;&gt; With what?</p>
<p begin="00:47:50.922" end="00:47:54.323" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Accusations. People who make reckless</p>
<p begin="00:47:52.823" end="00:47:56.422" style="s2">claims eventually lose credibility. Then</p>
<p begin="00:47:54.323" end="00:47:57.723" style="s2">it&#39;s lucky I prefer evidence. Oh, your</p>
<p begin="00:47:56.422" end="00:47:59.122" style="s2">grandfather wants the antique insurance</p>
<p begin="00:47:57.723" end="00:48:01.622" style="s2">files from last quarter. He said</p>
<p begin="00:47:59.122" end="00:48:01.622" style="s2">immediately.</p>
<p begin="00:48:05.323" end="00:48:07.122" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hurry.</p>
<p begin="00:48:06.023" end="00:48:07.922" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re coming with me.</p>
<p begin="00:48:07.122" end="00:48:09.023" style="s2">&gt;&gt; About time.</p>
<p begin="00:48:07.922" end="00:48:11.023" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re expecting them to challenge</p>
<p begin="00:48:09.023" end="00:48:12.622" style="s2">authenticity. That&#39;s not ambiguous.</p>
<p begin="00:48:11.023" end="00:48:14.422" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Preserve the original hardware, hash the</p>
<p begin="00:48:12.622" end="00:48:15.023" style="s2">files, document every recovery step.</p>
<p begin="00:48:14.422" end="00:48:16.823" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Of course they will.</p>
<p begin="00:48:15.023" end="00:48:18.422" style="s2">&gt;&gt; talk, then clean it up. Celeste told me</p>
<p begin="00:48:16.823" end="00:48:19.422" style="s2">to use North Star. She told me to hire</p>
<p begin="00:48:18.422" end="00:48:21.323" style="s2">people to scare Nia.</p>
<p begin="00:48:19.422" end="00:48:22.622" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Did she specify physical injury?</p>
<p begin="00:48:21.323" end="00:48:23.823" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She said hands.</p>
<p begin="00:48:22.622" end="00:48:24.523" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This goes to police now.</p>
<p begin="00:48:23.823" end="00:48:25.122" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes.</p>
<p begin="00:48:24.523" end="00:48:26.323" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And what will?</p>
<p begin="00:48:25.122" end="00:48:26.823" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They hear it from me first.</p>
<p begin="00:48:26.323" end="00:48:28.422" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Why?</p>
<p begin="00:48:26.823" end="00:48:30.023" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Because I want to see what they do when</p>
<p begin="00:48:28.422" end="00:48:31.323" style="s2">there&#39;s no reasonable excuse left.</p>
<p begin="00:48:30.023" end="00:48:33.422" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What if the men talk?</p>
<p begin="00:48:31.323" end="00:48:34.922" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then clean it up. Phones, accounts,</p>
<p begin="00:48:33.422" end="00:48:36.223" style="s2">people.</p>
<p begin="00:48:34.922" end="00:48:39.422" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Want to explain?</p>
<p begin="00:48:36.223" end="00:48:40.122" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That isn&#39;t me. That voice is fake.</p>
<p begin="00:48:39.422" end="00:48:41.523" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What are you doing?</p>
<p begin="00:48:40.122" end="00:48:43.122" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Making this easier.</p>
<p begin="00:48:41.523" end="00:48:44.523" style="s2">She can keep the daughter role. I&#39;m done</p>
<p begin="00:48:43.122" end="00:48:46.823" style="s2">competing for parents who keep asking me</p>
<p begin="00:48:44.523" end="00:48:46.823" style="s2">to loot.</p>
<p begin="00:48:48.122" end="00:48:51.823" style="s2">That isn&#39;t me.</p>
<p begin="00:48:49.622" end="00:48:54.723" style="s2">That voice is fake.</p>
<p begin="00:48:51.823" end="00:48:54.723" style="s2">I knew you&#39;d say that.</p>
<p begin="00:48:54.922" end="00:48:59.823" style="s2">Original recorder,</p>
<p begin="00:48:56.723" end="00:49:01.024" style="s2">original storage card, file hatches,</p>
<p begin="00:48:59.823" end="00:49:02.724" style="s2">recovery</p>
<p begin="00:49:01.024" end="00:49:03.424" style="s2">Nothing was generated, nothing was</p>
<p begin="00:49:02.724" end="00:49:06.724" style="s2">edited.</p>
<p begin="00:49:03.424" end="00:49:08.424" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The chain of custody appears intact.</p>
<p begin="00:49:06.724" end="00:49:10.624" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Celeste told me to use Northstar. She</p>
<p begin="00:49:08.424" end="00:49:13.124" style="s2">told me to hire people to scare Nia.</p>
<p begin="00:49:10.624" end="00:49:14.524" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Did she specify injury?</p>
<p begin="00:49:13.124" end="00:49:16.524" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She said hands.</p>
<p begin="00:49:14.524" end="00:49:18.324" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Melanie is calling. She&#39;ll say anything</p>
<p begin="00:49:16.524" end="00:49:20.024" style="s2">to save herself. An AI can imitate</p>
<p begin="00:49:18.324" end="00:49:21.324" style="s2">voices now. Everyone knows that. Then</p>
<p begin="00:49:20.024" end="00:49:22.624" style="s2">explain the original device.</p>
<p begin="00:49:21.324" end="00:49:25.124" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t know how it got there.</p>
<p begin="00:49:22.624" end="00:49:26.324" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It was in your desk.</p>
<p begin="00:49:25.124" end="00:49:28.024" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Enough.</p>
<p begin="00:49:26.324" end="00:49:30.224" style="s2">There is a recording, there is a</p>
<p begin="00:49:28.024" end="00:49:33.424" style="s2">witness, there is a payment trail. How</p>
<p begin="00:49:30.224" end="00:49:34.924" style="s2">much more should Nia have to prove?</p>
<p begin="00:49:33.424" end="00:49:36.524" style="s2">No one is saying this is nothing, but</p>
<p begin="00:49:34.924" end="00:49:37.724" style="s2">involving the police publicly right now</p>
<p begin="00:49:36.524" end="00:49:38.624" style="s2">could destroy the family.</p>
<p begin="00:49:37.724" end="00:49:39.324" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She was attacked.</p>
<p begin="00:49:38.624" end="00:49:41.624" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know.</p>
<p begin="00:49:39.324" end="00:49:44.724" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then what are you suggesting?</p>
<p begin="00:49:41.624" end="00:49:46.124" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Handle it internally first.</p>
<p begin="00:49:44.724" end="00:49:47.624" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Explain internally.</p>
<p begin="00:49:46.124" end="00:49:48.824" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Celeste steps back from the company. We</p>
<p begin="00:49:47.624" end="00:49:49.524" style="s2">review her accounts. She enters</p>
<p begin="00:49:48.824" end="00:49:51.124" style="s2">counseling.</p>
<p begin="00:49:49.524" end="00:49:52.124" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And the men who tried to break my hands?</p>
<p begin="00:49:51.124" end="00:49:53.724" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They face charges.</p>
<p begin="00:49:52.124" end="00:49:56.324" style="s2">&gt;&gt; But the person who hired them doesn&#39;t.</p>
<p begin="00:49:53.724" end="00:49:57.624" style="s2">Nia, we need this family to survive. So,</p>
<p begin="00:49:56.324" end="00:49:59.024" style="s2">there&#39;s been so much tension since you</p>
<p begin="00:49:57.624" end="00:50:00.224" style="s2">came back. If we all make one step</p>
<p begin="00:49:59.024" end="00:50:01.824" style="s2">towards each other, maybe you could</p>
<p begin="00:50:00.224" end="00:50:03.524" style="s2">apologize for accusing Celeste so</p>
<p begin="00:50:01.824" end="00:50:05.824" style="s2">publicly.</p>
<p begin="00:50:03.524" end="00:50:07.824" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You want me to apologize to her, not for</p>
<p begin="00:50:05.824" end="00:50:09.924" style="s2">what happened to you, then for what? For</p>
<p begin="00:50:07.824" end="00:50:11.124" style="s2">turning this into a public family war?</p>
<p begin="00:50:09.924" end="00:50:12.524" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Mom, no.</p>
<p begin="00:50:11.124" end="00:50:14.024" style="s2">She was attacked. She doesn&#39;t owe</p>
<p begin="00:50:12.524" end="00:50:15.824" style="s2">Celeste an apology.</p>
<p begin="00:50:14.024" end="00:50:17.724" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Adrian, when the necklace was planted in</p>
<p begin="00:50:15.824" end="00:50:19.024" style="s2">my room, you chose her. When the footage</p>
<p begin="00:50:17.724" end="00:50:20.324" style="s2">pointed to her, you chose her. Now</p>
<p begin="00:50:19.024" end="00:50:21.424" style="s2">there&#39;s a witness, money, and her own</p>
<p begin="00:50:20.324" end="00:50:22.024" style="s2">voice, and you still choose her.</p>
<p begin="00:50:21.424" end="00:50:24.624" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s not fair.</p>
<p begin="00:50:22.024" end="00:50:25.324" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It&#39;s consistent.</p>
<p begin="00:50:24.624" end="00:50:26.724" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What are you doing?</p>
<p begin="00:50:25.324" end="00:50:28.224" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Making this easier.</p>
<p begin="00:50:26.724" end="00:50:29.624" style="s2">She can keep the daughter role. I&#39;m done</p>
<p begin="00:50:28.224" end="00:50:30.124" style="s2">competing for parents who keep asking me</p>
<p begin="00:50:29.624" end="00:50:31.524" style="s2">to lose.</p>
<p begin="00:50:30.124" end="00:50:32.624" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nia.</p>
<p begin="00:50:31.524" end="00:50:33.624" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This isn&#39;t about you.</p>
<p begin="00:50:32.624" end="00:50:35.324" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then stay for me.</p>
<p begin="00:50:33.624" end="00:50:36.124" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If I stay like this, I&#39;ll start hating</p>
<p begin="00:50:35.324" end="00:50:37.424" style="s2">everyone in this house.</p>
<p begin="00:50:36.124" end="00:50:38.424" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nia.</p>
<p begin="00:50:37.424" end="00:50:39.224" style="s2">You should have taken the apology. Now</p>
<p begin="00:50:38.424" end="00:50:40.224" style="s2">you have no idea what you&#39;re walking</p>
<p begin="00:50:39.224" end="00:50:41.724" style="s2">away from. I know exactly what I&#39;m</p>
<p begin="00:50:40.224" end="00:50:43.124" style="s2">walking away from. You. That&#39;s the</p>
<p begin="00:50:41.724" end="00:50:45.124" style="s2">difference between us. I was somebody</p>
<p begin="00:50:43.124" end="00:50:46.124" style="s2">before I knew their name.</p>
<p begin="00:50:45.124" end="00:50:46.924" style="s2">I want every stone narrowed before</p>
<p begin="00:50:46.124" end="00:50:47.724" style="s2">competition day.</p>
<p begin="00:50:46.924" end="00:50:50.324" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That won&#39;t be cheap.</p>
<p begin="00:50:47.724" end="00:50:50.324" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Neither is losing.</p>
<p begin="00:50:51.024" end="00:50:54.824" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Miss Carter,</p>
<p begin="00:50:52.524" end="00:50:57.024" style="s2">are you certain?</p>
<p begin="00:50:54.824" end="00:50:58.924" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Completely.</p>
<p begin="00:50:57.024" end="00:51:01.824" style="s2">What is all this?</p>
<p begin="00:50:58.924" end="00:51:02.825" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Everything the Whitmans gave me.</p>
<p begin="00:51:01.824" end="00:51:04.125" style="s2">The car,</p>
<p begin="00:51:02.825" end="00:51:05.325" style="s2">the card,</p>
<p begin="00:51:04.125" end="00:51:06.825" style="s2">the jewelry,</p>
<p begin="00:51:05.325" end="00:51:08.925" style="s2">the room.</p>
<p begin="00:51:06.825" end="00:51:10.025" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What exactly are you trying to prove?</p>
<p begin="00:51:08.925" end="00:51:11.325" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nothing.</p>
<p begin="00:51:10.025" end="00:51:13.025" style="s2">That&#39;s the point.</p>
<p begin="00:51:11.325" end="00:51:14.625" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So you&#39;re rejecting the family?</p>
<p begin="00:51:13.025" end="00:51:16.125" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m rejecting dependence.</p>
<p begin="00:51:14.625" end="00:51:18.025" style="s2">&gt;&gt; There is still the matter of your trust</p>
<p begin="00:51:16.125" end="00:51:18.625" style="s2">voting rights. Will you return those as</p>
<p begin="00:51:18.025" end="00:51:20.725" style="s2">well?</p>
<p begin="00:51:18.625" end="00:51:22.025" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="00:51:20.725" end="00:51:23.625" style="s2">These shares were held for the missing</p>
<p begin="00:51:22.025" end="00:51:25.125" style="s2">daughter.</p>
<p begin="00:51:23.625" end="00:51:26.925" style="s2">That daughter is me.</p>
<p begin="00:51:25.125" end="00:51:28.225" style="s2">So you don&#39;t want the family, just the</p>
<p begin="00:51:26.925" end="00:51:29.925" style="s2">power. You really want to talk about</p>
<p begin="00:51:28.225" end="00:51:31.425" style="s2">taking things that aren&#39;t yours?</p>
<p begin="00:51:29.925" end="00:51:32.325" style="s2">Those shares affect all of us. Then you</p>
<p begin="00:51:31.425" end="00:51:35.225" style="s2">should have thought about that before</p>
<p begin="00:51:32.325" end="00:51:37.125" style="s2">trying to break my hands.</p>
<p begin="00:51:35.225" end="00:51:39.725" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She keeps the shares. That. No</p>
<p begin="00:51:37.125" end="00:51:39.725" style="s2">discussion.</p>
<p begin="00:51:39.925" end="00:51:41.825" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fine.</p>
<p begin="00:51:40.925" end="00:51:43.325" style="s2">Then let&#39;s talk about what you&#39;re</p>
<p begin="00:51:41.825" end="00:51:45.325" style="s2">actually good at.</p>
<p begin="00:51:43.325" end="00:51:47.425" style="s2">3 days from now, international gem</p>
<p begin="00:51:45.325" end="00:51:47.825" style="s2">appraisal open. No family name can help</p>
<p begin="00:51:47.425" end="00:51:48.725" style="s2">you there.</p>
<p begin="00:51:47.825" end="00:51:49.925" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Celeste.</p>
<p begin="00:51:48.725" end="00:51:52.425" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You keep saying you built your value</p>
<p begin="00:51:49.925" end="00:51:54.125" style="s2">before the Whitmores. Prove it.</p>
<p begin="00:51:52.425" end="00:51:56.125" style="s2">What exactly are you challenging me to?</p>
<p begin="00:51:54.125" end="00:51:58.525" style="s2">Same competition, same stones, same</p>
<p begin="00:51:56.125" end="00:51:59.725" style="s2">judges? Let the world decide.</p>
<p begin="00:51:58.525" end="00:52:01.625" style="s2">Afraid antique ghosts won&#39;t help with</p>
<p begin="00:51:59.725" end="00:52:03.125" style="s2">gemstones? No. I&#39;m wondering why you</p>
<p begin="00:52:01.625" end="00:52:05.125" style="s2">need 3 days to prepare against someone</p>
<p begin="00:52:03.125" end="00:52:06.925" style="s2">you think is a fraud.</p>
<p begin="00:52:05.125" end="00:52:07.825" style="s2">I&#39;ll be there.</p>
<p begin="00:52:06.925" end="00:52:10.825" style="s2">Don&#39;t bring the Whitman name as an</p>
<p begin="00:52:07.825" end="00:52:10.825" style="s2">excuse when you lose.</p>
<p begin="00:52:14.025" end="00:52:16.525" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Need a ride?</p>
<p begin="00:52:17.125" end="00:52:19.725" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That depends.</p>
<p begin="00:52:23.825" end="00:52:26.125" style="s2">Dr. Mercer,</p>
<p begin="00:52:25.025" end="00:52:26.825" style="s2">I want every stone narrowed before</p>
<p begin="00:52:26.125" end="00:52:27.625" style="s2">competition day.</p>
<p begin="00:52:26.825" end="00:52:30.425" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That won&#39;t be cheap.</p>
<p begin="00:52:27.625" end="00:52:30.425" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Neither is losing.</p>
<p begin="00:52:40.425" end="00:52:43.025" style="s2">When this is over, maybe you&#39;ll finally</p>
<p begin="00:52:41.725" end="00:52:44.925" style="s2">understand expertise these can&#39;t be</p>
<p begin="00:52:43.025" end="00:52:46.325" style="s2">inherited. Good. Then no one gets to</p>
<p begin="00:52:44.925" end="00:52:48.825" style="s2">blame blood when they lose. Let the</p>
<p begin="00:52:46.325" end="00:52:50.525" style="s2">world see who&#39;s really blind.</p>
<p begin="00:52:48.825" end="00:52:51.525" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nia Carter, is this really a challenge</p>
<p begin="00:52:50.525" end="00:52:53.425" style="s2">against Celeste Whitwill?</p>
<p begin="00:52:51.525" end="00:52:54.325" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I came to appraise stones, not family</p>
<p begin="00:52:53.425" end="00:52:55.225" style="s2">drama.</p>
<p begin="00:52:54.325" end="00:52:57.025" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nia Whitwill?</p>
<p begin="00:52:55.225" end="00:52:59.725" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Carter. That&#39;s the name I entered under.</p>
<p begin="00:52:57.025" end="00:53:00.925" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Of course, Ms. Carter. Dr. Mercer, good</p>
<p begin="00:52:59.725" end="00:53:02.625" style="s2">to see you again.</p>
<p begin="00:53:00.925" end="00:53:03.525" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nia, you know Dr. Mercer?</p>
<p begin="00:53:02.625" end="00:53:04.927" style="s2">&gt;&gt; By reputation.</p>
<p begin="00:53:03.525" end="00:53:07.127" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And I know you by headlines.</p>
