<p begin="01:10:57.038" end="01:11:00.838" style="s2">Hold on.</p>
<p begin="01:10:59.238" end="01:11:03.738" style="s2">What is that?</p>
<p begin="01:11:00.838" end="01:11:03.738" style="s2">That doesn&#39;t look mineral.</p>
