<p begin="01:11:55.539" end="01:12:00.739" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Same employee, 19 minutes.</p>
<p begin="01:11:57.839" end="01:12:00.739" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then arrest him.</p>
<p begin="01:12:02.839" end="01:12:06.739" style="s2">The water was contaminated, a sedative</p>
