<p begin="01:12:21.539" end="01:12:24.539" style="s2">That&#39;s why you&#39;re still here.</p>
<p begin="01:12:25.975" end="01:12:29.239" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="01:12:26.839" end="01:12:32.039" style="s2">Same employee, 19 minutes.</p>
