<p begin="01:12:51.939" end="01:12:54.439" style="s2">Melanie.</p>
<p begin="01:12:56.339" end="01:12:59.139" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We need to speak privately about keeping</p>
<p begin="01:12:58.139" end="01:13:01.439" style="s2">this from becoming bigger than it</p>
