<p begin="01:13:07.139" end="01:13:10.439" style="s2">competition stone? And your first</p>
<p begin="01:13:08.739" end="01:13:12.039" style="s2">question is how quiet I can be?</p>
<p begin="01:13:10.439" end="01:13:13.139" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This affects thousands of employees,</p>
<p begin="01:13:12.039" end="01:13:15.239" style="s2">lenders, shareholders.</p>
<p begin="01:13:13.139" end="01:13:16.439" style="s2">&gt;&gt; There it is. Every time she hurts me,</p>
<p begin="01:13:15.239" end="01:13:17.039" style="s2">you find a larger number of people who</p>
<p begin="01:13:16.439" end="01:13:18.239" style="s2">matter more.</p>
<p begin="01:13:17.039" end="01:13:20.339" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What do you want us to do?</p>
<p begin="01:13:18.239" end="01:13:21.639" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nothing. I&#39;m not asking you to choose me</p>
