<p begin="01:13:25.039" end="01:13:27.539" style="s2">within Whitmore Heritage, expanded</p>
<p begin="01:13:26.439" end="01:13:28.239" style="s2">family authority.</p>
<p begin="01:13:27.539" end="01:13:29.639" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What do I give up?</p>
<p begin="01:13:28.239" end="01:13:31.140" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Certain public statements require prior</p>
<p begin="01:13:29.639" end="01:13:32.240" style="s2">approval. Some voting activity would</p>
