<p begin="01:13:32.240" end="01:13:35.340" style="s2">committee.</p>
<p begin="01:13:32.740" end="01:13:36.540" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So this isn&#39;t recognition? It&#39;s a leash.</p>
<p begin="01:13:35.340" end="01:13:37.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m protecting this family.</p>
<p begin="01:13:36.540" end="01:13:38.540" style="s2">&gt;&gt; From your daughter?</p>
