<p begin="01:13:38.540" end="01:13:41.540" style="s2">family he can control.</p>
<p begin="01:13:43.740" end="01:13:46.940" style="s2">You call this recognition?</p>
<p begin="01:13:45.340" end="01:13:47.940" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It formalizes your position in the</p>
<p begin="01:13:46.940" end="01:13:48.840" style="s2">family.</p>
<p begin="01:13:47.940" end="01:13:52.440" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="01:13:48.840" end="01:13:52.440" style="s2">It formalizes your control over me.</p>
<p begin="01:13:52.540" end="01:13:56.540" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It protects everyone.</p>
<p begin="01:13:55.540" end="01:13:58.140" style="s2">&gt;&gt; From what?</p>
<p begin="01:13:56.540" end="01:14:00.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Impulsive statements,</p>
