<p begin="01:14:30.540" end="01:14:32.640" style="s2">your first instinct is to put terms on</p>
<p begin="01:14:32.340" end="01:14:33.840" style="s2">her?</p>
<p begin="01:14:32.640" end="01:14:34.740" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m protecting this family.</p>
