<p begin="01:14:34.740" end="01:14:38.840" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He&#39;s protecting the version of the</p>
<p begin="01:14:35.740" end="01:14:38.840" style="s2">family he can control.</p>
<p begin="01:14:39.040" end="01:14:42.540" style="s2">Just sign it. You get the title, the</p>
<p begin="01:14:41.040" end="01:14:44.140" style="s2">shares, the public recognition. Isn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="01:14:42.540" end="01:14:45.740" style="s2">that what you wanted? My identity isn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="01:14:44.140" end="01:14:47.540" style="s2">a gift. My voting rights aren&#39;t a</p>
<p begin="01:14:45.740" end="01:14:49.440" style="s2">reward. And being treated like your</p>
<p begin="01:14:47.540" end="01:14:51.940" style="s2">daughter shouldn&#39;t require a signature.</p>
<p begin="01:14:49.440" end="01:14:53.340" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You want full freedom? Fine. But freedom</p>
<p begin="01:14:51.940" end="01:14:56.140" style="s2">comes with consequences.</p>
<p begin="01:14:53.340" end="01:14:58.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Perfect. Stop shielding me.</p>
<p begin="01:14:56.140" end="01:14:59.540" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The Carter Imperial Green remains fully</p>
<p begin="01:14:58.240" end="01:15:01.240" style="s2">certified.</p>
<p begin="01:14:59.540" end="01:15:02.140" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who has the stage next?</p>
<p begin="01:15:01.240" end="01:15:03.340" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You do.</p>
<p begin="01:15:02.140" end="01:15:05.240" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nia,</p>
<p begin="01:15:03.340" end="01:15:07.840" style="s2">please don&#39;t do this publicly.</p>
<p begin="01:15:05.240" end="01:15:07.840" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Neither can I.</p>
<p begin="01:15:08.340" end="01:15:12.940" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Our provisional leader, Nia Carter.</p>
<p begin="01:15:10.940" end="01:15:15.140" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Before that, my biological family</p>
<p begin="01:15:12.940" end="01:15:17.040" style="s2">offered me what they called recognition.</p>
<p begin="01:15:15.140" end="01:15:18.540" style="s2">My public statements require approval.</p>
<p begin="01:15:17.040" end="01:15:20.040" style="s2">My voting actions require family</p>
<p begin="01:15:18.540" end="01:15:21.640" style="s2">coordination.</p>
<p begin="01:15:20.040" end="01:15:24.640" style="s2">If I sign this,</p>
<p begin="01:15:21.640" end="01:15:27.340" style="s2">am I finally your daughter?</p>
<p begin="01:15:24.640" end="01:15:27.340" style="s2">That&#39;s what I thought.</p>
<p begin="01:15:32.340" end="01:15:35.942" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Do you have any idea what just did?</p>
<p begin="01:15:34.942" end="01:15:37.342" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes.</p>
<p begin="01:15:35.942" end="01:15:40.342" style="s2">I said no.</p>
<p begin="01:15:37.342" end="01:15:42.242" style="s2">&gt;&gt; In front of the entire world?</p>
<p begin="01:15:40.342" end="01:15:43.742" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You expected me to sign it.</p>
<p begin="01:15:42.242" end="01:15:46.042" style="s2">I chose to reject it where everyone</p>
<p begin="01:15:43.742" end="01:15:47.942" style="s2">could see.</p>
<p begin="01:15:46.042" end="01:15:49.542" style="s2">Everyone kept asking whether I deserved</p>
<p begin="01:15:47.942" end="01:15:51.142" style="s2">to be a Whitley.</p>
<p begin="01:15:49.542" end="01:15:52.642" style="s2">Wrong question.</p>
<p begin="01:15:51.142" end="01:15:54.042" style="s2">I never came here to prove I deserved</p>
<p begin="01:15:52.642" end="01:15:55.642" style="s2">you.</p>
<p begin="01:15:54.042" end="01:15:57.242" style="s2">I had a name.</p>
<p begin="01:15:55.642" end="01:15:58.942" style="s2">I had a family.</p>
<p begin="01:15:57.242" end="01:16:01.042" style="s2">I had a life before you offered me</p>
<p begin="01:15:58.942" end="01:16:03.242" style="s2">money.</p>
<p begin="01:16:01.042" end="01:16:05.542" style="s2">I wasn&#39;t being tested.</p>
<p begin="01:16:03.242" end="01:16:07.942" style="s2">You were.</p>
<p begin="01:16:05.542" end="01:16:09.242" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We lost you for 22 years. We were trying</p>
<p begin="01:16:07.942" end="01:16:11.742" style="s2">to hold this family together.</p>
<p begin="01:16:09.242" end="01:16:13.942" style="s2">&gt;&gt; asking me to be smaller?</p>
<p begin="01:16:11.742" end="01:16:16.342" style="s2">A necklace was planted in my room.</p>
<p begin="01:16:13.942" end="01:16:18.142" style="s2">Evidence pointed at Celeste. You asked</p>
<p begin="01:16:16.342" end="01:16:20.142" style="s2">me to stay quiet.</p>
<p begin="01:16:18.142" end="01:16:21.542" style="s2">Men came for my hands.</p>
<p begin="01:16:20.142" end="01:16:23.742" style="s2">Again, you asked me to protect the</p>
<p begin="01:16:21.542" end="01:16:25.142" style="s2">family.</p>
<p begin="01:16:23.742" end="01:16:27.642" style="s2">Even now you checked if she was okay</p>
<p begin="01:16:25.142" end="01:16:29.742" style="s2">before you looked at me.</p>
<p begin="01:16:27.642" end="01:16:30.342" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This family is bigger than any one</p>
<p begin="01:16:29.742" end="01:16:32.742" style="s2">person.</p>
<p begin="01:16:30.342" end="01:16:35.642" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Exactly. That&#39;s what you say whenever</p>
<p begin="01:16:32.742" end="01:16:37.142" style="s2">I&#39;m the one getting hurt.</p>
<p begin="01:16:35.642" end="01:16:37.642" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I have responsibilities you don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="01:16:37.142" end="01:16:39.542" style="s2">understand.</p>
<p begin="01:16:37.642" end="01:16:41.242" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then stop calling those responsibilities</p>
<p begin="01:16:39.542" end="01:16:43.042" style="s2">love.</p>
<p begin="01:16:41.242" end="01:16:46.342" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let her finish.</p>
<p begin="01:16:43.042" end="01:16:47.642" style="s2">She spent 22 years without us.</p>
<p begin="01:16:46.342" end="01:16:48.742" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You were proving whether you deserved</p>
<p begin="01:16:47.642" end="01:16:51.242" style="s2">me.</p>
<p begin="01:16:48.742" end="01:16:51.242" style="s2">And you failed.</p>
<p begin="01:16:52.342" end="01:16:54.242" style="s2">I&#39;m done auditioning to be your</p>
<p begin="01:16:53.542" end="01:16:55.942" style="s2">daughter.</p>
<p begin="01:16:54.242" end="01:16:57.342" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then give up the Whitmums shares. You</p>
<p begin="01:16:55.942" end="01:16:58.142" style="s2">can&#39;t reject the family and keep its</p>
<p begin="01:16:57.342" end="01:16:59.142" style="s2">power.</p>
<p begin="01:16:58.142" end="01:17:01.342" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="01:16:59.142" end="01:17:03.242" style="s2">I&#39;m rejecting your control, not my legal</p>
<p begin="01:17:01.342" end="01:17:04.742" style="s2">rights.</p>
<p begin="01:17:03.242" end="01:17:07.942" style="s2">Those rights were mine before you</p>
<p begin="01:17:04.742" end="01:17:09.642" style="s2">decided whether I was convenient.</p>
<p begin="01:17:07.942" end="01:17:11.542" style="s2">I came here to appraise stones. That</p>
<p begin="01:17:09.642" end="01:17:12.842" style="s2">part is finished. So is this.</p>
<p begin="01:17:11.542" end="01:17:14.542" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Whatever you think of us, we are still</p>
<p begin="01:17:12.842" end="01:17:15.842" style="s2">your parents. I gave birth to you.</p>
<p begin="01:17:14.542" end="01:17:16.042" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And what exactly do you think that gives</p>
<p begin="01:17:15.842" end="01:17:17.442" style="s2">you?</p>
<p begin="01:17:16.042" end="01:17:20.242" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Enough. You will not speak to your</p>
<p begin="01:17:17.442" end="01:17:20.242" style="s2">mother like that.</p>
<p begin="01:17:22.693" end="01:17:24.842" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="01:17:23.042" end="01:17:26.842" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="01:17:24.842" end="01:17:29.042" style="s2">let go of me when you stop trying to hit</p>
<p begin="01:17:26.842" end="01:17:29.042" style="s2">me.</p>
<p begin="01:17:29.642" end="01:17:32.842" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Release your mother now.</p>
<p begin="01:17:31.742" end="01:17:33.942" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She tried to hit me.</p>
<p begin="01:17:32.842" end="01:17:35.243" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She is your mother.</p>
<p begin="01:17:33.942" end="01:17:37.743" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Those two sentences have nothing to do</p>
<p begin="01:17:35.243" end="01:17:37.743" style="s2">with each other.</p>
<p begin="01:17:38.843" end="01:17:41.443" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You embarrass me in front of everyone.</p>
<p begin="01:17:40.543" end="01:17:43.643" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You raised your hand in front of</p>
<p begin="01:17:41.443" end="01:17:45.243" style="s2">everyone.</p>
<p begin="01:17:43.643" end="01:17:46.443" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I am your father.</p>
<p begin="01:17:45.243" end="01:17:49.143" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Biologically?</p>
<p begin="01:17:46.443" end="01:17:51.143" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You will show some respect.</p>
<p begin="01:17:49.143" end="01:17:54.343" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Respect isn&#39;t obedience,</p>
<p begin="01:17:51.143" end="01:17:54.343" style="s2">and blood isn&#39;t ownership.</p>
<p begin="01:17:55.543" end="01:17:59.843" style="s2">You gave birth to me.</p>
<p begin="01:17:57.543" end="01:18:01.143" style="s2">That gives you a place in my history.</p>
<p begin="01:17:59.843" end="01:18:03.843" style="s2">It does not give you the right to</p>
<p begin="01:18:01.143" end="01:18:06.343" style="s2">humiliate me.</p>
<p begin="01:18:03.843" end="01:18:08.443" style="s2">You searched my room.</p>
<p begin="01:18:06.343" end="01:18:10.143" style="s2">You called me a thief.</p>
<p begin="01:18:08.443" end="01:18:11.543" style="s2">You asked me to back down after I was</p>
<p begin="01:18:10.143" end="01:18:13.143" style="s2">attacked.</p>
<p begin="01:18:11.543" end="01:18:14.743" style="s2">And you made love conditional on my</p>
<p begin="01:18:13.143" end="01:18:16.543" style="s2">silence.</p>
<p begin="01:18:14.743" end="01:18:18.543" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You have no idea what it takes to hold a</p>
<p begin="01:18:16.543" end="01:18:19.843" style="s2">family like this together.</p>
<p begin="01:18:18.543" end="01:18:21.143" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Maybe.</p>
<p begin="01:18:19.843" end="01:18:23.543" style="s2">But I know what it feels like to be the</p>
<p begin="01:18:21.143" end="01:18:25.143" style="s2">person you keep sacrificing.</p>
<p begin="01:18:23.543" end="01:18:26.143" style="s2">You&#39;re acting like everyone here plotted</p>
<p begin="01:18:25.143" end="01:18:27.243" style="s2">against you.</p>
<p begin="01:18:26.143" end="01:18:29.043" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="01:18:27.243" end="01:18:30.543" style="s2">Some people plotted.</p>
<p begin="01:18:29.043" end="01:18:32.743" style="s2">Others just kept asking me to forgive</p>
<p begin="01:18:30.543" end="01:18:32.743" style="s2">it.</p>
<p begin="01:18:33.443" end="01:18:37.643" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Dad, tell her this has gone far enough.</p>
<p begin="01:18:35.543" end="01:18:39.243" style="s2">She&#39;s tearing this family apart.</p>
<p begin="01:18:37.643" end="01:18:40.943" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="01:18:39.243" end="01:18:42.643" style="s2">She&#39;s refusing to hold together what you</p>
<p begin="01:18:40.943" end="01:18:44.443" style="s2">keep breaking.</p>
<p begin="01:18:42.643" end="01:18:46.543" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If you walk away now, what are we</p>
<p begin="01:18:44.443" end="01:18:48.543" style="s2">supposed to be?</p>
<p begin="01:18:46.543" end="01:18:50.943" style="s2">DNA told me where I came from. It didn&#39;t</p>
<p begin="01:18:48.543" end="01:18:52.743" style="s2">tell me where I belong.</p>
<p begin="01:18:50.943" end="01:18:55.049" style="s2">That part is built</p>
<p begin="01:18:52.743" end="01:18:56.243" style="s2">or destroyed.</p>
<p begin="01:18:55.049" end="01:18:57.143" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="01:18:56.243" end="01:19:00.043" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You done?</p>
<p begin="01:18:57.143" end="01:19:02.143" style="s2">&gt;&gt; With today? Almost.</p>
<p begin="01:19:00.043" end="01:19:03.143" style="s2">Tomorrow my lawyer will send the papers.</p>
<p begin="01:19:02.143" end="01:19:05.343" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What papers?</p>
<p begin="01:19:03.143" end="01:19:08.443" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The ones that make one thing clear.</p>
<p begin="01:19:05.343" end="01:19:09.843" style="s2">You don&#39;t own my life anymore.</p>
<p begin="01:19:08.443" end="01:19:10.743" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You walk away from the family but keep</p>
<p begin="01:19:09.843" end="01:19:11.943" style="s2">the voting power?</p>
<p begin="01:19:10.743" end="01:19:14.443" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Because the voting rights are not your</p>
<p begin="01:19:11.943" end="01:19:14.443" style="s2">allowance.</p>
<p begin="01:19:14.743" end="01:19:18.043" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This confirms Miss Carter&#39;s withdrawal</p>
<p begin="01:19:16.543" end="01:19:19.943" style="s2">from all Whitwood funded personal</p>
<p begin="01:19:18.043" end="01:19:22.043" style="s2">benefits, effective immediately.</p>
<p begin="01:19:19.943" end="01:19:24.043" style="s2">Residence access, family vehicles,</p>
<p begin="01:19:22.043" end="01:19:26.043" style="s2">expense accounts, allowances, family</p>
<p begin="01:19:24.043" end="01:19:27.743" style="s2">funded representation and security.</p>
<p begin="01:19:26.043" end="01:19:28.743" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And the shares?</p>
<p begin="01:19:27.743" end="01:19:30.143" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I keep them.</p>
<p begin="01:19:28.743" end="01:19:31.143" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You walk away from the family but keep</p>
<p begin="01:19:30.143" end="01:19:32.243" style="s2">the voting power?</p>
<p begin="01:19:31.143" end="01:19:33.743" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Because the voting rights are not your</p>
<p begin="01:19:32.243" end="01:19:35.343" style="s2">allowance. They were created for the</p>
<p begin="01:19:33.743" end="01:19:37.143" style="s2">missing Whitwood daughter. That daughter</p>
<p begin="01:19:35.343" end="01:19:38.445" style="s2">turned out to be me. I am not</p>
<p begin="01:19:37.143" end="01:19:40.744" style="s2">surrendering legal rights to make my</p>
<p begin="01:19:38.445" end="01:19:42.945" style="s2">independence easier for you.</p>
<p begin="01:19:40.744" end="01:19:44.644" style="s2">I do not want their house, their cars,</p>
<p begin="01:19:42.945" end="01:19:45.744" style="s2">their accounts, their permission.</p>
<p begin="01:19:44.644" end="01:19:47.744" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then what do you want?</p>
<p begin="01:19:45.744" end="01:19:49.344" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My own life.</p>
<p begin="01:19:47.744" end="01:19:50.445" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You make everything we gave you sound</p>
<p begin="01:19:49.344" end="01:19:52.144" style="s2">like a chain.</p>
<p begin="01:19:50.445" end="01:19:53.644" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Not everything.</p>
<p begin="01:19:52.144" end="01:19:55.445" style="s2">A gift stops being a gift when you use</p>
<p begin="01:19:53.644" end="01:19:57.644" style="s2">it to demand obedience.</p>
<p begin="01:19:55.445" end="01:19:59.844" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She already returned everything. Adrian,</p>
<p begin="01:19:57.644" end="01:20:01.844" style="s2">I am just stating the truth.</p>
<p begin="01:19:59.844" end="01:20:03.045" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You do not have to cut me out with them.</p>
<p begin="01:20:01.844" end="01:20:04.344" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I am not.</p>
<p begin="01:20:03.045" end="01:20:06.945" style="s2">But if we have a relationship, it has to</p>
<p begin="01:20:04.344" end="01:20:09.120" style="s2">be mine too.</p>
<p begin="01:20:06.945" end="01:20:09.120" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Fair. [snorts]</p>
<p begin="01:20:11.945" end="01:20:14.445" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nina, where are you going now?</p>
<p begin="01:20:13.045" end="01:20:15.945" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Forward.</p>
<p begin="01:20:14.445" end="01:20:17.545" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Are you leaving the Whittome family?</p>
<p begin="01:20:15.945" end="01:20:20.545" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I am leaving their control. I am not</p>
<p begin="01:20:17.545" end="01:20:20.545" style="s2">erasing my history.</p>
<p begin="01:20:25.445" end="01:20:27.445" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Done?</p>
<p begin="01:20:26.545" end="01:20:28.644" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Done.</p>
<p begin="01:20:27.445" end="01:20:30.545" style="s2">&gt;&gt; With them?</p>
<p begin="01:20:28.644" end="01:20:32.045" style="s2">&gt;&gt; With needing anything from them.</p>
<p begin="01:20:30.545" end="01:20:34.244" style="s2">You always open doors for women who walk</p>
<p begin="01:20:32.045" end="01:20:35.445" style="s2">away from billion dollar families?</p>
<p begin="01:20:34.244" end="01:20:37.644" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Only the ones who did not need me to</p>
<p begin="01:20:35.445" end="01:20:40.045" style="s2">save them. Where do you want to go?</p>
<p begin="01:20:37.644" end="01:20:40.744" style="s2">&gt;&gt; My place for now. I can afford better</p>
<p begin="01:20:40.045" end="01:20:43.045" style="s2">now.</p>
<p begin="01:20:40.744" end="01:20:43.045" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know.</p>
<p begin="01:20:43.445" end="01:20:47.344" style="s2">Cross Heritage suspended Whittome</p>
<p begin="01:20:45.045" end="01:20:49.945" style="s2">acquisitions. Credit partners are asking</p>
<p begin="01:20:47.344" end="01:20:49.945" style="s2">questions.</p>
<p begin="01:20:51.144" end="01:20:53.945" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You did that?</p>
<p begin="01:20:52.445" end="01:20:56.945" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Business decision.</p>
<p begin="01:20:53.945" end="01:20:59.045" style="s2">They became a bad risk.</p>
<p begin="01:20:56.945" end="01:21:01.844" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Voss will take everything you can move.</p>
<p begin="01:20:59.045" end="01:21:01.844" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then move faster.</p>
<p begin="01:21:04.445" end="01:21:08.144" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Three lenders froze new draw downs. Two</p>
<p begin="01:21:06.744" end="01:21:09.445" style="s2">auction credit partners suspended</p>
<p begin="01:21:08.144" end="01:21:10.744" style="s2">Whittome guarantees.</p>
<p begin="01:21:09.445" end="01:21:11.545" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That fast?</p>
<p begin="01:21:10.744" end="01:21:13.545" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="01:21:11.545" end="01:21:14.744" style="s2">Their problems were already there.</p>
<p begin="01:21:13.545" end="01:21:16.445" style="s2">The investigation and governance</p>
<p begin="01:21:14.744" end="01:21:18.545" style="s2">failures changed the risk.</p>
<p begin="01:21:16.445" end="01:21:19.945" style="s2">&gt;&gt; So Cross pulling out did this?</p>
<p begin="01:21:18.545" end="01:21:22.344" style="s2">So this is not revenge?</p>
<p begin="01:21:19.945" end="01:21:23.644" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Revenge is emotional. Risk is expensive.</p>
<p begin="01:21:22.344" end="01:21:24.945" style="s2">We are trying.</p>
<p begin="01:21:23.644" end="01:21:27.644" style="s2">No one wants in while the compliance</p>
<p begin="01:21:24.945" end="01:21:27.644" style="s2">review is open.</p>
<p begin="01:21:29.445" end="01:21:34.144" style="s2">Why are unrestricted reserves this low?</p>
<p begin="01:21:32.244" end="01:21:37.445" style="s2">Several large transfers were classified</p>
<p begin="01:21:34.144" end="01:21:39.144" style="s2">as acquisition deposits.</p>
<p begin="01:21:37.445" end="01:21:42.245" style="s2">&gt;&gt; For which acquisitions?</p>
<p begin="01:21:39.144" end="01:21:43.546" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Use non-core assets, art, jewelry,</p>
<p begin="01:21:42.245" end="01:21:44.745" style="s2">secondary properties.</p>
<p begin="01:21:43.546" end="01:21:47.046" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Selling under pressure is terrible</p>
<p begin="01:21:44.745" end="01:21:48.946" style="s2">timing. We have about 18 days of</p>
<p begin="01:21:47.046" end="01:21:51.046" style="s2">comfortable operating cash.</p>
<p begin="01:21:48.946" end="01:21:53.345" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 18 days?</p>
<p begin="01:21:51.046" end="01:21:54.345" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This started when Neo went public.</p>
<p begin="01:21:53.345" end="01:21:56.345" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="01:21:54.345" end="01:21:58.446" style="s2">These transfers are six months old.</p>
<p begin="01:21:56.345" end="01:22:00.146" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Acquisition deposits are not suspicious.</p>
<p begin="01:21:58.446" end="01:22:02.345" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I did not say they were.</p>
<p begin="01:22:00.146" end="01:22:04.146" style="s2">I asked where the money went.</p>
<p begin="01:22:02.345" end="01:22:05.146" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Prepare a liquidity plan. Sell what we</p>
<p begin="01:22:04.146" end="01:22:07.046" style="s2">do not need.</p>
<p begin="01:22:05.146" end="01:22:09.745" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I can handle private buyers.</p>
<p begin="01:22:07.046" end="01:22:09.745" style="s2">I already know them.</p>
<p begin="01:22:14.046" end="01:22:16.946" style="s2">Start liquidating perishable pieces</p>
<p begin="01:22:15.946" end="01:22:18.546" style="s2">first.</p>
<p begin="01:22:16.946" end="01:22:21.845" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Which account?</p>
<p begin="01:22:18.546" end="01:22:21.845" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Same destination as before.</p>
<p begin="01:22:22.446" end="01:22:25.446" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Feeling vindicated?</p>
<p begin="01:22:23.646" end="01:22:27.146" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No, just tired.</p>
<p begin="01:22:25.446" end="01:22:29.146" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Whitmore may have to sell assets.</p>
<p begin="01:22:27.146" end="01:22:30.446" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then they sell. Do not buy anything for</p>
<p begin="01:22:29.146" end="01:22:31.946" style="s2">me. I do not want their collapse to</p>
<p begin="01:22:30.446" end="01:22:34.046" style="s2">become my inheritance.</p>
<p begin="01:22:31.946" end="01:22:36.745" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Voss will take everything you can move.</p>
<p begin="01:22:34.046" end="01:22:36.745" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then move faster.</p>
<p begin="01:22:41.946" end="01:22:45.046" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What the hell is Meridian?</p>
<p begin="01:22:47.745" end="01:22:50.245" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yeah?</p>
<p begin="01:22:48.345" end="01:22:52.546" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Celeste, I need to ask you about $42</p>
<p begin="01:22:50.245" end="01:22:52.546" style="s2">million.</p>
<p begin="01:22:53.345" end="01:22:55.646" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ve seen that symbol before.</p>
<p begin="01:22:54.745" end="01:22:56.946" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Where?</p>
<p begin="01:22:55.646" end="01:22:59.646" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Inside the clock that was killing my</p>
<p begin="01:22:56.946" end="01:22:59.646" style="s2">grandfather.</p>
<p begin="01:23:02.946" end="01:23:09.146" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Celeste isn&#39;t just moving family money.</p>
<p begin="01:23:06.745" end="01:23:11.946" style="s2">42 million was only one transfer. We can</p>
<p begin="01:23:09.146" end="01:23:14.345" style="s2">trace more than 117 million. 26 50</p>
<p begin="01:23:11.946" end="01:23:14.345" style="s2">millions.</p>
<p begin="01:23:14.845" end="01:23:19.946" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And Meridian?</p>
<p begin="01:23:16.845" end="01:23:21.345" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Not a normal logistics company.</p>
<p begin="01:23:19.946" end="01:23:23.946" style="s2">It moves objects that are deliberately</p>
<p begin="01:23:21.345" end="01:23:23.946" style="s2">mislabeled.</p>
<p begin="01:23:24.345" end="01:23:26.946" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Exactly.</p>
<p begin="01:23:30.345" end="01:23:32.646" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What?</p>
<p begin="01:23:34.646" end="01:23:37.245" style="s2">Why is my name on this?</p>
<p begin="01:23:35.946" end="01:23:37.745" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You signed dozens of acquisition</p>
<p begin="01:23:37.245" end="01:23:39.646" style="s2">approvals.</p>
<p begin="01:23:37.745" end="01:23:42.345" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Not for Meridian.</p>
<p begin="01:23:39.646" end="01:23:42.345" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Apparently you did.</p>
<p begin="01:23:44.745" end="01:23:48.347" style="s2">What is Black Meridian?</p>
<p begin="01:23:46.747" end="01:23:50.547" style="s2">&gt;&gt; A private trading network for buyers who</p>
<p begin="01:23:48.347" end="01:23:51.847" style="s2">don&#39;t want provenance questions.</p>
<p begin="01:23:50.547" end="01:23:54.747" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Smuggling.</p>
<p begin="01:23:51.847" end="01:23:56.147" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s where the evidence points.</p>
<p begin="01:23:54.747" end="01:23:58.747" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who&#39;s GV?</p>
<p begin="01:23:56.147" end="01:23:58.747" style="s2">&gt;&gt; We don&#39;t know yet.</p>
<p begin="01:24:00.747" end="01:24:03.047" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;ve seen that symbol before.</p>
<p begin="01:24:02.147" end="01:24:04.347" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Where?</p>
<p begin="01:24:03.047" end="01:24:06.177" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Inside the clock that was killing my</p>
<p begin="01:24:04.347" end="01:24:07.447" style="s2">grandfather.</p>
<p begin="01:24:06.177" end="01:24:10.147" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [snorts]</p>
<p begin="01:24:07.447" end="01:24:13.447" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Insurance paid out three years ago.</p>
<p begin="01:24:10.147" end="01:24:13.447" style="s2">The object was never destroyed.</p>
<p begin="01:24:13.647" end="01:24:17.547" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It was moved.</p>
<p begin="01:24:15.047" end="01:24:17.547" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And sold.</p>
<p begin="01:24:19.147" end="01:24:22.147" style="s2">&gt;&gt; These aren&#39;t stolen watches.</p>
<p begin="01:24:21.147" end="01:24:24.447" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="01:24:22.147" end="01:24:26.847" style="s2">Rare cultural objects. Some have illegal</p>
<p begin="01:24:24.447" end="01:24:28.347" style="s2">provenance.</p>
<p begin="01:24:26.847" end="01:24:30.147" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How long?</p>
<p begin="01:24:28.347" end="01:24:31.847" style="s2">&gt;&gt; At least 18 months.</p>
<p begin="01:24:30.147" end="01:24:35.147" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The man with the snake,</p>
<p begin="01:24:31.847" end="01:24:35.147" style="s2">he knows you can hear us.</p>
<p begin="01:24:38.247" end="01:24:40.547" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Same mark.</p>
<p begin="01:24:39.147" end="01:24:41.547" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then someone brought that clock into the</p>
<p begin="01:24:40.547" end="01:24:43.047" style="s2">family.</p>
<p begin="01:24:41.547" end="01:24:44.247" style="s2">Where are the recovered objects?</p>
<p begin="01:24:43.047" end="01:24:47.247" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Customs has three.</p>
<p begin="01:24:44.247" end="01:24:47.247" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then we ask where they have been.</p>
<p begin="01:24:50.147" end="01:24:55.547" style="s2">Dark truck, no windows, salt in the air.</p>
<p begin="01:25:00.047" end="01:25:04.047" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Pier 17.</p>
<p begin="01:25:01.247" end="01:25:04.047" style="s2">&gt;&gt; First transfer point.</p>
<p begin="01:25:05.747" end="01:25:12.347" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Cold, concrete, three knocks.</p>
<p begin="01:25:09.047" end="01:25:12.347" style="s2">M4, it was moved again.</p>
<p begin="01:25:12.747" end="01:25:17.647" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No company officially uses M4. Then</p>
<p begin="01:25:14.647" end="01:25:17.647" style="s2">someone wants it invisible.</p>
<p begin="01:25:19.847" end="01:25:23.147" style="s2">I found this under my authorization</p>
<p begin="01:25:21.247" end="01:25:24.847" style="s2">file. I do not remember signing it, but</p>
<p begin="01:25:23.147" end="01:25:25.747" style="s2">my signature is there. Celeste must have</p>
<p begin="01:25:24.847" end="01:25:26.647" style="s2">used my name.</p>
<p begin="01:25:25.747" end="01:25:28.147" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Maybe</p>
<p begin="01:25:26.647" end="01:25:30.447" style="s2">we find out how your signature got there</p>
<p begin="01:25:28.147" end="01:25:30.447" style="s2">first.</p>
<p begin="01:25:32.147" end="01:25:34.747" style="s2">You know that name?</p>
<p begin="01:25:33.347" end="01:25:36.047" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Everyone in private antiquities knows</p>
<p begin="01:25:34.747" end="01:25:38.347" style="s2">the company. Almost no one knows the</p>
<p begin="01:25:36.047" end="01:25:38.347" style="s2">man.</p>
<p begin="01:25:39.547" end="01:25:42.047" style="s2">&gt;&gt; GV.</p>
<p begin="01:25:40.747" end="01:25:44.247" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Same initials as the Black Meridian</p>
<p begin="01:25:42.047" end="01:25:44.247" style="s2">node.</p>
<p begin="01:25:44.547" end="01:25:46.948" style="s2">His public reputation is spotless.</p>
<p begin="01:25:46.547" end="01:25:50.549" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Either he</p>
<p begin="01:25:46.948" end="01:25:50.549" style="s2">&gt;&gt; is clean or someone cleans very well.</p>
<p begin="01:25:51.849" end="01:25:54.549" style="s2">Those are not stone samples.</p>
<p begin="01:25:53.649" end="01:25:57.948" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="01:25:54.549" end="01:25:57.948" style="s2">Authorized receiver G. Voss.</p>
<p begin="01:25:58.149" end="01:26:02.149" style="s2">You think Voss targeted our family?</p>
<p begin="01:26:00.149" end="01:26:04.948" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Someone using his network did. We still</p>
<p begin="01:26:02.149" end="01:26:04.948" style="s2">need proof it was him.</p>
<p begin="01:26:06.049" end="01:26:10.149" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Carter connected M4 to Meridian.</p>
<p begin="01:26:08.849" end="01:26:11.448" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Of course she did.</p>
<p begin="01:26:10.149" end="01:26:13.049" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Should we stop her?</p>
<p begin="01:26:11.448" end="01:26:14.749" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="01:26:13.049" end="01:26:17.849" style="s2">People who hear whispers eventually</p>
<p begin="01:26:14.749" end="01:26:17.849" style="s2">follow the loudest one.</p>
<p begin="01:26:18.349" end="01:26:21.149" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Who?</p>
<p begin="01:26:19.349" end="01:26:24.349" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The man with the snake.</p>
<p begin="01:26:21.149" end="01:26:24.349" style="s2">He knows you can hear us.</p>
<p begin="01:26:26.149" end="01:26:29.849" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 5 billion?</p>
<p begin="01:26:28.049" end="01:26:32.448" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Guaranteed by Whitmore Linked Assets.</p>
<p begin="01:26:29.849" end="01:26:32.448" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s fake.</p>
<p begin="01:26:32.649" end="01:26:38.549" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ink age, pressure, stroke rhythm,</p>
<p begin="01:26:35.649" end="01:26:38.549" style="s2">it is your signature.</p>
<p begin="01:26:39.749" end="01:26:42.849" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I never signed this.</p>
<p begin="01:26:41.049" end="01:26:44.649" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You signed something. You just did not</p>
<p begin="01:26:42.849" end="01:26:47.649" style="s2">know what it was.</p>
<p begin="01:26:44.649" end="01:26:47.649" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I was in Monaco that week.</p>
<p begin="01:26:49.549" end="01:26:53.749" style="s2">Whitmore Charity Gala.</p>
<p begin="01:26:51.948" end="01:26:57.149" style="s2">That was mine.</p>
<p begin="01:26:53.749" end="01:26:57.149" style="s2">Recovered from the Whitmore archive.</p>
<p begin="01:26:58.649" end="01:27:03.349" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Just sign the acquisition release.</p>
<p begin="01:27:02.149" end="01:27:06.649" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What am I signing?</p>
<p begin="01:27:03.349" end="01:27:06.649" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The shipping package from Paris.</p>
<p begin="01:27:07.249" end="01:27:11.749" style="s2">You already approved it.</p>
<p begin="01:27:08.948" end="01:27:12.749" style="s2">You signed where she pointed.</p>
<p begin="01:27:11.749" end="01:27:14.849" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She tricked me.</p>
<p begin="01:27:12.749" end="01:27:17.349" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes. And you signed without reading.</p>
<p begin="01:27:14.849" end="01:27:18.349" style="s2">Both can be true. She used you. You made</p>
<p begin="01:27:17.349" end="01:27:19.549" style="s2">it easy.</p>
<p begin="01:27:18.349" end="01:27:20.749" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The signature does not just approve</p>
<p begin="01:27:19.549" end="01:27:22.749" style="s2">transport.</p>
<p begin="01:27:20.749" end="01:27:23.948" style="s2">It guarantees a credit facility. Maximum</p>
<p begin="01:27:22.749" end="01:27:26.749" style="s2">exposure,</p>
<p begin="01:27:23.948" end="01:27:28.349" style="s2">5 billion dollars.</p>
<p begin="01:27:26.749" end="01:27:29.049" style="s2">Black Meridian drew the full facility in</p>
<p begin="01:27:28.349" end="01:27:30.049" style="s2">stages.</p>
<p begin="01:27:29.049" end="01:27:31.749" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Where did it go?</p>
<p begin="01:27:30.049" end="01:27:33.149" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Offshore art purchases and private</p>
<p begin="01:27:31.749" end="01:27:34.948" style="s2">freight.</p>
<p begin="01:27:33.149" end="01:27:36.849" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This cannot be enforceable.</p>
<p begin="01:27:34.948" end="01:27:38.349" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The signature appears authentic.</p>
<p begin="01:27:36.849" end="01:27:39.549" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 5 billion?</p>
<p begin="01:27:38.349" end="01:27:40.349" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Were you with Adrian when he signed</p>
<p begin="01:27:39.549" end="01:27:43.149" style="s2">this?</p>
<p begin="01:27:40.349" end="01:27:43.149" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I was at the gala.</p>
<p begin="01:27:43.849" end="01:27:47.149" style="s2">You signed it. No one held your hand.</p>
<p begin="01:27:46.049" end="01:27:48.450" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I was drunk.</p>
<p begin="01:27:47.149" end="01:27:51.550" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then you should not sign</p>
<p begin="01:27:48.450" end="01:27:51.550" style="s2">documents while drunk.</p>
<p begin="01:27:55.550" end="01:27:59.250" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The lender accelerated the facility. How</p>
<p begin="01:27:57.650" end="01:28:01.350" style="s2">long?</p>
<p begin="01:27:59.250" end="01:28:02.150" style="s2">72 hours.</p>
<p begin="01:28:01.350" end="01:28:03.150" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You did this.</p>
<p begin="01:28:02.150" end="01:28:04.050" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You think this family was going to</p>
<p begin="01:28:03.150" end="01:28:07.250" style="s2">survive anyway?</p>
<p begin="01:28:04.050" end="01:28:09.950" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Celeste, $5 billion, mom.</p>
<p begin="01:28:07.250" end="01:28:12.350" style="s2">There is no happy ending here.</p>
<p begin="01:28:09.950" end="01:28:13.450" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Freeze every account she can access.</p>
<p begin="01:28:12.350" end="01:28:15.150" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re freezing me?</p>
<p begin="01:28:13.450" end="01:28:17.150" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Until we know where the money went.</p>
<p begin="01:28:15.150" end="01:28:18.850" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What?</p>
<p begin="01:28:17.150" end="01:28:20.550" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The operating reserve moved 23 minutes</p>
<p begin="01:28:18.850" end="01:28:23.250" style="s2">ago. How much?</p>
<p begin="01:28:20.550" end="01:28:23.250" style="s2">$86 million.</p>
<p begin="01:28:26.750" end="01:28:30.650" style="s2">There&#39;s more. Destination, four offshore</p>
<p begin="01:28:28.950" end="01:28:32.450" style="s2">entities, all linked to Meridian</p>
<p begin="01:28:30.650" end="01:28:33.450" style="s2">intermediaries. You did this.</p>
<p begin="01:28:32.450" end="01:28:34.350" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You think this family was going to</p>
<p begin="01:28:33.450" end="01:28:37.550" style="s2">survive anyway?</p>
<p begin="01:28:34.350" end="01:28:39.450" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Celeste, $5 billion, mom.</p>
<p begin="01:28:37.550" end="01:28:41.150" style="s2">There is no happy ending here.</p>
<p begin="01:28:39.450" end="01:28:41.950" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Where is the money?</p>
<p begin="01:28:41.150" end="01:28:43.350" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Safe.</p>
<p begin="01:28:41.950" end="01:28:44.650" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Safe for who?</p>
<p begin="01:28:43.350" end="01:28:45.950" style="s2">For us</p>
<p begin="01:28:44.650" end="01:28:48.550" style="s2">or for you?</p>
<p begin="01:28:45.950" end="01:28:48.550" style="s2">Give me your phone.</p>
<p begin="01:28:48.850" end="01:28:51.050" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="01:28:54.150" end="01:28:55.850" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You don&#39;t get to walk away.</p>
<p begin="01:28:55.250" end="01:28:56.950" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Move.</p>
<p begin="01:28:55.850" end="01:28:58.450" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Did you know what that guarantee really</p>
<p begin="01:28:56.950" end="01:28:59.150" style="s2">was? Did you know?</p>
<p begin="01:28:58.450" end="01:28:59.950" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I knew enough.</p>
<p begin="01:28:59.150" end="01:29:00.250" style="s2">&gt;&gt; How long have you been planning to</p>
<p begin="01:28:59.950" end="01:29:01.050" style="s2">leave?</p>
<p begin="01:29:00.250" end="01:29:01.750" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Longer than you&#39;ve been paying</p>
<p begin="01:29:01.050" end="01:29:02.750" style="s2">attention.</p>
<p begin="01:29:01.750" end="01:29:03.850" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You used my signature.</p>
<p begin="01:29:02.750" end="01:29:05.050" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You gave it to me.</p>
<p begin="01:29:03.850" end="01:29:07.750" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I trusted you.</p>
<p begin="01:29:05.050" end="01:29:07.750" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That was your mistake.</p>
<p begin="01:29:11.950" end="01:29:15.050" style="s2">&gt;&gt; These were here this morning.</p>
<p begin="01:29:18.350" end="01:29:21.450" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Celeste took them?</p>
<p begin="01:29:34.150" end="01:29:37.250" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Do you have the funds? You got me drunk.</p>
<p begin="01:29:36.250" end="01:29:38.950" style="s2">You put the papers in front of me. You</p>
<p begin="01:29:37.250" end="01:29:40.150" style="s2">told me it was an acquisition release.</p>
<p begin="01:29:38.950" end="01:29:42.150" style="s2">You knew it was a guarantee.</p>
<p begin="01:29:40.150" end="01:29:44.950" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I knew you&#39;d sign.</p>
<p begin="01:29:42.150" end="01:29:44.950" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Because I trusted you?</p>
<p begin="01:29:49.750" end="01:29:51.751" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What does asset preservation mean?</p>
<p begin="01:29:51.450" end="01:29:53.651" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It means the</p>
<p begin="01:29:51.751" end="01:29:54.552" style="s2">&gt;&gt; property cannot be sold, transferred, or</p>
<p begin="01:29:53.651" end="01:29:55.552" style="s2">further encumbered.</p>
<p begin="01:29:54.552" end="01:29:57.751" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Temporarily?</p>
<p begin="01:29:55.552" end="01:29:58.552" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The lenders froze several core accounts.</p>
<p begin="01:29:57.751" end="01:29:59.751" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Payroll?</p>
<p begin="01:29:58.552" end="01:30:02.251" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Not yet.</p>
<p begin="01:29:59.751" end="01:30:04.451" style="s2">But we&#39;re close.</p>
<p begin="01:30:02.251" end="01:30:07.087" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Where is Celeste?</p>
<p begin="01:30:04.451" end="01:30:09.107" style="s2">Did she really take the money?</p>
<p begin="01:30:07.087" end="01:30:09.107" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [laughter]</p>
<p begin="01:30:24.117" end="01:30:26.137" style="s2">[snorts]</p>
<p begin="01:30:33.351" end="01:30:36.151" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Oh my god.</p>
<p begin="01:30:36.552" end="01:30:40.052" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The cash is already transferred.</p>
<p begin="01:30:40.851" end="01:30:45.651" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And your family?</p>
<p begin="01:30:42.552" end="01:30:45.651" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Not my problem anymore.</p>
<p begin="01:30:46.951" end="01:30:52.052" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Your brother signed the guarantee.</p>
<p begin="01:30:49.251" end="01:30:52.052" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then he can pay it.</p>
<p begin="01:30:55.951" end="01:30:58.651" style="s2">Mr. Voss.</p>
<p begin="01:30:59.351" end="01:31:02.851" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Did Carter touch any of these?</p>
<p begin="01:31:01.351" end="01:31:04.552" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Not these.</p>
<p begin="01:31:02.851" end="01:31:05.951" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good.</p>
<p begin="01:31:04.552" end="01:31:08.251" style="s2">I&#39;d prefer she not here where they&#39;re</p>
<p begin="01:31:05.951" end="01:31:08.251" style="s2">going.</p>
<p begin="01:31:19.651" end="01:31:22.351" style="s2">We have company.</p>
<p begin="01:31:28.351" end="01:31:30.851" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Adrian?</p>
<p begin="01:31:32.751" end="01:31:35.251" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You got me drunk. You put the papers in</p>
<p begin="01:31:34.351" end="01:31:36.951" style="s2">front of me. You told me it was an</p>
<p begin="01:31:35.251" end="01:31:37.651" style="s2">acquisition release. You knew it was a</p>
<p begin="01:31:36.951" end="01:31:39.651" style="s2">guarantee.</p>
<p begin="01:31:37.651" end="01:31:42.451" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I knew you&#39;d sign.</p>
<p begin="01:31:39.651" end="01:31:42.451" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Because I trusted you?</p>
<p begin="01:31:45.552" end="01:31:49.052" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What are you doing here?</p>
<p begin="01:31:47.451" end="01:31:50.151" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I came to see what you sold.</p>
<p begin="01:31:49.052" end="01:31:51.151" style="s2">Turns out it was all of us.</p>
<p begin="01:31:50.151" end="01:31:52.951" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t be dramatic.</p>
<p begin="01:31:51.151" end="01:31:54.552" style="s2">&gt;&gt; $5 billion feels It&#39;s dramatic. You got</p>
<p begin="01:31:52.951" end="01:31:55.752" style="s2">me drunk. You put the papers in front of</p>
<p begin="01:31:54.552" end="01:31:57.552" style="s2">me. You told me it was an acquisition</p>
<p begin="01:31:55.752" end="01:31:59.552" style="s2">release. You knew it was a guarantee.</p>
<p begin="01:31:57.552" end="01:32:00.653" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I knew you&#39;d sign.</p>
<p begin="01:31:59.552" end="01:32:02.352" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Because I trusted you?</p>
<p begin="01:32:00.653" end="01:32:03.752" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Exactly. You signed whatever I put in</p>
<p begin="01:32:02.352" end="01:32:05.452" style="s2">front of you. You defended me before</p>
<p begin="01:32:03.752" end="01:32:05.952" style="s2">anyone even asked. Why wouldn&#39;t I use</p>
<p begin="01:32:05.452" end="01:32:10.653" style="s2">that?</p>
<p begin="01:32:05.952" end="01:32:10.653" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Was any of it real? Us? 22 years</p>
<p begin="01:32:12.052" end="01:32:16.153" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You were useful.</p>
<p begin="01:32:13.503" end="01:32:17.752" style="s2">[snorts] You had access, a signature, a</p>
<p begin="01:32:16.153" end="01:32:19.452" style="s2">family name people trusted, and you</p>
<p begin="01:32:17.752" end="01:32:22.252" style="s2">never asked enough questions.</p>
<p begin="01:32:19.452" end="01:32:24.052" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Touching reunion.</p>
<p begin="01:32:22.252" end="01:32:24.852" style="s2">Unfortunately, sentiment makes people</p>
<p begin="01:32:24.052" end="01:32:27.452" style="s2">careless.</p>
<p begin="01:32:24.852" end="01:32:27.452" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Give me that.</p>
<p begin="01:32:32.352" end="01:32:35.752" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No, you saw nothing.</p>
<p begin="01:32:34.352" end="01:32:36.952" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I saw enough.</p>
<p begin="01:32:35.752" end="01:32:38.352" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What are you going to do with him?</p>
<p begin="01:32:36.952" end="01:32:40.153" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Nothing permanent.</p>
<p begin="01:32:38.352" end="01:32:42.352" style="s2">A dead Whitmore brings police. A</p>
<p begin="01:32:40.153" end="01:32:45.052" style="s2">bankrupt one brings creditors.</p>
<p begin="01:32:42.352" end="01:32:46.452" style="s2">Say something.</p>
<p begin="01:32:45.052" end="01:32:48.552" style="s2">Celeste.</p>
<p begin="01:32:46.452" end="01:32:50.184" style="s2">&gt;&gt; He shouldn&#39;t have followed me.</p>
<p begin="01:32:48.552" end="01:32:52.204" style="s2">&gt;&gt; There you are.</p>
<p begin="01:32:50.184" end="01:32:52.204" style="s2">[clears throat]</p>
<p begin="01:32:57.352" end="01:33:01.452" style="s2">CELESTE!</p>
<p begin="01:32:59.153" end="01:33:01.452" style="s2">CELESTE!</p>
<p begin="01:33:06.552" end="01:33:10.653" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Adrian Whitwill, we&#39;ve been looking for</p>
<p begin="01:33:08.552" end="01:33:11.752" style="s2">you. Your guarantee is due, and somebody</p>
<p begin="01:33:10.653" end="01:33:13.352" style="s2">has to pay.</p>
<p begin="01:33:11.752" end="01:33:15.252" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You took the operating cash, the</p>
<p begin="01:33:13.352" end="01:33:17.653" style="s2">offshore transfers, the collection.</p>
<p begin="01:33:15.252" end="01:33:19.252" style="s2">Celeste stole it all.</p>
<p begin="01:33:17.653" end="01:33:21.653" style="s2">Celeste took everything.</p>
<p begin="01:33:19.252" end="01:33:21.653" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="01:33:24.352" end="01:33:28.552" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The guarantee is due today. I don&#39;t have</p>
<p begin="01:33:26.252" end="01:33:29.952" style="s2">$5 billion. Then Whitmore assets cover</p>
<p begin="01:33:28.552" end="01:33:33.052" style="s2">it. You&#39;re late.</p>
<p begin="01:33:29.952" end="01:33:33.052" style="s2">Someone already emptied them.</p>
<p begin="01:33:34.153" end="01:33:36.052" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They&#39;re taking everything?</p>
<p begin="01:33:35.153" end="01:33:37.752" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Anything legally attached to the</p>
<p begin="01:33:36.052" end="01:33:39.052" style="s2">guarantee.</p>
<p begin="01:33:37.752" end="01:33:43.052" style="s2">We lost access to three operating</p>
<p begin="01:33:39.052" end="01:33:43.052" style="s2">accounts. Payroll, 48 hours.</p>
<p begin="01:33:46.752" end="01:33:50.752" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What do you mean everything?</p>
<p begin="01:33:49.752" end="01:33:51.852" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And then?</p>
<p begin="01:33:50.752" end="01:33:54.153" style="s2">Then we liquidate.</p>
<p begin="01:33:51.852" end="01:33:54.952" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I was deceived. Your signature is real.</p>
<p begin="01:33:54.153" end="01:33:56.452" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know.</p>
<p begin="01:33:54.952" end="01:33:57.154" style="s2">&gt;&gt; She lied about what I was signing. That</p>
<p begin="01:33:56.452" end="01:33:57.854" style="s2">sounds like a problem</p>
<p begin="01:33:57.154" end="01:33:59.354" style="s2">&gt;&gt; for your lawyer.</p>
<p begin="01:33:57.854" end="01:34:01.054" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t have time for a lawyer. Then</p>
<p begin="01:33:59.354" end="01:34:03.454" style="s2">tell us where the money went.</p>
<p begin="01:34:01.054" end="01:34:07.454" style="s2">Celeste Whitmore, where is she?</p>
<p begin="01:34:03.454" end="01:34:07.454" style="s2">Inside. With Gideon Voss.</p>
<p begin="01:34:07.854" end="01:34:11.854" style="s2">Where&#39;s our money? She took it.</p>
<p begin="01:34:11.954" end="01:34:15.354" style="s2">She took the operating cash, the</p>
<p begin="01:34:13.554" end="01:34:17.854" style="s2">offshore transfers, the collection.</p>
<p begin="01:34:15.354" end="01:34:19.454" style="s2">Celeste stole it all.</p>
<p begin="01:34:17.854" end="01:34:21.354" style="s2">Celeste took everything.</p>
<p begin="01:34:19.454" end="01:34:23.254" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="01:34:21.354" end="01:34:24.254" style="s2">She wouldn&#39;t.</p>
<p begin="01:34:23.254" end="01:34:26.654" style="s2">Adrian?</p>
<p begin="01:34:24.254" end="01:34:26.654" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Adrian?</p>
<p begin="01:34:27.554" end="01:34:32.554" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Keys.</p>
<p begin="01:34:29.554" end="01:34:32.554" style="s2">Vehicle is collateral.</p>
<p begin="01:34:37.605" end="01:34:41.654" style="s2">[clears throat]</p>
<p begin="01:34:38.354" end="01:34:44.155" style="s2">You still owe 5 billion.</p>
<p begin="01:34:41.654" end="01:34:46.175" style="s2">So unless you have something useful</p>
<p begin="01:34:44.155" end="01:34:46.175" style="s2">[screaming and groaning]</p>
<p begin="01:34:54.954" end="01:34:57.454" style="s2">Nia.</p>
<p begin="01:34:56.354" end="01:35:00.054" style="s2">He said he didn&#39;t want you hearing where</p>
<p begin="01:34:57.454" end="01:35:00.054" style="s2">they were going.</p>
<p begin="01:35:02.054" end="01:35:03.954" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s enough.</p>
<p begin="01:35:03.054" end="01:35:04.954" style="s2">&gt;&gt; This isn&#39;t your debt.</p>
<p begin="01:35:03.954" end="01:35:06.354" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then stop hitting me with it.</p>
<p begin="01:35:04.954" end="01:35:07.754" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Security footage is preserved and law</p>
<p begin="01:35:06.354" end="01:35:11.454" style="s2">enforcement has your location. He still</p>
<p begin="01:35:07.754" end="01:35:11.454" style="s2">owes 5 billion then collected in court.</p>
<p begin="01:35:13.254" end="01:35:14.954" style="s2">Why did you come?</p>
<p begin="01:35:13.954" end="01:35:15.554" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Because Marcus found your last vehicle</p>
<p begin="01:35:14.954" end="01:35:16.354" style="s2">location.</p>
<p begin="01:35:15.554" end="01:35:17.754" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s not what I asked.</p>
<p begin="01:35:16.354" end="01:35:18.854" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Don&#39;t confuse this with forgiveness. You</p>
<p begin="01:35:17.754" end="01:35:20.154" style="s2">called me a thief. You blocked me from</p>
<p begin="01:35:18.854" end="01:35:20.754" style="s2">saving grandpa. You defended Celeste</p>
<p begin="01:35:20.154" end="01:35:22.854" style="s2">every time.</p>
<p begin="01:35:20.754" end="01:35:23.954" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I know. I was cruel to you and stupid.</p>
<p begin="01:35:22.854" end="01:35:26.454" style="s2">Both were choices.</p>
<p begin="01:35:23.954" end="01:35:26.454" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Get in the car.</p>
<p begin="01:35:26.754" end="01:35:29.954" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I saw Voss inside the warehouse. Celeste</p>
<p begin="01:35:29.054" end="01:35:30.654" style="s2">called him Mr. Voss.</p>
<p begin="01:35:29.954" end="01:35:31.754" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You&#39;re certain?</p>
<p begin="01:35:30.654" end="01:35:34.254" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Silver snake ring. He asked if you</p>
<p begin="01:35:31.754" end="01:35:35.354" style="s2">touched the relic. Celeste said no.</p>
<p begin="01:35:34.254" end="01:35:37.454" style="s2">He said he didn&#39;t want you hearing where</p>
<p begin="01:35:35.354" end="01:35:38.654" style="s2">they were going.</p>
<p begin="01:35:37.454" end="01:35:40.554" style="s2">They destroyed the video.</p>
<p begin="01:35:38.654" end="01:35:41.754" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then what do we have?</p>
<p begin="01:35:40.554" end="01:35:43.954" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What is that?</p>
<p begin="01:35:41.754" end="01:35:45.154" style="s2">A key.</p>
<p begin="01:35:43.954" end="01:35:46.754" style="s2">I saw one of Voss&#39;s men use it on a</p>
<p begin="01:35:45.154" end="01:35:48.954" style="s2">shipping console. You memorized it? I</p>
<p begin="01:35:46.754" end="01:35:49.554" style="s2">wrote it down before they threw me out.</p>
<p begin="01:35:48.954" end="01:35:50.754" style="s2">&gt;&gt; These are routes.</p>
<p begin="01:35:49.554" end="01:35:51.354" style="s2">&gt;&gt; And transaction windows. How many</p>
<p begin="01:35:50.754" end="01:35:52.954" style="s2">objects?</p>
<p begin="01:35:51.354" end="01:35:54.054" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Hundreds.</p>
<p begin="01:35:52.954" end="01:35:56.054" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 37 relics?</p>
<p begin="01:35:54.054" end="01:35:56.854" style="s2">&gt;&gt; At least. When? The International</p>
<p begin="01:35:56.054" end="01:35:57.654" style="s2">Heritage Summit?</p>
<p begin="01:35:56.854" end="01:35:58.654" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 3 days from now.</p>
<p begin="01:35:57.654" end="01:36:00.156" style="s2">&gt;&gt; That&#39;s not a coincidence.</p>
<p begin="01:35:58.654" end="01:36:02.055" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No. It&#39;s cover.</p>
<p begin="01:36:00.156" end="01:36:02.856" style="s2">This came off one of Celeste&#39;s boxes.</p>
<p begin="01:36:02.055" end="01:36:03.656" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Summit?</p>
<p begin="01:36:02.856" end="01:36:04.156" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m coming with you.</p>
<p begin="01:36:03.656" end="01:36:05.356" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="01:36:04.156" end="01:36:06.656" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Celeste is there because of me.</p>
<p begin="01:36:05.356" end="01:36:07.156" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Celeste is there because of Celeste.</p>
<p begin="01:36:06.656" end="01:36:08.356" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I helped her.</p>
<p begin="01:36:07.156" end="01:36:09.656" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Then help us with what you know. Don&#39;t</p>
<p begin="01:36:08.356" end="01:36:10.555" style="s2">confuse guilt with usefulness.</p>
<p begin="01:36:09.656" end="01:36:11.555" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Will you ever forgive me?</p>
<p begin="01:36:10.555" end="01:36:12.356" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t know.</p>
<p begin="01:36:11.555" end="01:36:13.756" style="s2">But this is the first time you&#39;ve helped</p>
<p begin="01:36:12.356" end="01:36:15.156" style="s2">without asking me to erase what you did.</p>
<p begin="01:36:13.756" end="01:36:16.455" style="s2">Voss knows I can hear relics, so then I</p>
<p begin="01:36:15.156" end="01:36:17.955" style="s2">don&#39;t have to find a way inside. I just</p>
<p begin="01:36:16.455" end="01:36:18.856" style="s2">have to make sure he sees me coming. He</p>
<p begin="01:36:17.955" end="01:36:20.055" style="s2">knows I can hear relics.</p>
<p begin="01:36:18.856" end="01:36:20.455" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Which is exactly why you shouldn&#39;t go</p>
<p begin="01:36:20.055" end="01:36:23.955" style="s2">near him.</p>
<p begin="01:36:20.455" end="01:36:23.955" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Or exactly why he&#39;ll let me close.</p>
<p begin="01:36:25.856" end="01:36:28.356" style="s2">Run every image against missing cultural</p>
