<p begin="01:43:27.506" end="01:43:29.526" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [screaming]</p>
<p begin="01:43:30.459" end="01:43:32.959" style="s2">&gt;&gt; DON&#39;T STOP.</p>
<p begin="01:43:31.859" end="01:43:35.559" style="s2">NOT BECAUSE OF ME.</p>
<p begin="01:43:32.959" end="01:43:35.559" style="s2">&gt;&gt; ADRIAN.</p>
<p begin="01:43:36.559" end="01:43:39.859" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Is it over?</p>
<p begin="01:43:37.659" end="01:43:42.259" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No. You paused it.</p>
<p begin="01:43:39.859" end="01:43:44.559" style="s2">The heart is behind the relic wall.</p>
<p begin="01:43:42.259" end="01:43:47.559" style="s2">What happens at zero? Fire below.</p>
<p begin="01:43:44.559" end="01:43:47.559" style="s2">Everything falls.</p>
<p begin="01:43:48.659" end="01:43:54.759" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Help. Home. Home. Open us.</p>
<p begin="01:43:52.659" end="01:43:55.672" style="s2">&gt;&gt; One at a time.</p>
<p begin="01:43:54.759" end="01:43:56.759" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Enough.</p>
<p begin="01:43:55.672" end="01:43:58.759" style="s2">&gt;&gt; [groaning]</p>
<p begin="01:43:56.759" end="01:44:02.259" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They heard you.</p>
<p begin="01:43:58.759" end="01:44:02.259" style="s2">&gt;&gt; If you can hear me, show me the trigger.</p>
<p begin="01:44:05.359" end="01:44:09.259" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Behind the master trigger.</p>
<p begin="01:44:12.561" end="01:44:16.561" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You really are extraordinary.</p>
<p begin="01:44:14.361" end="01:44:18.561" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Let him go.</p>
<p begin="01:44:16.561" end="01:44:19.961" style="s2">&gt;&gt; The chalice is the antique lock. This is</p>
<p begin="01:44:18.561" end="01:44:20.861" style="s2">the modern key.</p>
<p begin="01:44:19.961" end="01:44:22.261" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What did you do?</p>
<p begin="01:44:20.861" end="01:44:23.061" style="s2">&gt;&gt; One metric ton beneath the structural</p>
<p begin="01:44:22.261" end="01:44:24.261" style="s2">supportings.</p>
<p begin="01:44:23.061" end="01:44:25.061" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You said we were leaving.</p>
<p begin="01:44:24.261" end="01:44:25.961" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Plans evolve.</p>
<p begin="01:44:25.061" end="01:44:26.861" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Wake up.</p>
<p begin="01:44:25.961" end="01:44:27.561" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Command us.</p>
<p begin="01:44:26.861" end="01:44:28.561" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What did you do?</p>
<p begin="01:44:27.561" end="01:44:29.361" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I didn&#39;t. They did.</p>
<p begin="01:44:28.561" end="01:44:29.661" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Not finished.</p>
<p begin="01:44:29.361" end="01:44:30.861" style="s2">&gt;&gt; What?</p>
<p begin="01:44:29.661" end="01:44:32.361" style="s2">&gt;&gt; One heart remains.</p>
<p begin="01:44:30.861" end="01:44:34.661" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Redundancy, always have a second</p>
<p begin="01:44:32.361" end="01:44:34.661" style="s2">trigger.</p>
<p begin="01:44:34.861" end="01:44:39.061" style="s2">&gt;&gt; FEDERAL TASK FORCE, HANDS WHERE WE CAN</p>
<p begin="01:44:36.661" end="01:44:39.061" style="s2">SEE THEM.</p>
<p begin="01:44:40.961" end="01:44:46.561" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Behind the dead wall. The secondary</p>
<p begin="01:44:43.361" end="01:44:46.561" style="s2">trigger is behind this wall.</p>
<p begin="01:44:46.861" end="01:44:50.361" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Adrian.</p>
<p begin="01:44:47.661" end="01:44:50.361" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Not this time.</p>
<p begin="01:44:53.261" end="01:44:56.061" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Cut the wire.</p>
<p begin="01:45:01.161" end="01:45:03.961" style="s2">&gt;&gt; It isn&#39;t the wire.</p>
<p begin="01:45:04.361" end="01:45:06.761" style="s2">Safe.</p>
<p begin="01:45:07.261" end="01:45:11.361" style="s2">&gt;&gt; FEDERAL TASK FORCE, HANDS WHERE WE CAN</p>
<p begin="01:45:08.961" end="01:45:11.361" style="s2">SEE THEM.</p>
<p begin="01:45:19.161" end="01:45:21.961" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You did this.</p>
<p begin="01:45:20.561" end="01:45:23.161" style="s2">You took everything from me.</p>
<p begin="01:45:21.961" end="01:45:24.961" style="s2">&gt;&gt; No.</p>
<p begin="01:45:23.161" end="01:45:27.961" style="s2">I never wanted your place.</p>
<p begin="01:45:24.961" end="01:45:27.961" style="s2">You destroyed it yourself.</p>
<p begin="01:45:29.761" end="01:45:32.861" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Useful enough?</p>
<p begin="01:45:31.561" end="01:45:35.761" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Useful?</p>
<p begin="01:45:32.861" end="01:45:35.761" style="s2">We&#39;ll work on the rest.</p>
<p begin="01:45:40.472" end="01:45:42.492" style="s2">[clears throat]</p>
<p begin="01:45:42.961" end="01:45:45.361" style="s2">Home.</p>
<p begin="01:45:47.961" end="01:45:53.761" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You returned what everyone tried to own.</p>
<p begin="01:45:51.161" end="01:45:56.261" style="s2">&gt;&gt; They never belonged to us.</p>
<p begin="01:45:53.761" end="01:45:56.261" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Exactly.</p>
<p begin="01:45:56.461" end="01:46:00.661" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I&#39;m sorry.</p>
<p begin="01:45:57.961" end="01:46:02.161" style="s2">I know it doesn&#39;t fix anything.</p>
<p begin="01:46:00.661" end="01:46:04.461" style="s2">No.</p>
<p begin="01:46:02.161" end="01:46:05.561" style="s2">But it&#39;s honest.</p>
<p begin="01:46:04.461" end="01:46:07.261" style="s2">&gt;&gt; First year?</p>
<p begin="01:46:05.561" end="01:46:08.561" style="s2">&gt;&gt; 43 cases.</p>
<p begin="01:46:07.261" end="01:46:10.961" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Ambitious.</p>
<p begin="01:46:08.561" end="01:46:12.761" style="s2">&gt;&gt; You knew that already.</p>
<p begin="01:46:10.961" end="01:46:14.863" style="s2">&gt;&gt; I don&#39;t want your shares,</p>
<p begin="01:46:12.761" end="01:46:16.562" style="s2">your stone, your name,</p>
<p begin="01:46:14.863" end="01:46:18.262" style="s2">and I don&#39;t want to own your future.</p>
<p begin="01:46:16.562" end="01:46:20.863" style="s2">I just want to share it.</p>
<p begin="01:46:18.262" end="01:46:20.863" style="s2">Will you marry me?</p>
<p begin="01:46:20.962" end="01:46:25.162" style="s2">&gt;&gt; One condition. Carter stays.</p>
<p begin="01:46:23.262" end="01:46:26.762" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Good. I like Carter.</p>
<p begin="01:46:25.162" end="01:46:28.762" style="s2">&gt;&gt; Yes.</p>
<p begin="01:46:26.762" end="01:46:31.162" style="s2">Blood can tell you where you came from,</p>
<p begin="01:46:28.762" end="01:46:33.602" style="s2">but it doesn&#39;t decide who you become.</p>
<p begin="01:46:31.162" end="01:46:33.602" style="s2">That part is mine. [music]</p>
</div>
</body>
</tt>
